{"id": "23620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23620", "title": "Kanseri y'igifu", "text": "Kanseri y'igifu (mu cyongereza \"stomach cancer\" cyangwa \"gastric cancer\"), izwi kandi nka kanseri yo mu gifu, ni kanseri ituruka ku gahu k'imbere k'igifu, iterwa no gukura bidasanzwe kw'uturemangingo. Impamvu yayo ikunze kugaragara ni ubwandu bwa bagiteri \"Helicobacter pylori\". Ibimenyetso bya mbere ni nko kuribwa mu gifu, kubabara mu nda yo hejuru, isesemi no kubura ubushake bwo kurya.\nIsuzumwa hakoreshejwe \"biopsy\" ifatwa mu gihe cya \"endoscopy\". Ivurwa no kubagwa, imiti ya kanseri n'imirasire; iyo itahuwe hakiri kare ishobora gukira. Ku isi, ni imwe muri kanseri eshanu zikunze kugaragara, ikaba ikunze kwibasira cyane Aziya y'Iburasirazuba n'Burayi bw'Iburasirazuba.\nUbwoko n'ibimenyetso.\nInyinshi muri kanseri z'igifu ni \"carcinoma\" (cyane cyane \"adenocarcinoma\") zituruka ku turemangingo tw'agahu k'imbere k'igifu. \"Lymphoma\" n'ibibyimba bya \"mesenchyme\" nabyo bishobora kugaragara mu gifu.\nIbimenyetso bya mbere bishobora kuba kuribwa mu gifu, kubabara mu nda yo hejuru, isesemi no kubura ubushake bwo kurya. Nyuma hashobora kuza kugabanuka kw'ibiro, guhinduka umuhondo k'uruhu n'umweru w'amaso, kuruka amaraso, kugorwa no kumira no kugaragara kw'amaraso mu musarani. Kanseri ishobora kuva mu gifu igakwirakwira mu bindi bice by'umubiri, cyane cyane umwijima, ibihaha, amagufwa, agahu gatwikiriye inda imbere n'imvubura z'amatembabuzi (\"lymph nodes\").\nImpamvu n'ibyago.\nImpamvu ikunze kugaragara ni ubwandu bwa \"Helicobacter pylori\", bugaragara ku barwayi barenga 60%. Ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bwa \"H. pylori\" bufite ibyago byinshi kurusha ubundi. Kunywa itabi, imirire (nko kurya imboga zibitswe mu munyu) n'umubyibuho ukabije byongera ibyago. Hafi 10% by'abarwayi bafite abo mu muryango bayirwaye, naho hagati ya 1% na 3% bayiterwa n'indwara z'uruhererekane. Akenshi kanseri y'igifu ikura buhoro buhoro mu myaka myinshi.\nGusuzuma.\nGusuzuma iyi ndwara bikorwa akenshi hafatwa agace k'urugingo (\"biopsy\") mu gihe cya \"endoscopy\". Hakurikiraho ibindi bizamini byerekana niba yarakwirakwiriye mu bindi bice by'umubiri. Ubuyapani na Koreya y'Epfo, ibihugu bibiri bifite igipimo cyo hejuru cy'iyi ndwara, bisuzuma abaturage kugira ngo iyi kanseri itahurwe hakiri kare.\nKwirinda no kuvura.\nIndyo yo mu karere ka Mediterane no kureka itabi bigabanya ibyago byo kurwara kanseri y'igifu. Hari ibimenyetso bigaragaza ko kuvura ubwandu bwa \"H. pylori\" bigabanya ibyago mu gihe kizaza.\nIyo kanseri y'igifu ivuwe hakiri kare, ishobora gukira. Ubuvuzi bushobora kuba kubaga, imiti ya kanseri (\"chimioth\u00e9rapie\"), imirasire n'ubuvuzi bugamije (\"targeted therapy\"). Iyo itahuwe itinze, hatangwa ubuvuzi bugabanya ububabare. Ubwoko bumwe bwa \"lymphoma\" y'igifu bushobora kuvurwa no kurandura \"H. pylori\".\nAkenshi iyi ndwara irangira nabi: mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba, abarwayi bafite kanseri yageze kure barenga imyaka itanu bari munsi ya 10%, kuko abenshi bayitahura yaramaze gukomera. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, abarwayi bagera kuri 39,8% barenza imyaka itanu, mu gihe muri Koreya y'Epfo barenga 65% naho mu Buyapani barenga 70%, ahanini bitewe n'isuzuma rikorwa hakiri kare.\nIkwirakwizwa.\nKu isi yose, kanseri y'igifu ni imwe muri kanseri zikunze kugaragara n'izica abantu benshi. Mu 2022, abantu 968 350 bayirwaye bwa mbere, ihitana abantu 659 853. Mbere y'imyaka ya 1930, mu bice byinshi by'isi, harimo n'ibihugu byinshi byateye imbere by'Iburengerazuba, ni yo yari intandaro ya mbere y'impfu zikomoka kuri kanseri. Kuva icyo gihe, igipimo cy'impfu cyaragabanutse mu bice byinshi by'isi. Ibi bikekwa ko biterwa no kugabanuka kw'ibiryo birimo umunyu mwinshi n'ibibitswe mu munyu, bitewe n'iterambere rya firigo mu kubika ibiryo. Ikunze kugaragara cyane muri Aziya y'Iburasirazuba, igakurikirwa n'Uburayi bw'Iburasirazuba. Ifata abagabo inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagore."}
{"id": "23627", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23627", "title": "Henri Blanchard", "text": "Henri Blanchard ni umupadiri wa Kiliziya Gatolika. Ni Umufaransa. Ari mu muryango w'Abapadiri Bera (Abamisiyoneri ba Afurika). Mu 1994, yari umupadiri muri paruwasi ya Mutagatifu Andereya i Nyamirambo, muri Kigali.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Henri Blanchard yakiriye impunzi muri paruwasi ye. Yarinze abana benshi ari kumwe na Padiri Otto Mayer. Ku ya 10 Kamena 1994, Interahamwe zatwaye impunzi zari muri iyo paruwasi. Nyuma ya jenoside, Henri Blanchard yagarutse mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima.\nMu gihe cya jenoside.\nHenri Blanchard yari umumisiyoneri i Kigali. Yabaga muri paruwasi ya Mutagatifu Andereya i Nyamirambo. Yakoranaga na Padiri Otto Mayer. Otto Mayer ni umupadiri w'Umudage.\nJenoside itangiye, Henri Blanchard yakinguriye kiliziya ye impunzi amagana. Bukeye bwaho, abasirikare n'interahamwe bamennye inzugi. Henri Blanchard yabaze abantu 15 bishwe.\nNyuma yaho, abo bapadiri bombi bacumbikiye abana 55 n'abagore bamwe. Shapeli ya paruwasi yahindutse aho abana bato baryama. Croix-Rouge yabazaniraga ibiribwa buri cyumweru. Henri Blanchard yavuze ko tudafite uburenganzira bwo kwibagirwa ubwicanyi nk'ubwo.\nKu wa Gatanu, tariki ya 10 Kamena 1994, interahamwe zaje kuri paruwasi. Zavuze ko zije kwimura abasivili. Zarashe ku nzugi. Zateye mu nzu igisasu cy'ibyuka biryana mu maso. Interahamwe zatwaye impunzi zigera ku 170 imbere y'abo bapadiri bombi. Otto Mayer yarakomeretse. Nyuma, abapadiri babonye imirambo y'abantu bagera kuri cumi na babiri muri abo bajyanywe.\nNyuma ya jenoside.\nHenri Blanchard yavuye i Kigali muri Kamena 1994. Yasubiye mu Bufaransa gutanga ubuhamya. Ku ya 3 Nzeri 1994, yagarutse mu Rwanda. Ni we wa mbere mu Bapadiri Bera wagarutse kuba mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside. Mu 1997, yanditse ko kongera kubaka igihugu bizasaba imbaraga nyinshi n'ubutwari bwinshi."}
{"id": "23628", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23628", "title": "Luc Marchal", "text": "Luc Marchal ni umusirikare w'Umubiligi uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru. Afite ipeti rya koloneli. Mu 1993\u20131994, yayoboye ingabo z'Ububiligi zari muri MINUAR. Yari kandi umuyobozi w'ingabo za MINUAR mu karere ka Kigali.\nMuri Mutarama 1994, Luc Marchal yahuye n'umuntu wamenyesheje MINUAR ko Interahamwe zitegura kwica Abatutsi. Ku ya 7 Mata 1994, abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi yayoboraga bishwe i Kigali. Urukiko rwa gisirikare rw'Ububiligi rwamugize umwere mu 1996.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga mbere y'u Rwanda.\nMu 1994, Luc Marchal yari amaze imyaka 30 mu ngabo z'Ububiligi. Imyaka 15 muri yo yayimaze mu mutwe w'abakomando (\"para-commandos\"). Mbere yo kujya mu Rwanda, yari umuyobozi w'ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Ingabo w'Ububiligi. Yari yarakoze imyaka itanu muri Zayire, ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMuri MINUAR (1993\u20131994).\nLuc Marchal yageze mu Rwanda ku ya 9 Ukuboza 1993. Yayoboraga abasirikare b'Ababiligi bagera kuri 440 bari muri MINUAR. Abo basirikare ni bo bari bafite imyitozo n'ibikoresho byiza kurusha abandi. Umuyobozi mukuru wa MINUAR yari Rom\u00e9o Dallaire.\nLuc Marchal yari ashinzwe akarere ka Kigali. Inshingano ye ya mbere yari ukugenzura agace ka Kigali katagombaga kubamo intwaro. Ako gace kari gafite ibilometero 10 uvuye mu mujyi rwagati. Muri ako gace, ingabo zagombaga kubika intwaro zazo. Iki cyemezo cyari mu Masezerano ya Arusha.\nMuri Mutarama 1994, Luc Marchal yahuye n'umuntu wiyitaga \u00abJean-Pierre\u00bb. Uwo muntu yatozaga Interahamwe. Yavuze ko Interahamwe zihabwa intwaro. Yavuze kandi ko hari urutonde rw'Abatutsi bo kwica. Yerekanye aho intwaro zihishwe. Luc Marchal yateguye ibitero byo gufata izo ntwaro. Icyicaro cy'Umuryango w'Abibumbye i New York cyanze ko bikorwa.\nMuri jenoside na nyuma yayo.\nKu ya 7 Mata 1994, abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR biciwe muri Camp Kigali. Bari barinze Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana.\nMu Bubiligi, Luc Marchal yashinjwe uburangare mu rukiko rwa gisirikare. Bamushinjaga ko uburangare bwe bwatumye abo basirikare icumi bapfa. Mu 1996, urukiko rwamugize umwere.\nMu 2001, Luc Marchal yasohoye igitabo \"Rwanda: la descente aux enfers\". Muri icyo gitabo, avuga ibyo yabonye mu Rwanda.\nMu 2007, Luc Marchal yatanze ubuhamya mu rubanza rwa Bernard Ntuyahaga mu Bubiligi. Ntuyahaga yari majoro mu ngabo z'u Rwanda. Muri Nyakanga 2007, urukiko rwamuhamije kwica abo basirikare b'Ababiligi. Yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka 20.\nMuri Mutarama 2008, Luc Marchal yatanze ubuhamya mu Rukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda, i Arusha. Yatanze ubuhamya ashinjura jenerali Augustin Ndindiliyimana."}
{"id": "23629", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23629", "title": "Bernard Ntuyahaga", "text": "Bernard Ntuyahaga (yavutse ahagana mu 1952) ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari majoro mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR). Mu 2007, urukiko rw'i Buruseli mu Ububiligi rwamuhamije kwica abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR. Abo basirikare bishwe ku ya 7 Mata 1994, mu ntangiriro za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nBernard Ntuyahaga yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka 20. Yarekuwe mu 2018. Ububiligi bwamwohereje mu Rwanda mu Ukuboza 2018.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nBernard Ntuyahaga yavukiye i Mabanza, muri Perefegitura ya Kibuye. Ubu ni mu Akarere ka Karongi. Ni Umuhutu. Mu 1972, yinjiye mu ishuri rya gisirikare ry'abofisiye i Kigali.\nUmwuga na jenoside.\nMu 1994, Bernard Ntuyahaga yari majoro mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR).\nKu ya 7 Mata 1994, abasirikare ba FAR bagose urugo rwa Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Urwo rugo rwarindwaga n'abasirikare 15 ba MINUAR. Batanu bari Abanyagana, icumi bari Ababiligi. Abo basirikare bambuwe intwaro. Agathe Uwilingiyimana n'umugabo we barishwe.\nUrukiko rw'Ububiligi rwemeje ko Bernard Ntuyahaga yajyanye abo basirikare icumi b'Ababiligi muri Camp Kigali. Aho ni ho abasirikare b'Abanyarwanda babiciye. Uyu munsi, aho hantu hari Urwibutso rw'Abasirikare b'Ababiligi.\nUrubanza.\nMuri Kamena 1998, Bernard Ntuyahaga yishyikirije Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR) i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. TPIR yamureze jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Ku ya 18 Werurwe 1999, TPIR yakuyeho ibyo birego. Uwo munsi, Tanzaniya yaramufashe. U Rwanda n'Ububiligi byombi byasabaga ko abyoherezwamo.\nMu 2004, Bernard Ntuyahaga yagiye mu Bubiligi. Yishyikirije ubutabera bw'Ububiligi. Urubanza rwe rwatangiye ku ya 19 Mata 2007 imbere y'urukiko rwa rubanda (\"Cour d'assises\") rw'i Buruseli. Luc Marchal yatanze ubuhamya muri urwo rubanza.\nKu ya 4 Nyakanga 2007, urukiko rwamuhamije kwica abo basirikare icumi b'Ababiligi. Rwamuhamije kandi kwica abasivili b'Abanyarwanda batazwi umubare. Ntiyahamijwe kwica Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka 20.\nNyuma y'igifungo.\nBernard Ntuyahaga yarangije igihano cye ku ya 2 Kamena 2018. Yashakaga kujya kubana n'umugore we n'umukobwa we muri Danimarike. Ntiyashakaga gusubira mu Rwanda.\nKu ya 21 Ukuboza 2018, Ububiligi bwamwohereje mu Rwanda. Leta y'u Rwanda yari yatanze icyizere cyanditse ko uburenganzira bwe buzubahirizwa. Mu Rwanda, Bernard Ntuyahaga ntiyafunzwe kandi ntiyongeye kuburanishwa. Yoherejwe mu kigo cya Mutobo. Aho yize amateka y'u Rwanda. Nyuma yahawe indangamuntu y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "23630", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23630", "title": "Ubwicanyi bwa Bagogwe", "text": "Ubwicanyi bwa Bagogwe ni ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abagogwe mu 1991. Abagogwe ni itsinda ry'Abatutsi b'aborozi bo mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Ubwo bwicanyi bwabereye mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Gisenyi n'iya Ruhengeri.\nAbagogwe bagera ku 1\u00a0000 barishwe. Bishwe n'inzego z'umutekano n'udutsiko tw'Abahutu. Bamwe babona ubu bwicanyi nk'intangiriro ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nAbagogwe.\nAbagogwe ni aborozi babaga hafi y'ishyamba ry'Ibirunga. Kuva mu 1959, Abahutu bo mu majyaruguru babafataga nk'abantu bo hasi. Ubutegetsi bwose bwakurikiyeho bwabahejeje inyuma.\nUbwicanyi.\nMu 1990, FPR Inkotanyi yateye u Rwanda. Ku wa 23 Mutarama 1991, Inkotanyi zateye umujyi wa Ruhengeri. Zafunguye abafungwa barenga 700 bo muri gereza ya Ruhengeri. Nyuma y'icyo gitero, ubwicanyi bwibasiye Abagogwe. Ubwicanyi bukomeye bwabaye hagati ya Mutarama na Gashyantare 1991. Bwakomeje kugeza muri Werurwe 1991.\nI Kinigi, abaturage bategetswe kurwanya \u00ababanzi\u00bb. Ibyo byiswe \u00abumuganda wihariye\u00bb. Samuel Ndagijimana yishwe atewe amabuye ku isoko rya Bisate. Bamushinjaga kuba Umututsi n'intasi. Imibiri imwe yajugunywe mu cyobo cy'imyanda cy'urugo rwa burugumesitiri wa Kinigi. I Gisenyi, imibiri imwe y'Abagogwe yajugunywe ahitwa Commune Rouge.\nMu 1992, Amnesty International yavuze ko Abagogwe bagera ku 1\u00a0000 bishwe. Yavuze ko bishwe n'inzego z'umutekano n'udutsiko tw'Abahutu. Umusirikare wahatangiye ubuhamya avuga ko yari i Bigogwe igihe cy'ubwicanyi. Avuga ko abasirikare b'u Rwanda babugizemo uruhare.\nIperereza.\nLeta yahishe amakuru. Yanze gutanga impapuro z'urupfu. Yavugaga ko abantu babuze bagiye muri FPR. Imiryango ine itegamiye kuri leta yashinze komisiyo mpuzamahanga y'iperereza. Iyo komisiyo yari igizwe n'impuguke icumi mu burenganzira bwa muntu. Umunyamategeko w'Umubiligi Eric Gillet yagize uruhare muri iryo perereza. Iperereza ryasanze imva rusange nto nyinshi. Buri mva yarimo abantu 10 kugeza kuri 20. Zimwe zari mu busitani bwa burugumesitiri wa Kinigi.\nIsano na Jenoside.\nBamwe babona ubwicanyi bwa Bagogwe nk'intangiriro ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Mu 1994, Abatutsi benshi bo mu karere ka Bigogwe barishwe. Abazize Jenoside bo muri ako karere bashyinguwe mu Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bigogwe."}
{"id": "23633", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23633", "title": "Ubwicanyi bwa Kibilira", "text": "Ubwicanyi bwa Kibilira ni ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi mu Kwakira 1990. Bwabereye muri komini Kibilira, mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Bwabaye nyuma gato y'igitero cya FPR Inkotanyi cyo ku wa 1 Ukwakira 1990.\nAbatutsi barenga 300 barishwe. Abayobozi b'ibanze ni bo bashishikarije Abahutu kwica abaturanyi babo b'Abatutsi. Ubu bwicanyi ni bumwe mu bwa mbere bwabanjirije Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 1 Ukwakira 1990, FPR Inkotanyi yateye u Rwanda iturutse muri Ubugande. Abayobozi bakwirakwije ibinyoma bivuga ko Abatutsi bashaka kurimbura Abahutu. Ubwicanyi bwa mbere bwakorewe Abatutsi bwatangiye nyuma y'iminsi icumi.\nUbwicanyi.\nMu Kwakira 1990, abayobozi b'ibanze bashishikarije Abahutu gutera abaturanyi babo b'Abatutsi. Abatutsi barenga 300 barishwe. Abandi benshi barakomeretse.\nAbatutsi ibihumbi byinshi bahunze ingo zabo. Amazu amagana y'Abatutsi yarasahuwe kandi aratwikwa. Imyaka yabo yarangijwe. Amatungo yabo yarasahuwe.\nAbayobozi bohereje abapolisi babiri kuvuza amafirimbi. Ibyo byonyine byahagaritse ubwicanyi.\nNyuma y'ubwicanyi.\nLeta yirukanye superefe na burugumesitiri. Yabafunze hamwe n'abandi bakekwaga. Nyuma y'ibyumweru bike, bose bararekuwe nta rubanza. Burugumesitiri wa kera yahawe akazi gashya ka leta muri ako karere. Nta muntu wahamijwe icyaha kubera ubwo bwicanyi.\nIsano na Jenoside.\nHagati ya 1990 na 1993, ubwicanyi nk'ubu bwahitanye Abatutsi bagera ku 2\u00a0000. Bwahitanye kandi Abahutu bamwe. Human Rights Watch ibona ubu bwicanyi nk'imyitozo ya Jenoside yo mu 1994."}
{"id": "23634", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23634", "title": "Ubwicanyi bwa Bugesera", "text": "Ubwicanyi bwa Bugesera ni ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi mu Werurwe 1992. Bwabereye mu Bugesera, mu majyepfo ya Kigali. Bwakurikiye itangazo ry'ibinyoma ryanyuze kuri Radiyo Rwanda.\nAbatutsi bagera kuri 300 barishwe. Abantu barenga 15\u00a0000 barahunze. Ubu bwicanyi ni bumwe mu bwabanjirije Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nAmateka.\nAbatutsi benshi bari batuye mu Bugesera kuva mu 1959. Abahutu bavuye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba nabo baje gutura hafi yabo. Abayobozi b'ibanze bavugaga ko urubyiruko rw'Abatutsi rujya mu Uburundi kwinjira muri FPR. Ibyo byongereye urwango rw'Abahutu.\nMu mpera za Gashyantare no mu ntangiriro za Werurwe 1992, Hassan Ngeze yasuye Bugesera inshuro nyinshi. Ngeze yari umwanditsi mukuru w'ikinyamakuru Kangura. Yakwirakwije impapuro n'ibihuha ku bitero by'\u00abInyenzi\u00bb.\nItangazo rya Radiyo Rwanda.\nKu wa 3 Werurwe 1992, Radiyo Rwanda yatangaje inkuru y'ibinyoma inshuro eshanu. Iyo nkuru yavugaga ko Abatutsi bari bagiye kwica Abahutu bo mu Bugesera. Yavugaga cyane abanyapolitiki b'Abahutu. Icyo gihe, Radiyo Rwanda yari iyobowe na Ferdinand Nahimana, umuyobozi wa ORINFOR. Umunyamakuru Jean-Baptiste Bamwanga yirukanywe kuri Radiyo Rwanda mu 1992. Yashinjwaga kugira uruhare mu gushishikariza ubwo bwicanyi.\nUbwicanyi.\nUbwicanyi bwatangiye mu ijoro rikurikira iryo tangazo. Bwabereye muri Kanzenze, Gashora na Ngenda. Bwamaze iminsi igera ku icumi.\nAbayobozi b'ibanze ni bo bayoboye ibitero. Ku nshuro ya mbere, ubutegetsi bwakoresheje Interahamwe mu kwica Abatutsi. Burugumesitiri wa komini Kanzenze, Fid\u00e8le Rwambuka, avugwa nk'umwe mu bayoboye abicanyi. Abasirikare bambaye imyenda ya gisivili bifatanyije n'abicanyi. Abasirikare bambaye impuzankano bambuye Abatutsi intwaro. Babagumishije aho bari kugeza abicanyi bahageze.\nAbicanyi batwitse amazu y'Abatutsi. Abatutsi ibihumbi byinshi bahungiye kuri paruwasi gatolika ya Nyamata. Abantu barenga 15\u00a0000 bahungiye mu maparuwasi yo hafi no mu Burundi. Abayobozi ntibateye abari bahungiye mu nsengero. Ahubwo babakumiriye ibiryo n'amazi kugira ngo basubire iwabo.\nUrupfu rwa Antonia Locatelli.\nAntonia Locatelli yari umukorerabushake w'Umutaliyani. Yakoraga mu Rwanda kuva mu 1972. Yaterefonnye ambasaderi w'u Bubiligi, RFI na BBC. Yababwiye ibyaberaga mu Bugesera. Ku wa 9 Werurwe 1992, Locatelli yarashwe arapfa i Nyamata. Amnesty International ivuga ko yarashwe n'umusirikare. Locatelli ashyinguwe i Nyamata.\nNyuma y'ubwicanyi.\nAmashyirahamwe y'abahohotewe yajyanye abadipolomate mu Bugesera kureba ibyabaye. Abahutu benshi bateye barafashwe. Nta cyakorewe umusirikare warashe Locatelli. Nta muntu wahamijwe icyaha kubera ubwo bwicanyi.\nIsano na Jenoside.\nHuman Rights Watch ibona ubwicanyi bwa Bugesera nk'imyitozo ya Jenoside yo mu 1994. Hagati ya 1990 na 1993, ubwicanyi nk'ubu bwahitanye Abatutsi bagera ku 2\u00a0000. Mu 1994, Abatutsi ibihumbi byinshi biciwe muri kiliziya ya Nyamata. Uyu munsi iyo kiliziya ni Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamata."}
{"id": "23635", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23635", "title": "Ubwicanyi bw'Ishuri rya ETO", "text": "Ubwicanyi bw'Ishuri rya ETO ni ubwicanyi bwabaye ku wa 11 Mata 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Bwabereye ku ishuri rya ETO (\"\u00c9cole technique officielle\") i Kicukiro, muri Kigali, no ku musozi wa Nyanza.\nAbantu barenga 2\u00a0000 bari bahungiye kuri iryo shuri. Bari barinzwe n'ingabo z'Ababiligi za MINUAR. Izo ngabo zagiye ku wa 11 Mata 1994. Hafi ya bose bahise bicwa.\nUbuhungiro kuri ETO.\nJenoside imaze gutangira, abasivili barenga 2\u00a0000 bahungiye kuri ETO. Muri bo harimo abana amagana. Bari Abatutsi ahanini. Ingabo z'Ababiligi za MINUAR zari zifite ikigo kuri iryo shuri. Zari ziyobowe na Kapiteni Luc Lemaire.\nUbwicanyi.\nKu wa 7 Mata 1994, u Ububiligi bwafashe icyemezo cyo gucyura ingabo zabwo. Ku wa 11 Mata 1994, ingabo z'Ababiligi zavuye kuri ETO. Zagiye ku kibuga cy'indege gufasha mu gucyura abanyamahanga. Impunzi zasigaye nta wuzirinda.\nInterahamwe n'abasirikare ba leta bahise batera ETO. Bishe abari aho. Abarokotse bagerageje guhunga. Abasirikare babafashe babasubiza Interahamwe. Bajyanywe ku ngufu i Nyanza. Benshi biciwe mu nzira. Abandi bicirwa i Nyanza n'imbunda na gerenade. Mu bantu barenga 2\u00a0000, abagera kuri 50 gusa ni bo barokotse.\nImanza mu Bubiligi.\nAbarokotse n'imiryango y'abishwe bareze Leta y'u Bubiligi. Ku wa 8 Ukuboza 2010, urukiko rwa mbere rw'i Buruseli rwemeje ko icyemezo cyo kuva kuri ETO cyafashwe n'ubuyobozi bw'u Bubiligi. Ku wa 8 Kamena 2018, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwahinduye icyo cyemezo. Rwemeje ko inshingano ari iz'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Leta y'u Bubiligi n'abasirikare batatu bagizwe abere.\nKwibuka.\nBuri mwaka, ku wa 11 Mata, abantu bibuka abiciwe kuri ETO. Bakora urugendo rwo kwibuka kuva ku ishuri ryahoze ari ETO kugera ku Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro. Urwo rwibutso ni ikimenyetso cy'abatereranywe n'abari bashinzwe kubarinda. Ishuri ryahoze ari ETO ubu ni IPRC Kicukiro."}
{"id": "23636", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23636", "title": "Ubwicanyi bwa Ndera", "text": "Ubwicanyi bwa Ndera ni ubwicanyi bwabaye muri Mata 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Bwabereye i Ndera, mu burasirazuba bwa Kigali, cyane cyane ku bitaro by'indwara zo mu mutwe bya Ndera (CARAES Ndera).\nAbatutsi benshi bari bahungiye kuri ibyo bitaro. Biciwe hamwe n'abarwayi n'abakozi b'ibitaro. Abantu bagera ku 17\u00a0000 biciwe hafi y'ibitaro.\nUbuhungiro ku bitaro.\nJenoside yatangiye i Ndera ku wa 7 Mata 1994. Abatutsi bo mu nkengero bahungiye ku bitaro. Bibwiraga ko bazarindwa kuko hari Ababiligi. Ibyumba by'ibitaro byari byuzuye. Abarwayi bavanze n'impunzi.\nUbwicanyi.\nKu wa 17 Mata 1994, abasirikare b'Ababiligi bimuye abanyamahanga. Uwo munsi, abicanyi bateye ibitaro. Batangiye kurasa abantu. Abicanyi bari Interahamwe n'abasirikare ba leta. Abatutsi bagerageje kwirwanaho. Abasirikare bo mu kigo cya Kanombe baje gufasha Interahamwe.\nAbicanyi bakusanyije abantu mu mbuga. Batandukanyije Abahutu n'Abatutsi. Umubare nyawo w'abarwayi bishwe ntuzwi. Impamvu ni uko abarwayi bari bavanze n'impunzi.\nAbantu bagera ku 17\u00a0000 biciwe hafi y'ibitaro bya Ndera. Imibiri yabo yajugunywe mu cyobo kirekire cya metero 30.\nUrwibutso no kwibuka.\nI Ndera hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside. Rushyinguyemo abantu ibihumbi byinshi, barimo abarwayi n'impunzi. Imibiri y'abantu barenga 15\u00a0000 iracyari mu cyobo hafi y'ibitaro. Abarokotse basaba ko ishyingurwa mu cyubahiro. Ibitaro byatanze ubutaka bwo kwagura urwibutso.\nBuri mwaka, ku wa 17 Mata, abantu bibuka abiciwe ku bitaro bya Ndera."}
{"id": "23637", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23637", "title": "Bisesero", "text": "Bisesero ni imisozi iri mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, mu Akarere ka Karongi. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, Abatutsi ibihumbi byinshi bahahungiye. Barwanyije abicanyi amezi menshi.\nAbatutsi barenga 50\u00a0000 biciwe i Bisesero. Abagera ku 1\u00a0000 gusa ni bo barokotse. Uyu munsi hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero. Ruri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nUbuhungiro n'ukwirwanaho.\nKuva ku wa 7 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bagera ku 50\u00a0000 bahungiye i Bisesero. Bavaga i Kibuye no mu maperefegitura yegeranye. Abicanyi bageze i Bisesero ku wa 11 Mata 1994.\nImpunzi zirwanyeho ubwazo. Zatoye Aminadabu Birara ngo aziyobore. Birara yari afite imyaka 68. Abagabo barwanaga n'amacumu n'amabuye. Abagore n'abana babazaniraga amabuye n'amahiri.\nIbitero.\nKuva ku wa 9 Mata kugeza ku wa 30 Kamena 1994, Bisesero yatewe hafi buri munsi. Abicanyi bari abajandarume, abapolisi ba komini ya Gishyita na Gisovu, abasivili bitwaje intwaro n'Interahamwe.\nKu wa 13 Gicurasi 1994, igitero kinini cyagabwe ku musozi wa Muyira. Abatutsi ibihumbi byinshi barishwe. Abantu bagera kuri 300 baguye mu buvumo bwa Nyakavumu. Abicanyi bacanye umuriro ku muryango w'ubwo buvumo. Aminadabu Birara yishwe ku wa 25 Kamena 1994. Muri icyo gitero, Abatutsi bagera ku 5\u00a0000 barishwe.\nIngabo z'u Bufaransa.\nMu mpera za Kamena 1994, ingabo z'Ubufaransa zageze mu Rwanda mu gikorwa cyiswe \"Turquoise\". Icyo gihe i Bisesero hari hasigaye Abatutsi bagera ku 1\u00a0000 gusa.\nKu wa 27 Kamena 1994, abasirikare b'Abafaransa babonye impunzi za Bisesero. Ntibahise bazitabara. Bazitabaye ku wa 30 Kamena 1994. Hagati aho, Abatutsi amagana bariciwe.\nAbarokotse n'amashyirahamwe bareze abasirikare b'Abafaransa mu nkiko z'u Bufaransa. Babashinjaga ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside. Mu Kwakira 2023, abacamanza bafashe icyemezo cyo kudakurikirana urubanza. Urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwemeje icyo cyemezo mu Kuboza 2024. Ku wa 9 Nzeri 2026, Urukiko rusesa imanza narwo rwacyemeje.\nUbutabera.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwahamije abantu benshi ibyaha byakorewe i Bisesero. Alfred Musema yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu mu 2000. Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema nawe yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Obed Ruzindana yakatiwe imyaka 25. Eli\u00e9zer Niyitegeka yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu mu 2003.\nUrwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero rwashyizweho mu 1997. Ahantu ruri hashobora kuba harimo imibiri y'abantu 50\u00a0000 kugeza kuri 60\u00a0000. Ku wa 20 Nzeri 2023, UNESCO yashyize urwibutso rwa Bisesero ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi. Yarushyizeho hamwe n'inzibutso za Nyamata, Murambi na Gisozi."}
{"id": "23638", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23638", "title": "Mutarama 1998 ubwicanyi bwabereye i Gisenyi", "text": "Ubwicanyi bwo muri Mutarama 1998 i Gisenyi ni igitero cyagabwe kuri bisi y'abakozi b'uruganda rwa Bralirwa. Cyabaye ku wa 19 Mutarama 1998, hafi y'umujyi wa Gisenyi, mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda.\nAbantu bagera kuri 35 kugeza kuri 40 barishwe. Abandi benshi barakomeretse. Abishwe bari Abahutu n'Abatutsi.\nIgitero.\nMu gitondo cyo ku wa 19 Mutarama 1998, bisi yari itwaye abakozi ba Bralirwa. Bajyaga ku kazi. Bisi yatezwe ku muhanda munini, muri komini Nyamyumba, hafi ya Gisenyi.\nAbicanyi bategetse abakozi kwitandukanya bakurikije amoko. Abakozi batinze kubikora. Abicanyi bahise barasa abantu bose. Batwitse bisi, maze bahungira mu bihuru. Abishwe bari Abahutu n'Abatutsi.\nAbishwe.\nUmubare w'abishwe uratandukanye bitewe n'inkomoko. The Irish Times yavuze abantu 35 bishwe n'abarenga 30 bakomeretse. Amnesty International yavuze abantu bagera kuri 40 bishwe, muri bisi yari itwaye abantu bagera kuri 80.\nAbabikoze.\nAbenshi mu bo Amnesty International yabajije bavuze ko igitero cyakozwe n'imitwe yitwaje intwaro irwanya Leta. The Irish Times yavuze ko abicanyi bari inyeshyamba z'Abahutu. The New Times ibita \u00ababacengezi\u00bb.\nKwibuka.\nKu wa 19 Mutarama 2023, abishwe muri icyo gitero bibutswe nyuma y'imyaka 25. Hari urukuta rwo kubibuka hafi y'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gisenyi."}
{"id": "23639", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23639", "title": "Ikigeragezo cya Butare Bane", "text": "Ikigeragezo cya Butare Bane (mu Gifaransa: \"proc\u00e8s des Quatre de Butare\") ni urubanza rwabereye i Buruseli, mu Ububiligi, mu 2001. Abanyarwanda bane baburanishijwe ku byaha byakozwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, mu karere ka Butare.\nNi ubwa mbere inteko y'abaturage basanzwe (\"jury\") yo mu gihugu kimwe yaburanishije ibyaha by'intambara byakorewe mu kindi gihugu. Abaregwa bose uko ari bane bahamijwe ibyaha.\nAbaregwa.\nAbaregwa bari bane. Bose bari batuye mu Bubiligi.\nIbyaha baregwaga.\nAbabikira bombi baregwaga gutanga Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku kigo cy'ababikira cya Sovu. Babashyikirije Interahamwe. Ubushinjacyaha bwavuze ko ababikira batanze lisansi. Iyo lisansi yakoreshejwe mu gutwika igaraji ryari ryihishemo abantu bagera kuri 500. Abatutsi bagera ku 7\u00a0000 bishwe i Sovu muri Mata na Gicurasi 1994.\nVincent Ntezimana na Alphonse Higaniro baregwaga gushishikariza no gutegura ubwicanyi bw'Abatutsi mu karere ka Butare. Abaregwa bose bahakanye ibyaha.\nUrubanza.\nUrubanza rwatangiye ku wa 17 Mata 2001, imbere y'urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Buruseli. Rwamaze hafi ibyumweru umunani. Inteko yari igizwe n'abaturage 12. Ububiligi bwakoresheje itegeko ryo mu 1993. Iryo tegeko ryemerera inkiko z'Ububiligi kuburanisha ibyaha by'intambara aho byakorewe hose.\nKu wa 8 Kamena 2001, abaregwa bose bahamijwe ibyaha."}
{"id": "23640", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23640", "title": "Augustin Bizimana", "text": "Augustin Bizimana (1954 \u2013 Kanama 2000) yari umunyapolitiki w'u Rwanda. Yari Minisitiri w'Ingabo mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nMu 1998, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamureze ibyaha 13, birimo jenoside. Bizimana ntiyigeze afatwa. Mu 2020, byemejwe ko yapfiriye i Pointe-Noire, muri Repubulika ya Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAugustin Bizimana yavutse mu 1954. Yavukiye muri komine Gituza, muri perefegitura ya Byumba.\nUmwuga.\nKu ya 18 Nyakanga 1993, Bizimana yabaye Minisitiri w'Ingabo. Iyo guverinoma yari iya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana. Ku ya 6 Mata 1994, indege ya Habyarimana yarahanuwe. Icyo gihe Bizimana yari mu mahanga. Yagarutse mu Rwanda nyuma y'iminsi mike.\nBizimana yakomeje kuba Minisitiri w'Ingabo muri guverinoma y'inzibacyuho. Iyo guverinoma ni yo yari ku butegetsi mu gihe cya Jenoside. Muri Nyakanga 1994, Bizimana yahunze u Rwanda.\nIbyaha yarezwe.\nMu 1998, ICTR yareze Bizimana ibyaha 13. Muri ibyo byaha harimo jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside, ubwicanyi, gufata ku ngufu n'iyicarubozo. Yarezwe kuba nyirabayazana w'iyicwa rya Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Yarezwe kandi iyicwa ry'abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi bo muri MINUAR. Yarezwe no kwica Abatutsi b'abasivili muri perefegitura za Gisenyi, Ruhengeri, Butare, Kibuye na Cyangugu.\nBizimana ntiyigeze afatwa. Ntiyigeze kandi aburanishwa.\nUrupfu.\nKu ya 22 Gicurasi 2020, umushinjacyaha Serge Brammertz yemeje ko Bizimana yapfuye. Ibisigazwa bye byabonetse mu mva i Pointe-Noire, muri Repubulika ya Kongo. Byamenyekanye hakoreshejwe isuzuma rya ADN. Bizimana yapfuye muri Kanama 2000."}
{"id": "23641", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23641", "title": "Jean-Claude Lafourcade", "text": "Jean-Claude Lafourcade (yavutse mu 1943) ni jenerali w'Umufaransa uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru. Yayoboye igikorwa cya gisirikare cy'u Bufaransa cyiswe \"Turquoise\" mu Rwanda, mu 1994.\nLafourcade yahakanye ko ingabo z'u Bufaransa zafatanyije n'abakoze Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Yumviswe n'ubutabera bw'u Bufaransa mu iperereza ku byabereye i Bisesero.\nUbuzima.\nLafourcade ni jenerali wo mu rwego rwa \"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de corps d'arm\u00e9e\". Ubu ari mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru.\nIgikorwa Turquoise.\nLafourcade yayoboye igikorwa \"Turquoise\" kuva ku wa 22 Kamena kugeza ku wa 21 Kanama 1994. Mu 2010, yasohoye igitabo \"Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\". Muri icyo gitabo, avuga uko abona icyo gikorwa.\nLafourcade avuga ko kuvuga ko ingabo z'u Bufaransa zafatanyije n'abakoze Jenoside ari \u00abumugani\u00bb. Yemera ariko ko hari ubufatanye bwa gisirikare (\"fraternit\u00e9 d'armes\") hagati y'ingabo z'u Bufaransa n'ingabo zakoze Jenoside.\nBisesero.\nAbarokotse ba Bisesero n'amashyirahamwe bareze abasirikare b'Abafaransa. Babashinjaga gutererana Abatutsi i Bisesero hagati ya 27 na 30 Kamena 1994. Mu Mutarama 2016, Lafourcade yumviswe n'umucamanza nk'umutangabuhamya ufashijwe (\"t\u00e9moin assist\u00e9\").\nLafourcade yavuze ko ingabo ze zari nke. Zari abasirikare bagera ku 120 cyangwa 130. Yavuze ko ababajwe n'Abatutsi bishwe mu minsi ibiri yakurikiyeho.\nMu Kwakira 2023, abacamanza bafashe icyemezo cyo kudakurikirana abasirikare. Ku wa 9 Nzeri 2026, Urukiko rusesa imanza rwemeje icyo cyemezo. Urwo rukiko rwavuze ko hari ugushidikanya ku byo Lafourcade yari azi icyo gihe."}
{"id": "23642", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23642", "title": "Laurent Bucyibaruta", "text": "Laurent Bucyibaruta (1944 \u2013 6 Ukuboza 2023) yari umuyobozi w'u Rwanda. Yari perefe wa perefegitura ya Gikongoro mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nBucyibaruta yabaga mu Ubufaransa. Ku ya 12 Nyakanga 2022, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka 20. Yahamijwe ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yajuriye. Yapfuye mu 2023 mbere y'urubanza rw'ubujurire.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nLaurent Bucyibaruta yavutse mu 1944. Yavukiye muri perefegitura ya Gikongoro.\nUmwuga.\nKu ya 4 Nyakanga 1992, Bucyibaruta yabaye perefe wa Gikongoro. Yagumye kuri uwo mwanya kugeza muri Nyakanga 1994. Muri Jenoside, Abatutsi benshi biciwe muri Gikongoro. Ubwicanyi bukomeye bwabereye i Murambi, i Cyanika n'i Kaduha. Muri ubwo bwicanyi hapfuye abantu bagera ku 75 000.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Bucyibaruta yahungiye mu Bufaransa. Yabaga i Saint-Andr\u00e9-les-Vergers, hafi ya Troyes.\nUbutabera.\nMu 2005, ICTR yamureze jenoside. Mu 2007, Ubufaransa bwaramufashe. Ariko urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwamurekuye. Muri uwo mwaka, ICTR yahaye urubanza ubutabera bw'u Bufaransa.\nUrubanza rwe rwatangiye i Paris ku ya 9 Gicurasi 2022. Ku ya 12 Nyakanga 2022, urukiko rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka 20. Rwamuhamije ubufatanyacyaha mu bwicanyi bwabereye i Murambi, i Cyanika n'i Kaduha. Rwamuhamije kandi ubufatanyacyaha mu iyicwa ry'abanyeshuri b'ishuri rya Marie Merci i Kibeho. Ariko urukiko rwamugize umwere ku bwicanyi bwabereye kuri paruwasi ya Kibeho ku ya 14 Mata 1994.\nBucyibaruta yajuriye. Yarekuwe ategereje urubanza rushya. Yapfuye ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2023, afite imyaka 79. Kubera iyo mpamvu, urubanza rw'ubujurire ntirwabaye."}
{"id": "23643", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23643", "title": "Jean-Baptiste Gatete", "text": "Jean-Baptiste Gatete ni umunyapolitiki w'u Rwanda. Yabaye burugumesitiri wa komine Murambi. Nyuma yaho, yabaye umuyobozi muri Minisiteri y'Umuryango n'Iterambere ry'Umugore.\nMu 2011, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya jenoside. Rwamuhamije kandi icyaha cyo kurimbura abantu. Mu 2012, igihano cye cyagizwe imyaka 40 y'igifungo.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nGatete yize ubuhinzi. Ni injeniyeri mu by'ubuhinzi.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1987 kugeza muri Kamena 1993, Gatete yari burugumesitiri wa komine Murambi. Iyo komine yari mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Mu 1993, yavanywe kuri uwo mwanya. Yashinjwaga gutoteza Abatutsi. Nyuma yaho, yabaye umuyobozi muri Minisiteri y'Umuryango n'Iterambere ry'Umugore.\nMuri Jenoside, Gatete yategetse Interahamwe, abasirikare n'abapolisi kwica Abatutsi. Ibyo byabereye mu murenge wa Rwankuba. Yategetse kandi igitero ku mpunzi z'Abatutsi kuri paruwasi ya Kiziguro. Yafashije n'igitero cyagabwe kuri paruwasi ya Mukarange.\nUbutabera.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Gatete yahungiye muri Repubulika ya Kongo. Yabagayo akoresha irindi zina. Muri Nzeri 2002, yafatiwe muri Kongo. Ku ya 14 Nzeri 2002, yajyanywe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nUrubanza rwe rwatangiye ku ya 20 Ukwakira 2009. Ku ya 29 Werurwe 2011, ICTR yamuhamije jenoside no kurimbura abantu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nKu ya 9 Ukwakira 2012, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwemeje ibyo byaha. Rwamuhamije kandi umugambi wo gukora jenoside. Ariko igihano cye cyagizwe imyaka 40 y'igifungo. Impamvu ni uko urubanza rwe rwatinze cyane."}
{"id": "23644", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23644", "title": "Jean-Christophe Klotz", "text": "Jean-Christophe Klotz (yavutse ku wa 14 Mata 1962) ni umunyamakuru akaba n'umukozi wa filime w'Umufaransa. Yari mu Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Yarakomeretse i Kigali.\nKlotz yakoze filime nyinshi ku Rwanda no kuri Jenoside. Izizwi cyane ni \"Kigali, des images contre un massacre\" (2006) na \"Retour \u00e0 Kigali, une affaire fran\u00e7aise\" (2019).\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nKlotz yize mu kigo cyigisha itangazamakuru cy'i Paris (\"Centre de formation des journalistes\").\nUmwuga.\nKlotz yamaze imyaka myinshi ari umunyamakuru w'intambara. Yakoreraga cyane ikigo cya CAPA. Yageze mu Rwanda bwa mbere mu 1994.\nMu 1994, Klotz yari i Kigali afata amashusho. Abicanyi bateye paruwasi gatolika yari yihishemo abana b'Abatutsi. Klotz yarashwe isasu mu kibuno. Bamujyanye ku bitaro. Yasabye ko abo bana barindwa. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, abana barishwe.\nNyuma y'imyaka icumi, Klotz yasubiye i Kigali. Yashakaga abarokotse n'abantu yari yarahuye na bo. Yabonye abarokotse batarenze batanu. Ibyo yabibonye byavuyemo filime \"Kigali, des images contre un massacre\". Iyo filime yerekanywe mu 2006 mu iserukiramuco rya Cannes. Ubunararibonye bwe mu Rwanda bwanatumye akora filime \"Lignes de front\" (2009).\nMu 2019, Klotz yakoze filime \"Retour \u00e0 Kigali, une affaire fran\u00e7aise\". Iyo filime ivuga ku ruhare rw'u Bufaransa muri Jenoside. Yanyuze kuri France 3 ku wa 25 Mata 2019."}
{"id": "23645", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23645", "title": "Agathe Habyarimana", "text": "Agathe Habyarimana (yavutse ari Agathe Kanziga mu 1942) ni umufasha wa Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, wahoze ari Perezida w'u Rwanda. Yari umufasha wa Perezida kugeza mu 1994.\nAgathe Habyarimana aba mu Ubufaransa kuva mu 1994. Imiryango myinshi imushinja kuba umwe mu bayobozi b'akazu. Kuva mu 2007, ubutabera bw'u Bufaransa bumukoraho iperereza ku bufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. We arabihakana. Ntiyigeze aregwa ku mugaragaro.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAgathe Kanziga yavutse mu 1942. Yavukiye i Karago, muri perefegitura ya Gisenyi.\nUmufasha wa Perezida.\nAgathe Kanziga yashakanye na Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana. Habyarimana yabaye Perezida w'u Rwanda kuva mu 1973 kugeza mu 1994. Inkuru nyinshi zivuga ko Agathe Habyarimana yari afite ububasha bukomeye mu gihugu. Avugwa nk'umwe mu bayobozi b'akazu. Akazu kari agatsiko k'abasivili n'abasirikare bari hafi y'ubutegetsi.\nKu ya 6 Mata 1994, indege ya Perezida Habyarimana yarahanuwe. Perezida yaguye muri icyo gitero. Ku ya 9 Mata 1994, abasirikare b'Abafaransa bavanye Agathe Habyarimana mu Rwanda. Yageze i Paris ku ya 17 Mata 1994.\nUbutabera.\nMu 2004, Agathe Habyarimana yasabye ubuhungiro mu Bufaransa. Mu 2007, ubusabe bwe bwaranzwe. Urukiko rwavuze ko hari impamvu zikomeye zo gukeka ko yagize uruhare muri Jenoside. Mu 2009, Inama y'Igihugu y'Ubutegetsi (Conseil d'\u00c9tat) yemeje icyo cyemezo.\nMu Ugushyingo 2007, ubutabera bw'u Bufaransa bwatangiye iperereza. Ryatangijwe n'ikirego cy'Ishyirahamwe ry'abaregera indishyi ku Rwanda (CPCR). Mu Ukwakira 2009, u Rwanda rwatanze impapuro zo kumuta muri yombi. Ku ya 2 Werurwe 2010, Agathe Habyarimana yafatiwe mu Bufaransa. Nyuma y'igihe gito, yararekuwe. Ku ya 28 Nzeri 2011, urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwanze kumwohereza mu Rwanda.\nMu 2016, Agathe Habyarimana yahawe sitati ya \u00abt\u00e9moin assist\u00e9\u00bb. Ntiyigeze aregwa ku mugaragaro. Muri Kanama 2025, abacamanza b'iperereza bafashe icyemezo cyo guhagarika ikurikiranwa (non-lieu). Bavuze ko nta bimenyetso bihagije bihari.\nKu ya 6 Gicurasi 2026, urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwakuyeho icyo cyemezo. Rwasabye ko iperereza rikomeza. Agathe Habyarimana yajuririye mu Rukiko rusesa imanza (Cour de cassation)."}
{"id": "23646", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23646", "title": "Philippe Hategekimana", "text": "Philippe Hategekimana (yavutse mu 1956) ni umujandarume w'u Rwanda. Yitwaga \u00abBiguma\u00bb. Mu Bufaransa yitwa Philippe Manier.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, Hategekimana yakoraga muri jandarumori ya Nyanza. Mu 2023, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Icyo gihano cyemejwe mu bujurire mu 2024.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nPhilippe Hategekimana yavutse mu 1956.\nUmwuga.\nHategekimana yari adjudant-chef muri jandarumori ya Nyanza. Nyanza yari muri perefegitura ya Butare.\nMuri Jenoside, yategetse ko hashyirwaho za bariyeri. Kuri izo bariyeri hicirwaga Abatutsi. Yagize uruhare runini mu iyicwa rya burugumesitiri wa komine Ntyazo. Uwo burugumesitiri yarwanyaga Jenoside. Yagize uruhare kandi mu bwicanyi bwabereye ku misozi ya Nyabubare na Nyamure.\nUbutabera.\nMu 1999, Hategekimana yahungiye mu Ubufaransa. Yahawe sitati y'impunzi. Mu 2005, yabonye ubwenegihugu bw'u Bufaransa. Yahinduye izina yitwa Philippe Manier.\nMu 2017, Hategekimana yahungiye muri Kameruni. Muri Mata 2018, yafatiwe i Yaound\u00e9. Kameruni yamwohereje mu Bufaransa.\nUrubanza rwe rwatangiye i Paris ku ya 10 Gicurasi 2023. Ku ya 28 Kamena 2023, urukiko rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Rwamuhamije jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu.\nHategekimana yajuriye. Urubanza rw'ubujurire rwabaye kuva ku ya 4 Ugushyingo kugeza ku ya 17 Ukuboza 2024. Ku ya 17 Ukuboza 2024, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje igifungo cya burundu. Abavoka be batangaje ko bazajya mu Rukiko rusesa imanza (Cour de cassation)."}
{"id": "23647", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23647", "title": "Ibuka", "text": "Ibuka ni umuryango uhuriza hamwe amashyirahamwe y'abarokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Washinzwe mu 1995 mu Rwanda. Izina \u00abIbuka\u00bb risobanura \u00abwibuke\u00bb.\nIbuka iharanira uburenganzira bw'abarokotse, ubutabera ku bazize Jenoside no kubungabunga urwibutso rwayo. Hari kandi amashyirahamwe yitwa Ibuka mu bihugu byo hanze, nk'Ububiligi n'Ubufaransa.\nAmateka.\nIbuka yashinzwe mu 1995, nyuma y'umwaka umwe Jenoside irangiye. Ni umwe mu miryango ya mbere ihuriza hamwe amashyirahamwe y'abarokotse. Mu ntangiriro, Ibuka yafashaga abarokotse batagira aho baba, abakennye n'abafite ihungabana.\nKu wa 8 Ukuboza 2024, amashyirahamwe atatu y'abarokotse yemeje kwihuza. Ayo mashyirahamwe ni Ibuka, AERG na GAERG-Aheza. Bose bahurijwe mu muryango umwe witwa Ibuka. Philbert Gakwenzire, wari usanzwe ayobora Ibuka, yatorewe kuyobora uwo muryango mushya. Mu Gushyingo 2025, Ibuka yizihije imyaka 30 imaze ishinzwe.\nIbikorwa.\nIbuka iharanira uburenganzira bw'abarokotse. Iharanira kandi ubutabera ku bazize Jenoside. Yashyigikiye inkiko Gacaca. Yifuzaga ko abarokotse bumvwa kandi ko abakoze Jenoside babiryozwa.\nIbuka ikora kandi ku nzibutso za Jenoside, ku burezi no ku bikorwa byo Kwibuka.\nIbuka mu mahanga.\nMu bihugu byinshi, abarokotse n'inshuti zabo bashinze amashyirahamwe yitwa Ibuka. Urugero ni Ibuka \u2013 M\u00e9moire et Justice mu Bubiligi. Uwo muryango uhagarariye abarokotse benshi baba mu Bubiligi. Ibuka France yo mu Bufaransa iharanira kwibuka, ubutabera no gufasha abarokotse. Irwanya kandi guhakana Jenoside."}
{"id": "23648", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23648", "title": "Edouard Karemera", "text": "Edouard Karemera (1951 \u2013 31 Kanama 2020) yari umunyapolitiki w'u Rwanda. Mu 1994, yari Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu muri guverinoma y'inzibacyuho. Yari kandi Visi-Perezida wa mbere w'ishyaka MRND.\nUrukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije jenoside. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Yapfiriye muri gereza muri Senegali mu 2020.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nEdouard Karemera yavutse mu 1951.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, Karemera yari Visi-Perezida wa mbere w'ishyaka MRND. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, yabaye Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu. Yari muri guverinoma y'inzibacyuho ya Jean Kambanda.\nUbutabera.\nKaremera yaburanishijwe na ICTR hamwe na Mathieu Ngirumpatse, Perezida wa MRND. Mu 2011, ICTR yamuhamije jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Muri ibyo byaha harimo umugambi wo gukora jenoside, gushishikariza abantu gukora jenoside, gufata ku ngufu no kurimbura abantu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nKaremera yajuriye. Ku ya 29 Nzeri 2014, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwemeje igifungo cya burundu.\nUrupfu.\nMu 2017, Karemera yavanywe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. Yajyanywe muri gereza ya Sebikotane, hafi ya Dakar, muri Senegali. Yapfiriye muri iyo gereza ku ya 31 Kanama 2020. Yari afite imyaka 69."}
{"id": "23649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23649", "title": "Komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe kurwanya Jenoside", "text": "Komisiyo y'Igihugu ishinzwe kurwanya Jenoside (mu Gifaransa: \"Commission nationale de lutte contre le g\u00e9nocide\", CNLG) yari urwego rwa Leta y'u Rwanda. Yashinzwe mu 2007. Yari ishinzwe kurwanya Jenoside n'ingengabitekerezo yayo.\nMu 2021, CNLG yavanyweho. Inshingano zayo zahawe Minisiteri y'Ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda n'Inshingano Mboneragihugu (MINUBUMWE).\nAmateka.\nCNLG yashyizweho n'itegeko No 09/2007 ryo ku wa 16 Gashyantare 2007. Iryo tegeko rivuga ko CNLG ari urwego rw'igihugu, rwigenga kandi ruhoraho.\nKuva muri Kamena 2015, CNLG yayobowe na Jean Damasc\u00e8ne Bizimana nk'Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa. Yasimbuye Jean de Dieu Mucyo witabye Imana.\nInshingano.\nCNLG yari ishinzwe kwita ku mibereho myiza n'ihungabana ry'abarokotse. Yabikoraga ifatanyije na Minisiteri y'Ubuzima n'Ikigega gitera inkunga abarokotse (FARG). Yari ishinzwe kandi kubika inyandiko z'inkiko Gacaca. Yasabiraga abarokotse ubufasha n'indishyi.\nMu 2020, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yatangiye gusuzuma itegeko rishya. Iryo tegeko ryashakaga gukura kuri CNLG zimwe mu nshingano zayo. Minisiteri y'Ubuzima yari guhabwa ibijyanye n'ihungabana. FARG yari guhabwa ibijyanye n'inkunga y'abarokotse.\nIvanwaho.\nKu wa 21 Nzeri 2021, Inama y'Abaminisitiri yemeje imishinga y'amategeko ivanaho CNLG. Yavanyeho kandi Komisiyo y'Ubumwe n'Ubwiyunge, Komisiyo y'Itorero ry'Igihugu na FARG. Inshingano zabyo zahawe Minisiteri nshya y'Ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda n'Inshingano Mboneragihugu (MINUBUMWE). Jean Damasc\u00e8ne Bizimana yagizwe Minisitiri w'iyo minisiteri muri Kanama 2021."}
{"id": "23650", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23650", "title": "Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema", "text": "Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema (1954 \u2013 2016) yari muganga n'umuyobozi w'u Rwanda. Yari perefe wa perefegitura ya Kibuye mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nUrukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya jenoside. Mu 1999, rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Icyo gihano cyemejwe mu bujurire mu 2001. Kayishema yapfiriye muri gereza mu 2016.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nCl\u00e9ment Kayishema yavutse mu 1954. Yavukiye muri komine Gitesi, muri perefegitura ya Kibuye. Yari muganga ku bitaro bya Kibuye.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1992, Kayishema yagizwe perefe wa Kibuye. Muri Jenoside, Abatutsi benshi biciwe muri perefegitura ya Kibuye. Kayishema yagize uruhare mu bwicanyi bwabereye i Bisesero.\nUbutabera.\nKayishema yafatiwe muri Zambiya. Ku ya 26 Gicurasi 1996, yajyanywe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. Yaburanishijwe na ICTR hamwe n'umucuruzi Obed Ruzindana.\nKu ya 21 Gicurasi 1999, ICTR yamuhamije jenoside. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Ruzindana yakatiwe imyaka 25 y'igifungo. Ku ya 1 Kamena 2001, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano.\nKayishema yapfiriye muri gereza mu 2016."}
{"id": "23651", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23651", "title": "Maria Kisito", "text": "Maria Kisito ni izina ry'ububikira rya Julienne Mukabutera. Ni umubikira w'Umunyarwandakazi. Mu 1994, yabaga mu kigo cy'ababikira b'Ababenedigitine cya Sovu, hafi ya Butare.\nMu 2001, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Buruseli rwamuhamije uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka 12. Mu 2007, yarekuwe ategekwa kuguma mu kigo cy'ababikira mu Ububiligi.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nJulienne Mukabutera ni Umunyarwandakazi. Yinjiye mu babikira b'Ababenedigitine. Yafashe izina rya Maria Kisito.\nJenoside i Sovu.\nMuri Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye mu kigo cy'ababikira cya Sovu. Uwari ukuriye ikigo yari Consolata Mukangango, wiswe Gertrude. Maria Kisito na Gertrude barezwe gutanga izo mpunzi ku nterahamwe. Impunzi ibihumbi zariciwe.\nUbutabera.\nMaria Kisito na Gertrude bahungiye mu Bubiligi. Bombi baburanishijwe n'urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Buruseli hamwe n'abandi Banyarwanda babiri. Uru rubanza rwiswe \u00aburubanza rw'abantu bane b'i Butare\u00bb. Ku ya 8 Kamena 2001, Maria Kisito yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka 12. Gertrude yakatiwe imyaka 15. Mu 2002, Urukiko rusesa imanza rw'u Bubiligi rwanze ubujurire bwabo.\nMaria Kisito yafungiwe i Namur. Muri Kamena 2007, urukiko rw'i Mons rwemeye ko afungurwa. Yategetswe kuguma mu kigo cy'ababikira cya Maredret."}
{"id": "23652", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23652", "title": "Ihuriro ry'abarenganyijwe bo mu Rwanda", "text": "Ihuriro ry'abarenganyijwe bo mu Rwanda (mu Gifaransa: \"Collectif des parties civiles pour le Rwanda\", CPCR) ni ishyirahamwe ryo mu Bufaransa. Rigamije kugeza imbere y'inkiko z'u Bufaransa abakekwaho uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994 bahungiye mu Bufaransa.\nCPCR yashinzwe mu 2001 na Alain Gauthier n'umugore we Dafroza Gauthier. Ni yo iri inyuma y'ibirego hafi ya byose byatanzwe mu Bufaransa ku Banyarwanda bakekwaho Jenoside.\nAmateka.\nCPCR yashinzwe mu Gushyingo 2001. Yashinzwe na Alain Gauthier na Dafroza Gauthier. Icyicaro cyayo kiri iwabo i Reims. Intego yayo ni uguca umuco wo kudahana abakoze Jenoside baba mu Bufaransa.\nAlain na Dafroza Gauthier bamaze imyaka igera kuri 30 bazenguruka imisozi y'u Rwanda. Bakusanyaga ubuhamya. Dafroza Gauthier yapfuye mu Kwakira 2026 i Reims, afite imyaka 72.\nIbikorwa.\nCPCR itanga ibirego mu nkiko ku bakekwaho Jenoside baba mu Bufaransa. Ifasha kandi abarokotse. Hagati ya 2001 na 2019, yatanze ibirego bigera kuri 35. Kuva mu 2019, ubushinjacyaha bw'i Paris na bwo bwatangiye gukurikirana amadosiye. CPCR iyaregamo nk'uruhande rw'abaregera indishyi.\nImanza.\nMu 2014, Pascal Simbikangwa yakatiwe imyaka 25 y'igifungo. Bwari ubwa mbere umuntu akatirwa icyaha cya Jenoside mu Bufaransa.\nKugeza mu 2024, imanza esheshatu zari zimaze kuba. Abantu barindwi bari bamaze guhamwa n'ibyaha. Muri bo harimo Philippe Hategekimana wakatiwe igifungo cya burundu, na Sosth\u00e8ne Munyemana. Laurent Bucyibaruta na we yahamijwe ibyaha. Yapfuye mu Kuboza 2023, mbere y'urubanza rw'ubujurire."}
{"id": "23653", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23653", "title": "Protais Mpiranya", "text": "Protais Mpiranya (yapfuye ku ya 5 Ukwakira 2006) yari umusirikare w'u Rwanda. Yari afite ipeti rya majoro. Mu 1994, yayoboraga batayo y'ingabo zirinda Perezida.\nUrukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamureze jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Mpiranya ntiyigeze afatwa. Mu 2022, byemejwe ko yapfiriye i Harare, muri Zimbabwe, mu 2006.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1991, Mpiranya yimuriwe muri batayo y'ingabo zirinda Perezida. Mu 1993, yagizwe umuyobozi w'iyo batayo. Yayiyoboye kugeza muri Nyakanga 1994.\nIbyaha yarezwe.\nKu ya 28 Mutarama 2000, ICTR yemeje ikirego cya mbere kuri Mpiranya. Yarezwe jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside, ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara. Ibyo byaha byakozwe mu Rwanda hagati ya 6 Mata na 17 Nyakanga 1994.\nAbasirikare be barezwe kwica Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Barezwe kandi kwica abanyapolitiki benshi. Muri bo harimo Joseph Kavaruganda, Perezida w'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga. Harimo kandi abaminisitiri Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Nzamurambaho na Faustin Rucogoza. Mpiranya yarezwe kandi iyicwa ry'abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi bo muri MINUAR.\nGuhunga n'urupfu.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Mpiranya yarahunze. Nyuma yaho, yoherejwe muri Zimbabwe gukorera umutwe wa FDLR. Mpiranya ntiyigeze afatwa.\nKu ya 12 Gicurasi 2022, ubushinjacyaha bw'Urwego mpuzamahanga (IRMCT) bwemeje ko Mpiranya yapfuye. Ibisigazwa bye byabonetse muri Zimbabwe. Yapfiriye i Harare ku ya 5 Ukwakira 2006. Ku ya 14 Nzeri 2022, umucamanza yahagaritse urubanza rwe."}
{"id": "23654", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23654", "title": "Claude Muhayimana", "text": "Claude Muhayimana (yavutse mu 1961) ni Umufaransa ukomoka mu Rwanda. Mu 1994, yari umushoferi wa hoteli i Kibuye.\nMu 2021, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka 14. Ku ya 27 Gashyantare 2026, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nClaude Muhayimana yavutse mu 1961. Yavukiye i Kibuye, mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, Muhayimana yari umushoferi wa hoteli i Kibuye. Muri Jenoside, yatwaye abajandarume n'Interahamwe. Yabajyanaga aho Abatutsi bicirwaga, harimo i Bisesero.\nUbutabera.\nMuhayimana yahungiye mu Ubufaransa mu 2001. Mu 2010, yabonye ubwenegihugu bw'u Bufaransa. Yaba kandi agakorera i Rouen.\nMu 2021, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka 14. Yajuriye, kandi akomeza kuba hanze ya gereza.\nUrubanza rw'ubujurire rwabereye i Paris muri Gashyantare 2026. Ku ya 27 Gashyantare 2026, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje igifungo cy'imyaka 14. Abavoka be bavuze ko bashobora kujya mu Rukiko rusesa imanza (Cour de cassation)."}
{"id": "23655", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23655", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kinazi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kinazi ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri mu Murenge wa Kinazi, mu Akarere ka Ruhango, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo.\nUrwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri y'abantu bagera ku 60\u00a0000. Abo bantu biciwe mu cyahoze ari komini Ntongwe, mu Mayaga.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kinazi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside, Abatutsi bo mu karere bahungiye ahantu henshi. Ibihumbi byinshi muri bo biciwe aho bari bahungiye. Abicanyi bari Interahamwe. Bayoborwaga na burugumesitiri wa komini Ntongwe, Charles Kagabo.\nImpunzi z'Abarundi zo mu nkambi ya Nyagahama na zo zagize uruhare mu bwicanyi. Abayobozi b'ibanze babahaye amafaranga n'ibindi bihembo. Iyo nkambi yari ku musozi witegeye ibiro bya komini Ntongwe. Ubu aho hari ibitaro bya Kinazi. Abarundi bagize uruhare muri ubwo bwicanyi basubiye iwabo. Nta n'umwe wakurikiranywe n'ubutabera.\nUmuyobozi w'Interahamwe, Jacques Nsabimana, yacukuje icyobo. Yavugaga ko ari icy'inyubako y'abanyeshuri. Nyamara icyo cyobo cyajugunywemo imibiri y'Abatutsi.\nUrwibutso.\nKu wa 19 Mata 2014, imibiri y'abantu bagera ku 60\u00a0000 yashyinguwe mu rwibutso rushya rwa Kinazi. Iyo mibiri yari yakuwe mu mva rusange y'i Rutabo.\nKu wa 26 Mata 2026, indi mibiri 35 yashyinguwe mu rwibutso rwa Kinazi. Muri icyo gihe, hari inzu ndangamurage yubakwaga kuri urwo rwibutso. Izaba irimo icyumba cyitwa \u00abChambre noire\u00bb. Icyo cyumba kizagaragaza abateguye Jenoside."}
{"id": "23656", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23656", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murugo Mutagatifu Jean", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murugo Mutagatifu Jean (mu Gifaransa: \"Home Saint Jean\") ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri i Kibuye, mu Umurenge wa Bwishyura, mu Akarere ka Karongi. Ruri ku nkombe y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu.\nUrwo rwibutso rwibuka Abatutsi biciwe muri kiliziya gatolika ya Kibuye no mu nzu ya Murugo Mutagatifu Jean, ku wa 17 Mata 1994.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Murugo Mutagatifu Jean ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu ntangiriro za Jenoside, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye kuri kiliziya gatolika ya Kibuye no kuri Murugo Mutagatifu Jean. Kiliziya ikikijwe n'Ikiyaga cya Kivu ku mpande eshatu.\nKu wa 17 Mata 1994, abicanyi bateye impunzi. Abicanyi bari abajandarume, abapolisi ba komini ya Gitesi, Interahamwe n'abasivili bitwaje intwaro. Bakoresheje imbunda, gerenade, imipanga, amacumu n'amahiri. Abenshi mu bishwe bari Abatutsi. KT Press ivuga ko abantu barenga 11\u00a0000 biciwe muri kiliziya. Icyo gihe perefe wa Kibuye yari Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema.\nIperereza n'ubutabera.\nHagati y'Ukuboza 1995 na Gashyantare 1996, impuguke zataburuye imva rusange imwe kuri iyo ngo. Basanzemo imibiri y'abantu benshi. Abagera kuri 70\u00a0% bari abagore n'abana. Abenshi bishwe bakubiswe ibintu biremereye. Ibyo bimenyetso byatanzwe imbere y'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) mu rubanza rwa Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema na Obed Ruzindana."}
{"id": "23657", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23657", "title": "Angeline Mukandutiye", "text": "Angeline Mukandutiye (yavutse mu 1951) ni Umunyarwandakazi. Mu 1994, yari umugenzuzi w'amashuri abanza muri komine Nyarugenge, i Kigali.\nInkiko Gacaca zamuhamije uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Zamukatiye igifungo cya burundu adahari. Yamaze imyaka 25 muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu Ukuboza 2019, yagarutse mu Rwanda arafatwa.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAngeline Mukandutiye yavutse mu 1951. Yavukiye i Gisenyi, mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, Mukandutiye yari umugenzuzi w'amashuri abanza muri komine Nyarugenge, i Kigali. Yari umurwanashyaka w'ishyaka MRND.\nMuri Jenoside, Mukandutiye yashinjwe kuyobora Interahamwe mu murenge wa Rugenge. Yashinjwe kujya kenshi kuri kiliziya ya Sainte-Famille. Yahatoranyaga abagabo n'abahungu b'Abatutsi bicwaga nyuma. Abarokotse bavuga kandi ko inzu ye yari ihuriro ry'Interahamwe.\nGuhunga.\nMuri Nyakanga 1994, Mukandutiye yahungiye muri Kongo. Yabanje kuba mu nkambi ya Katale. Nyuma yaho, yabanye n'umutwe w'inyeshyamba z'Abanyarwanda mu mashyamba ya Kongo. Yahamaze imyaka 25.\nUbutabera.\nKu ya 23 Ugushyingo 2008, Inkiko Gacaca zamuburanishije adahari. Zamukatiye igifungo cya burundu.\nMu Ukuboza 2019, Mukandutiye yagaruwe mu Rwanda hamwe n'abandi bantu benshi bavuye muri Kongo. Yageze mu nkambi ya Nyarushishi, mu Akarere ka Rusizi. Abarokotse baramumenye. Polisi yaramufashe. Yafungiwe muri Gereza ya Mageragere.\nMu 2021, Mukandutiye yari mu baregwaga mu rubanza rwa MRCD-FLN, hamwe na Paul Rusesabagina. Ni we mugore wenyine wari muri urwo rubanza."}
{"id": "23658", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23658", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyange", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyange ruri mu Umurenge wa Nyange, mu Akarere ka Ngororero. Rwibuka Abatutsi biciwe muri kiliziya ya Nyange muri Mata 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nRwibuka kandi abanyeshuri b'Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange bishwe ku wa 18 Werurwe 1997. Abo banyeshuri banze kwitandukanya bakurikije amoko. Ubu ni intwari z'igihugu.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyange ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUbwicanyi bwo muri kiliziya ya Nyange.\nMuri Mata 1994, Abatutsi ibihumbi bahungiye muri kiliziya gatolika ya Nyange. Bibwiraga ko bazaharindirwa. Ahagana ku wa 12 Mata 1994, kiliziya yasenywe n'imashini (\"bulldozer\"). Abari bayirimo bose barapfuye. Umuryango w'Abibumbye uvuga ko bari abantu bagera ku 1\u00a0500 cyangwa 2\u00a0000.\nPadiri Athanase Seromba ni we wabwiraga umushoferi w'imashini igihe cyo gutangira gusenya kiliziya. Yamweretse n'aho kiliziya yari idakomeye. Mu 2006, Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda rwamukatiye imyaka 15 y'igifungo. Ku wa 12 Werurwe 2008, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu.\nAbanyeshuri b'i Nyange.\nKu wa 18 Werurwe 1997, nijoro, abacengezi bateye Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange. Bategetse abanyeshuri kwitandukanya, Abahutu ukwabo n'Abatutsi ukwabo. Abanyeshuri barabyanze. Bavuze bati \u00abTwese turi Abanyarwanda\u00bb. Abacengezi bahise babatera gerenade kandi barabarasa. Abanyeshuri batandatu n'umuzamu barapfuye.\nAbanyeshuri batandatu biciwe muri icyo gitero ni aba:\nFerdinand Niyongira yapfuye muri Nyakanga 2001, azize ibikomere yatewe n'icyo gitero.\nIntwari z'i Nyange.\nKu wa 12 Nzeri 2001, abanyeshuri 47 b'i Nyange bashyizwe mu ntwari z'igihugu mu cyiciro cy'\u00abImena\u00bb. Muri Mutarama 2016, Inama y'Abaminisitiri yemeje ko Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange riba \u00abikigo cy'intwari\u00bb. Buri mwaka, ku wa 18 Werurwe, hizihizwa ubutwari bw'abanyeshuri b'i Nyange.\nKu wa 10 Mutarama 2014, Urumuri rw'Icyizere (\"Kwibuka Flame\") rwageze ku Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange. Hari mu ntangiriro z'urugendo rwarwo mu gihugu hose, mbere yo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 20."}
{"id": "23659", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23659", "title": "Bernard Munyagishari", "text": "Bernard Munyagishari (yavutse mu 1959) ni Umunyarwanda. Mu 1994, yari umuyobozi w'ishyaka MRND n'uw'Interahamwe mu mujyi wa Gisenyi.\nMu 2017, Urukiko Rukuru rw'u Rwanda rwamuhamije icyaha cya jenoside. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Mu 2020, yemeye ibyaha bye. Mu 2021, Urukiko rw'Ubujurire rwagumishijeho igifungo cya burundu.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nBernard Munyagishari yavutse mu 1959. Mbere ya Jenoside, yari umwarimu w'amashuri abanza.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1992 kugeza mu 1994, Munyagishari yari umunyamabanga mukuru w'ishyaka MRND i Gisenyi. Yari na perezida w'Interahamwe muri Gisenyi. Muri Mata 1994, Interahamwe ze zayoboye ubwicanyi bw'Abatutsi muri ako karere. Munyagishari yashakaga abarwanyi. Yabahaga intwaro. Yashyizeho na bariyeri.\nIbyaha aregwa byakorewe ahantu henshi muri perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Muri ho harimo Institut Saint-Fid\u00e8le, icyicaro cya Diyosezi Gatolika ya Nyundo n'ahantu hiswe \u00abKomine Rouge\u00bb.\nUbutabera.\nMu 2005, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamureze ibyaha bya jenoside. Mu Gicurasi 2011, Munyagishari yafatiwe muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ku itariki ya 24 Nyakanga 2013, ICTR yamwohereje mu Rwanda kugira ngo aburanishirizwe yo. Ni we wa kabiri ICTR yohereje mu Rwanda.\nUrubanza rwe rwabereye mu Rukiko Rukuru i Kigali. Munyagishari yanze kwitabira urubanza. Ku itariki ya 21 Gashyantare 2017, ubushinjacyaha bwamusabiye igifungo cya burundu. Ku itariki ya 20 Mata 2017, urukiko rwamuhamije icyaha cya jenoside n'icyaha cy'ubwicanyi cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Ntiyahamijwe icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu.\nMunyagishari yajuririye icyo cyemezo. Ku itariki ya 12 Ugushyingo 2020, mu Rukiko rw'Ubujurire, yemeye uruhare rwe muri Jenoside. Yanditse inyandiko ya paji zirenga 50 isobanura ibyo yakoze. Yasabye imbabazi. Ku itariki ya 7 Gicurasi 2021, Urukiko rw'Ubujurire rwanze ubujurire bwe. Rwagumishijeho igifungo cya burundu."}
{"id": "23660", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23660", "title": "Stele i Paris", "text": "Stele i Paris (mu Gifaransa: \"St\u00e8le \u00e0 la m\u00e9moire des victimes du g\u00e9nocide des Tutsi au Rwanda\") ni ikimenyetso cyo kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Iri mu irimbi rya P\u00e8re-Lachaise, i Paris, mu Bufaransa.\nIyo stele yatashywe ku wa 31 Ukwakira 2014. Yashyizweho n'Umujyi wa Paris n'ishyirahamwe Ibuka France.\nAmateka.\nIshyirahamwe Ibuka France ryatangaje ko stele izatahwa ku wa 31 Ukwakira 2014, mu irimbi rya P\u00e8re-Lachaise. Umuhango wari kuba imbere y'umuyobozi w'Umujyi wa Paris n'abandi bayobozi. Stele yatashywe kuri uwo munsi.\nKwibuka.\nKu wa 7 Mata 2015, Abanyarwanda n'inshuti zabo barenga 200 bahuriye imbere y'iyo stele. Ambasade y'u Rwanda, umujyi w'akarere ka 20 ka Paris na Ibuka France bashyize indabo kuri stele. Uwo munsi, umwungirije w'umuyobozi w'Umujyi wa Paris yemeye gushaka ahantu hanini ho kwibukira.\nMbere ya 2026, kwibuka i Paris byaberaga cyane cyane imbere y'iyi stele no muri pariki ya Choisy. Ku wa 2 Kamena 2026, urwibutso rushya rwitwa \u00abL'Archive\u00bb rwatashywe i Paris. Rwatashywe na Perezida w'u Bufaransa Emmanuel Macron na Perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame. Ruri ku nkombe y'uruzi rwa Seine. Rwakozwe n'umunyabugeni Grada Kilomba."}
{"id": "23661", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23661", "title": "Mbaye Diagne", "text": "Mbaye Diagne (18 Werurwe 1958 \u2013 31 Gicurasi 1994) yari kapiteni mu ngabo za Senegali. Yari indorerezi ya gisirikare ya MINUAR mu Rwanda.\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, Mbaye Diagne yakijije abantu amagana. Yishwe ku wa 31 Gicurasi 1994 i Kigali. Umuryango w'Abibumbye wamuhaye icyubahiro ushyiraho umudari witwa izina rye.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nMbaye Diagne yavutse ku wa 18 Werurwe 1958 muri Senegali. Yize muri Kaminuza ya Dakar. Nyuma yize mu ishuri rikuru ry'abofisiye b'ingabo za Senegali.\nUmwuga.\nMbaye Diagne yabaye kapiteni mu ngabo za Senegali. Yarwanye mu ntambara ya Casamance kuva mu 1989 kugeza mu 1993. Mu 1993, yoherejwe mu Rwanda nk'indorerezi ya gisirikare. Nyuma yashyizwe muri MINUAR.\nJenoside imaze gutangira muri Mata 1994, Diagne yakijije abana ba Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Yabafashije guhunga igihugu. Nyuma yakoze ingendo nyinshi wenyine muri Kigali. Yahishaga Abatutsi mu modoka ye. Yabajyanaga ahantu harinzwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Bamwe yabahishe muri H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines. Ibyo yabikoze nubwo amabwiriza ya MINUAR atabimwemereraga. Umubare w'abo yakijije ntuzwi neza. Bamwe bavuga ko barenga 1\u00a0000.\nKu wa 31 Gicurasi 1994, Diagne yasubiraga ku birindiro bye. Igisasu cyaguye hafi y'imodoka ye. Yahise apfa. Yari asigaje iminsi 12 ngo arangize igihe cy'akazi ke.\nIcyubahiro.\nMu 2005, Senegali yamugize umunyacyubahiro mu Rutonde rw'Igihugu rw'Intare (\"Ordre national du Lion\"). Muri Gicurasi 2014, Akanama gashinzwe umutekano ku isi k'Umuryango w'Abibumbye kashyizeho umudari witwa \u00abUmudari wa Kapiteni Mbaye Diagne w'ubutwari bw'indashyikirwa\u00bb. Ku wa 19 Gicurasi 2016, Umunyamabanga Mukuru w'Umuryango w'Abibumbye yahaye uwo mudari wa mbere umupfakazi we, Yacine Mar Diop."}
{"id": "23662", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23662", "title": "\u00c9douard Kayihura", "text": "\u00c9douard Kayihura ni Umunyarwanda warokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Ni umunyamategeko, umwanditsi kandi aharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMuri Jenoside, Kayihura yamaze iminsi 100 ari impunzi muri H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines i Kigali. Yanditse igitabo \"Inside the Hotel Rwanda\" (2014) ku byabereye muri iyo hoteli.\nUbuzima.\nMuri Jenoside.\nMu 1994, Kayihura yamaze iminsi 100 ari impunzi muri H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines.\nUmwuga.\nKayihura yabaye umushinjacyaha mu Rukiko rwisumbuye rwa Kigali. Yakurikiranaga imanza za Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yabaye kandi umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa akaba n'uhagarariye mu mategeko umuryango Kanyarwanda uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu. Nyuma yimukiye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Atanga ibiganiro mu mashuri no muri za kaminuza.\nInside the Hotel Rwanda.\nMu 2014, Kayihura yasohoye igitabo \"Inside the Hotel Rwanda\". Yacyanditse afatanyije na Kerry Zukus. Cyasohowe na BenBella Books i Dallas. Icyo gitabo kivuga iminsi 100 Kayihura yamaze muri hoteli. Kirimo kandi ubuhamya bw'abandi barokotse, Abahutu n'Abatutsi, n'ubw'abasirikare b'Umuryango w'Abibumbye.\nIgitabo kinenga filime \"Hotel Rwanda\". Abanditsi bacyo bavuga ko iyo filime itavuga ukuri ku byabereye muri hoteli. Bavuga ko Paul Rusesabagina yari umuntu ushaka ubutegetsi wungukiye ku mpunzi."}
{"id": "23663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23663", "title": "Jean-Paul Akayesu", "text": "Jean-Paul Akayesu (yavutse mu 1953) ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa komini Taba. Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu.\nKu wa 2 Nzeri 1998, Akayesu yabaye umuntu wa mbere ku isi wahamijwe icyaha cya Jenoside n'urukiko mpuzamahanga. Urwo rubanza rwemeje bwa mbere ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora kuba uburyo bwo gukora Jenoside.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAkayesu yavukiye muri komini Taba mu 1953. Yabaye mwarimu. Yari afite abana batanu.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1991, Akayesu yatorewe kuyobora ishyaka MDR ku rwego rw'ibanze. Kuva muri Mata 1993 kugeza muri Kamena 1994, yari burugumesitiri wa komini Taba.\nJenoside imaze gutangira, Akayesu yabanje kubuza Interahamwe kwinjira muri Taba. Yabanje kurinda Abatutsi bo muri komini ye. Ku wa 18 Mata 1994, yagiye mu nama n'abayobozi ba guverinoma y'inzibacyuho. Nyuma y'iyo nama, yahinduye imyitwarire. Yashishikarije abaturage kwica Abatutsi. Ahantu Abatutsi bari barahungiye habaye aho bakorerwa iyicarubozo, aho bafatirwa ku ngufu kandi bakicirwa.\nUrubanza.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Akayesu yahungiye muri Zayire, hanyuma muri Zambiya. Yafatiwe muri Zambiya mu Kwakira 1995. Yoherejwe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya, kuburanishwa na ICTR.\nKu wa 2 Nzeri 1998, ICTR yamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Ni bwo bwa mbere urukiko mpuzamahanga rwahamije umuntu icyaha cya Jenoside. Ni na bwo bwa mbere urukiko mpuzamahanga rwasobanuye icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu. Rwemeje ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora kuba uburyo bwo gukora Jenoside.\nAkayesu yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Ku wa 1 Kamena 2001, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwanze ubujurire bwe. Rwemeje igifungo cya burundu. Arangiriza igihano cye muri gereza yo muri Mali."}
{"id": "23664", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23664", "title": "Valerie Bemeriki", "text": "Val\u00e9rie Bemeriki (yavutse ahagana mu 1955) ni Umunyarwandakazi wahoze ari umunyamakuru wa radiyo RTLM (\"Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines\"). Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, yakoresheje radiyo ashishikariza abantu kwica Abatutsi.\nMu Kuboza 2009, urukiko Gacaca rwa Nyakabanda i Kigali rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga.\nMbere ya 1993, Bemeriki yari umunyamakuru w'ikinyamakuru \"Umurwanashyaka\". Icyo kinyamakuru cyari icy'ishyaka MRND ryari ku butegetsi. Mu 1993, yinjiye muri radiyo RTLM. Bamusabye \u00abkurwanya umwanzi w'Umututsi akoresheje indangururamajwi\u00bb.\nMuri Jenoside.\nBemeriki yemeye mu rukiko ko yakoresheje iyo radiyo ahamagarira abantu gushakisha Abatutsi no kubica. Yavuze ko ku munsi wakurikiye ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida Habyarimana, intumwa z'umugaba mukuru w'ingabo zahuye n'abanyamakuru ba RTLM. Ubutumwa bwari ukurangiza \u00abRevolisiyo yo mu 1959\u00bb no kwica Abatutsi bose.\nUrubanza.\nBemeriki yafatiwe muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yoherejwe mu Rwanda muri Kamena 1999. Izindi nkiko Gacaca zari zaramukatiye ibihano by'igifungo.\nMu Kuboza 2009, yaburanishijwe n'urukiko Gacaca rwa Nyakabanda, i Kigali. Yaregwaga gutegura Jenoside, gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside, no kugira uruhare mu iyicwa ry'abantu benshi n'imiryango. Mu rukiko, yasabye imbabazi abiciwe. Yavuze ko yakoze ibibi bidashobora gusanwa. Ku wa 12 Ukuboza 2009, urukiko rwamuhamije ibyaha kandi rumukatira igifungo cya burundu."}
{"id": "23665", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23665", "title": "Sosth\u00e8ne Munyemana", "text": "Sosth\u00e8ne Munyemana (yavutse ahagana mu 1955) ni umuganga w'Umunyarwanda. Mu 1994, yari umuganga w'indwara z'abagore muri perefegitura ya Butare.\nMu Bufaransa, urukiko rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside. Ku wa 19 Ukuboza 2023, yakatiwe imyaka 24 y'igifungo. Urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano ku wa 23 Ukwakira 2025.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga mu Rwanda.\nMbere ya Jenoside, Munyemana yari umuganga w'indwara z'abagore. Yakoreraga muri perefegitura ya Butare, mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nMu Bufaransa.\nMunyemana yageze mu Bufaransa muri Nzeri 1994. Umugore we yari asanzwe ahaba. Yamaze imyaka irenga 20 ari umuganga mu by'ubutabazi bwihuse. Nyuma yabaye umuganga w'abasaza mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Bufaransa.\nIbyo yaregwaga.\nMunyemana yaregwaga gushyiraho bariyeri n'amarondo i Tumba, muri perefegitura ya Butare. Kuri izo bariyeri, abantu bafatwaga hanyuma bakicwa. Yaregwaga kandi gufata urufunguzo rw'ibiro bya segiteri. Abatutsi bafungirwagamo mbere yo kwicwa. Yaregwaga no gushyira umukono ku nyandiko ishyigikira guverinoma y'inzibacyuho.\nMunyemana avuga ko yari Umuhutu utarangwaga n'ubuhezanguni. Avuga ko yagerageje guhisha Abatutsi.\nUrubanza.\nIkirego cya mbere cyatanzwe i Bordeaux mu 1995. Iperereza ryimuriwe i Paris mu 2001. Icyemezo cyo kumuregera urukiko cyafashwe mu 2018 gusa.\nKu wa 19 Ukuboza 2023, urukiko rwa rubanda (\"cour d'assises\") rw'i Paris rwamuhamije Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwamukatiye imyaka 24 y'igifungo. Yabaye Umunyarwanda wa karindwi uhamijwe ibyaha bya Jenoside mu Bufaransa.\nMunyemana yajuririye icyo cyemezo. Ku wa 23 Ukwakira 2025, urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ubugambanyi bwo gukora Jenoside. Rwamugize umwere ku byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwemeje imyaka 24 y'igifungo. Munyemana yajuririye Urukiko rusesa imanza."}
{"id": "23666", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23666", "title": "Beatrice Munyenyezi", "text": "Beatrice Munyenyezi (yavutse ahagana mu 1970) ni Umunyarwandakazi wahamijwe ibyaha bya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Ni umukazana wa Pauline Nyiramasuhuko.\nMunyenyezi yamaze imyaka myinshi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Yakatiwe yo kubera kubeshya ku byo yakoze muri Jenoside. Mu 2021 yoherejwe mu Rwanda. Mu 2024, urukiko rwa Huye rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu.\nUbuzima.\nMunyenyezi yashakanye na Ars\u00e8ne Shalom Ntahobali. Ntahobali yari umuyobozi w'Interahamwe i Butare. Nyina wa Ntahobali, Pauline Nyiramasuhuko, yari minisitiri muri guverinoma yakoze Jenoside. Mu 2011, Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda rwakatiye bombi igifungo cya burundu. Nyuma, mu bujurire, icyo gihano cyagabanyijwe kiba imyaka 47.\nIbyo yaregwaga.\nAbatangabuhamya bavuze ko Munyenyezi yagenzuraga bariyeri i Butare. Iyo bariyeri yari imbere ya hoteli y'umuryango w'umugabo we. Bavuze ko yatoranyaga Abatutsi bakicwa. Bavuze kandi ko yashishikarizaga abahezanguni b'Abahutu gufata abagore ku ngufu. Bamwitaga \u00abkomanda\u00bb. Munyenyezi yahakanye ibyo byaha byose.\nImanza.\nMuri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika.\nMu 2003, Munyenyezi yahawe ubwenegihugu bwa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika muri leta ya New Hampshire. Mu 2013, urukiko rwemeje ko yabeshye mu nyandiko yasabagamo ubwenegihugu. Yari yarahishe uruhare rwe muri Jenoside. Yambuwe ubwenegihugu, akatirwa imyaka 10 y'igifungo.\nMu Rwanda.\nKu wa 15 Mata 2021, Munyenyezi yoherejwe mu Rwanda. Yahise afatwa n'inzego z'umutekano ageze i Kigali. Yaregwaga ibyaha birindwi bifitanye isano na Jenoside.\nMuri Mata 2024, urukiko rw'i Huye rwamuhamije ibyaha byo kwica nk'icyaha cya Jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside, gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside, n'ubufatanyacyaha mu gufata ku ngufu. Rwamugize umwere ku cyaha cyo gutegura Jenoside. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu."}
{"id": "23668", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23668", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga n'Ubutwererane", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga n'Ubutwererane (\"Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation\", MINAFFET) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe politiki y'u Rwanda mu mahanga.\nIshinzwe kandi umubano n'ibindi bihugu n'imiryango mpuzamahanga. Kuva muri Kamena 2024, Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga n'Ubutwererane ni Olivier Nduhungirehe.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINAFFET ni ugutegura gahunda zo gushyira mu bikorwa politiki y'u Rwanda mu mahanga. Ikurikirana kandi igasuzuma iyo politiki. Isobanura iyo politiki mu Rwanda no mu mahanga.\nIcyerekezo cya MINAFFET ni u Rwanda rufite amahoro, rukize kandi rwigenga. U Rwanda kandi rugomba kuba ku isonga mu bufatanye bw'akarere, bwa Afurika n'ubw'isi.\nIbyo MINAFFET ishyira imbere ni ibi:\nAbaminisitiri.\nLouise Mushikiwabo yayoboye MINAFFET kugeza mu Ukwakira 2018. Icyo gihe, yari amaze gutorerwa kuyobora Umuryango Mpuzamahanga w'Ibihugu Bivuga Igifaransa (OIF). Richard Sezibera yamusimbuye.\nKu wa 4 Ugushyingo 2019, Vincent Biruta yasimbuye Sezibera. Mbere yaho, Biruta yari Minisitiri w'Ibidukikije.\nKu wa 12 Kamena 2024, Olivier Nduhungirehe yasimbuye Biruta. Mbere yaho, Nduhungirehe yari Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda mu Buholandi. Biruta yagizwe Minisitiri w'Umutekano mu Gihugu.\nKu wa 1 Ukuboza 2025, Usta Kaitesi yagizwe Minisitiri wa Leta muri MINAFFET."}
{"id": "23669", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23669", "title": "Alfred Musema", "text": "Alfred Musema ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ayobora uruganda rw'icyayi rwa Gisovu, muri perefegitura ya Kibuye. Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside kubera ibyo yakoreye i Bisesero n'ahandi.\nKu wa 27 Mutarama 2000, ICTR yamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Icyo gihano cyemejwe mu bujurire ku wa 16 Ugushyingo 2001.\nUbuzima.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside, Musema yari umuyobozi w'uruganda rw'icyayi rwa Gisovu. Urwo ruganda rwayoborwaga na Leta.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nMusema yatwaraga abicanyi bitwaje intwaro, barimo abakozi b'uruganda. Yabajyanaga muri komini Gisovu na Gishyita. Bateraga Abatutsi bari bahahungiye. Yagiye ubwe mu bitero byabereye ku misozi ya Gitwa, Rwirambo, Muyira na Mumataba. Ibyo bitero byabaye mu mpera za Mata no hagati muri Gicurasi 1994. Mu rubanza rwe, byagaragaye ko abantu bagera kuri 300 baguye mu buvumo bwa Nyakavumu. Abicanyi bari bacanye umuriro ku muryango w'ubwo buvumo.\nUrubanza.\nKu wa 27 Mutarama 2000, ICTR yamuhamije ibyaha bya Jenoside, gutsemba nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu, no gufata ku ngufu nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nMusema yajuriye. Ku wa 16 Ugushyingo 2001, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje ibyaha bya Jenoside n'ibyo gutsemba. Rwakuyeho icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu, nyuma yo kumva abandi batangabuhamya babiri. Rwemeje igifungo cya burundu."}
{"id": "23670", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23670", "title": "Augustin Ngirabatware", "text": "Augustin Ngirabatware (yavutse ku wa 12 Mutarama 1957) ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari Minisitiri w'Igenamigambi kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1994. Ni umukwe wa F\u00e9licien Kabuga.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside muri komini ye ya Nyamyumba. Mu bujurire, yakatiwe imyaka 30 y'igifungo.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nNgirabatware avuka muri komini Nyamyumba, muri perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bukungu yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Fribourg, mu Ubusuwisi.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1986 kugeza mu 1994, Ngirabatware yari umwarimu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Muri Nyakanga 1990, yagizwe Minisitiri w'Igenamigambi. Yagumye kuri uwo mwanya muri guverinoma y'inzibacyuho yo muri Mata 1994. Yari kandi umwe mu bagize komite ya MRND ku rwego rwa perefegitura ya Gisenyi no ku rwego rw'igihugu.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nMu 1994, Ngirabatware yashishikarije Interahamwe zo muri komini Nyamyumba kwica abaturanyi babo b'Abatutsi. Yazihaye intwaro. Yazibwiye ko atashaka kongera kubona Abatutsi muri iyo komini.\nUrubanza.\nNgirabatware yafatiwe mu Ubudage ku wa 17 Nzeri 2007. Yoherejwe kuri ICTR ku wa 8 Ukwakira 2009.\nKu wa 20 Ukuboza 2012, ICTR yamuhamije gushishikariza ku mugaragaro abantu gukora Jenoside, kubatera inkunga no kubafasha gukora Jenoside, ndetse no gufata ku ngufu nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe imyaka 35 y'igifungo.\nKu wa 18 Ukuboza 2014, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje ibyaha bijyanye na Jenoside. Rwakuyeho icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu. Igihano cyagabanyijwe kiba imyaka 30. Mu 2017, urukiko rwemeye gusubiramo urubanza. Bamwe mu batangabuhamya bari baravuguruje ubuhamya bwabo. Ku wa 27 Nzeri 2019, urukiko rwemeje ko icyemezo cy'ubujurire kigumaho uko cyari kiri."}
{"id": "23671", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23671", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ubutabera", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ubutabera (\"Ministry of Justice\", MINIJUST) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe ubutabera n'iyubahirizwa ry'amategeko.\nMinisitiri w'Ubutabera ni na we Intumwa Nkuru ya Leta. Kuva muri Nzeri 2021, uwo mwanya urimo Emmanuel Ugirashebuja.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINIJUST ni ugutegura, kugenzura no guteza imbere ibikorwa bijyanye n'ubutabera. Igamije ko amategeko yubahirizwa kandi ko ubutabera bugera kuri bose.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MINIJUST ni izi:\nAbaminisitiri.\nKu wa 17 Nzeri 2021, Emmanuel Ugirashebuja yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ubutabera n'Intumwa Nkuru ya Leta. Yasimbuye Johnston Busingye. Busingye yari yagizwe Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda mu Bwongereza.\nMbere yaho, Ugirashebuja yari Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ubutabera rw'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EACJ), kuva mu 2014 kugeza mu 2020. Muri 2026, aracyari Minisitiri w'Ubutabera."}
{"id": "23672", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23672", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ingabo", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ingabo (\"Ministry of Defence\", MINADEF) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe kurinda ubusugire n'umutekano w'igihugu.\nIyobora Ingabo z'u Rwanda (RDF). Kuva muri Kamena 2023, Minisitiri w'Ingabo ni Juvenal Marizamunda.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya Minisiteri y'Ingabo ni ukurinda ubusugire bw'igihugu. Irinda kandi inyungu z'u Rwanda, ubutaka bwarwo, umutungo warwo n'indangagaciro zarwo. Intego yayo ni ukugira ingabo ziteguye kurwana, zishobora koherezwa vuba mu gihugu cyangwa hanze yacyo.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za Minisiteri y'Ingabo ni izi:\nIbigo bishamikiye kuri Minisiteri y'Ingabo ni ibi:\nAbaminisitiri.\nMu Ukwakira 2018, Albert Murasira yasimbuye James Kabarebe ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Ingabo.\nKu wa 5 Kamena 2023, Juvenal Marizamunda yasimbuye Murasira. Mbere yaho, Marizamunda yari Komiseri Mukuru w'Urwego rw'Igihugu rushinzwe Igorora (RCS). Yari kandi yarabaye Umuyobozi Mukuru Wungirije wa Polisi."}
{"id": "23673", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23673", "title": "Hassan Ngeze", "text": "Hassan Ngeze ni Umunyarwanda wari umwanditsi mukuru w'ikinyamakuru \"Kangura\". Yari kandi umwe mu bashinze ishyaka CDR.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside no gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside. Mu bujurire, yakatiwe imyaka 35 y'igifungo.\nUbuzima.\nNgeze akomoka muri komini Rubavu, muri perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Avuga ko yavutse ku wa 25 Ukuboza 1957. Inyandiko z'urukiko zo zivuga ko yavutse mu 1961.\nAvuga ko yabaye umunyamakuru kuva mu 1978 kugeza mu 1997. Mbere yaho, yakwirakwizaga ikinyamakuru \"Kanguka\" i Gisenyi, akanacyandikira.\nKangura na CDR.\nNgeze yashinze ikinyamakuru \"Kangura\" mu 1990. Yari umuyobozi wacyo n'umwanditsi mukuru wacyo. Mu Ukuboza 1990, \"Kangura\" yasohoye inyandiko yitwa \u00abAmategeko icumi y'Abahutu\u00bb. Iyo nyandiko yaburiraga abagabo b'Abahutu ku Batutsikazi. Ikinyamakuru cyagaragazaga Abatutsi nk'abagome, abanyabinyoma n'abicanyi.\nNgeze yari kandi umwe mu bashinze ishyaka CDR mu 1992. Yari umujyanama w'ubuyobozi bw'iryo shyaka.\nUrubanza.\nNgeze yafatiwe muri Kenya ku wa 18 Nyakanga 1997. Uwo munsi nyine yoherejwe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nYaburanishijwe hamwe na Ferdinand Nahimana na Jean-Bosco Barayagwiza. Uru rubanza ruzwi nk'\u00aburubanza rw'itangazamakuru\u00bb. Ku wa 3 Ukuboza 2003, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside, ubugambanyi bwo gukora Jenoside, gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside, n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Urukiko rwemeye ko yarokoye Abatutsi bamwe mu 1994.\nKu wa 28 Ugushyingo 2007, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwakuyeho bimwe mu byaha. Rwemeje icyaha cya Jenoside, icyo gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside, n'icyo gufasha mu itsembatsemba. Igihano cyagabanyijwe kiba imyaka 35.\nKu wa 3 Ukuboza 2008, Ngeze yoherejwe muri Mali kurangirizayo igihano cye."}
{"id": "23674", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23674", "title": "Minisiteri y'Umutekano mu Gihugu", "text": "Minisiteri y'Umutekano mu Gihugu (\"Ministry of Interior\", MININTER) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe umutekano imbere mu gihugu, amahoro n'igorora.\nIfite mu nshingano Polisi y'u Rwanda (RNP) n'Urwego rushinzwe Igorora (RCS). Kuva muri Kamena 2024, Minisitiri w'Umutekano mu Gihugu ni Vincent Biruta.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MININTER ni ukubungabunga umutekano imbere mu gihugu, amahoro n'ituze. Ishinzwe kandi ko igorora rikorwa neza.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MININTER ni izi:\nIbigo bishamikiye kuri MININTER birimo Polisi y'u Rwanda (RNP) n'Urwego rw'Igihugu rushinzwe Igorora (RCS).\nAmateka.\nKu wa 4 Ugushyingo 2019, Minisiteri y'Umutekano mu Gihugu yongeye gushyirwaho. Yahawe Patrick Nyamvumba. Muri Mata 2020, Nyamvumba yavanywe ku mirimo. Minisiteri nayo yavanyweho.\nKu wa 10 Ukuboza 2021, Alfred Gasana yagizwe Minisitiri w'Umutekano mu Gihugu. Mbere yaho, yakoraga mu Rwego rw'Igihugu rushinzwe Iperereza n'Umutekano (NISS).\nKu wa 12 Kamena 2024, Vincent Biruta yasimbuye Gasana. Mbere yaho, Biruta yari Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga."}
{"id": "23675", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23675", "title": "Eliezer Niyitegeka", "text": "Eli\u00e9zer Niyitegeka (12 Werurwe 1952 \u2013 28 Werurwe 2018) yari Umunyarwanda w'umunyamakuru n'umunyapolitiki. Yabaye Minisitiri w'Itangazamakuru muri guverinoma y'inzibacyuho yo mu 1994.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije uruhare mu bwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi i Bisesero mu gihe cya Jenoside. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Yapfiriye muri gereza muri Mali.\nUbuzima.\nNiyitegeka yavukiye i Gitabura, muri komini Gisovu, muri perefegitura ya Kibuye. Yabanje kuba umunyamakuru kuri Radiyo Rwanda.\nMu 1991, yari umwe mu bashinze ishyaka MDR. Kuva mu 1991 kugeza mu 1994, yayoboye iryo shyaka muri perefegitura ya Kibuye.\nKu wa 9 Mata 1994, yarahiriye kuba Minisitiri w'Itangazamakuru muri guverinoma y'inzibacyuho. Yagumye kuri uwo mwanya kugeza mu mpera za Nyakanga 1994, ubwo yahungaga u Rwanda.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nHagati ya Mata na Nyakanga 1994, Niyitegeka yagize uruhare mu bitero byagabwe ku Batutsi bari bahungiye i Bisesero, muri Kibuye. Urukiko rwemeje ko yashishikarije Interahamwe kwica Abatutsi. Rwemeje kandi ko we ubwe yagize uruhare mu kwica Umututsi witwa Kabanda n'umugore w'Umututsikazi.\nUrubanza.\nNiyitegeka yafatiwe i Nairobi, muri Kenya, ku wa 9 Gashyantare 1999. Nyuma y'iminsi itatu, yoherejwe muri gereza ya Loni i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nKu wa 16 Gicurasi 2003, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside, gushishikariza ku mugaragaro abantu gukora Jenoside, n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Urukiko rwemeye ko yarokoye Abahutu n'Abatutsi bamwe muri Jenoside. Rwasanze ariko ko ibyo bitaruta uburemere bw'ibyaha bye.\nKu wa 9 Nyakanga 2004, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwanze ubujurire bwe bwose. Igihano cya burundu cyagumyeho.\nNiyitegeka yapfuye ku wa 28 Werurwe 2018, arangiriza igihano cye muri Mali."}
{"id": "23676", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23676", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu (\"Ministry of Local Government\", MINALOC) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe imiyoborere myiza n'ubuyobozi bw'inzego z'ibanze.\nIkurikirana kandi gahunda z'imibereho myiza y'abaturage. Kuva muri Nyakanga 2025, Minisitiri w'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu ni Dominique Habimana.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINALOC ni uguhuza gahunda z'imiyoborere myiza n'iz'ubuyobozi bw'igihugu. Izo gahunda zigamije iterambere ry'ubukungu, imibereho myiza n'imiyoborere mu gihugu hose.\nIteka rya Minisitiri w'Intebe n\u00b0 107/03 ryo ku wa 15 Ukwakira 2020 riha MINALOC inshingano zikurikira:\nAbaminisitiri.\nJean Claude Musabyimana yayoboye MINALOC kuva mu Ugushyingo 2022. Ku wa 18 Ukwakira 2024, Patrice Mugenzi yamusimbuye. Mbere yaho, Mugenzi yari Umuyobozi Mukuru w'Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe Amakoperative.\nKu wa 24 Nyakanga 2025, Dominique Habimana yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu. Mbere yaho, yari Umunyamabanga Mukuru w'Ihuriro ry'Inzego z'Ibanze mu Rwanda (RALGA). Ku wa 28 Nyakanga 2025, Mugenzi yamushyikirije ubuyobozi bwa Minisiteri.\nMarie Solange Kayisire ni Minisitiri wa Leta muri MINALOC kuva ku wa 22 Kanama 2023."}
{"id": "23677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23677", "title": "Minisiteri y'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo", "text": "Minisiteri y'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo (\"Ministry of Public Service and Labour\", MIFOTRA) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe abakozi ba Leta n'umurimo.\nIgamije ko inzego za Leta zitanga serivisi nziza. Igamije kandi ko haboneka akazi keza ku Banyarwanda. Kuva muri Kamena 2026, Minisitiri w'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo ni Judith Uwizeye.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MIFOTRA ni uguha inzego za Leta imiterere myiza n'abakozi bashoboye. Ibyo bituma zitanga serivisi nziza ku giciro gito. Igamije kandi aho gukorera hanoze, hubahiriza amahame mpuzamahanga y'ubuzima n'ubwiteganyirize. Ibyo bifasha guhanga imirimo.\nIcyerekezo cya MIFOTRA ni ubutegetsi bwa Leta bukora neza kandi bwita ku baturage. Ni kandi igihugu gifite akazi keza n'abakozi bashoboye guhangana ku isoko.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MIFOTRA ni izi:\nAbaminisitiri.\nKu wa 14 Kamena 2024, Jeannette Bayisenge yashyikirije Jeanne d'Arc Mujawamariya ubuyobozi bwa MIFOTRA. Ku wa 25 Nyakanga 2024, Mujawamariya yavanywe ku mirimo ye.\nMuri Kanama 2024, Christine Nkulikiyinka yamusimbuye. Mbere yaho, yayoboraga Rwanda Cooperation Initiative.\nKu wa 10 Kamena 2026, Judith Uwizeye yasimbuye Nkulikiyinka. Nkulikiyinka yagizwe Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Espanye. Mbere yaho, Uwizeye yari Minisitiri muri Perezidansi ya Repubulika."}
{"id": "23678", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23678", "title": "Ildephonse Nizeyimana", "text": "Ild\u00e9phonse Nizeyimana (yavutse ku wa 5 Ukwakira 1963) ni Umunyarwanda wari kapiteni mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR). Mu 1994, yari umwe mu bayobozi b'ishuri rya gisirikare ry'abasuzofisiye (ESO) i Butare.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Mu bujurire, yakatiwe imyaka 35 y'igifungo.\nUbuzima.\nNizeyimana akomoka muri perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Mu 1994, yari kapiteni. Ku ishuri rya ESO i Butare, yari wungirije ushinzwe iperereza n'ibikorwa bya gisirikare.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nUrukiko rwemeje ko Nizeyimana yategetse kwica abantu benshi i Butare, cyane cyane muri Mata 1994. Muri bo harimo umwamikazi Rosalie Gicanda, umupfakazi w'umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa.\nUrubanza.\nNizeyimana yafatiwe i Kampala, muri Ubugande, ku wa 5 Ukwakira 2009. Bukeye bwaho, yoherejwe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nKu wa 19 Kamena 2012, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside, ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Urukiko rwamuhamije igitero cyagabwe kuri paruwasi ya Cyahinda. Muri icyo gitero hapfuye Abatutsi ibihumbi.\nKu wa 29 Nzeri 2014, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje ibyaha byinshi. Rwakuyeho icyaha cyo gutegura igitero cya Cyahinda. Rwakuyeho kandi bimwe mu bwicanyi bwabereye kuri bariyeri z'i Butare. Igihano cyagabanyijwe kiba imyaka 35."}
{"id": "23679", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23679", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ubucuruzi n'Inganda", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ubucuruzi n'Inganda (\"Ministry of Trade and Industry\", MINICOM) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe guteza imbere ubucuruzi n'inganda.\nIshinzwe kandi amakoperative, ishoramari n'uburenganzira bw'abaguzi. Kuva muri Kamena 2026, Minisitiri w'Ubucuruzi n'Inganda ni Antoine-Marie Kajangwe.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINICOM ni ukuyobora iterambere ry'ubucuruzi bwo mu gihugu n'ubwo hanze. Iteza imbere kandi ibigo n'amakoperative bishoboye guhangana ku isoko. Iteza imbere ishoramari n'uburenganzira bw'abaguzi.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MINICOM ni izi:\nAbaminisitiri.\nJean-Chrysostome Ngabitsinze yayoboye MINICOM kuva mu 2022. Muri Kanama 2024, Prudence Sebahizi yamusimbuye. Mbere yaho, Sebahizi yakoraga mu Bunyamabanga bw'Isoko Rusange rya Afurika (AfCFTA), i Accra muri Ghana.\nKu wa 10 Kamena 2026, Antoine-Marie Kajangwe yasimbuye Sebahizi. Mbere yaho, Kajangwe yari Umunyamabanga Uhoraho w'iyi minisiteri."}
{"id": "23680", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23680", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ikoranabuhanga mu Itumanaho na Inovasiyo", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ikoranabuhanga mu Itumanaho na Inovasiyo (\"Ministry of ICT and Innovation\", MINICT) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe ikoranabuhanga, itumanaho n'inovasiyo.\nKuva mu Ukwakira 2018, Minisitiri w'Ikoranabuhanga mu Itumanaho na Inovasiyo ni Paula Ingabire.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINICT ni ugutegura no guhuza politiki na gahunda by'igihugu ku ikoranabuhanga, itumanaho n'inovasiyo. Izo gahunda zigamije iterambere ry'ubukungu no kurwanya ubukene. Zigamije kandi guha abaturage ubushobozi.\nAbayobozi.\nKu wa 22 Ukwakira 2018, Jean de Dieu Rurangirwa yashyikirije Paula Ingabire ubuyobozi bwa Minisiteri. Muri 2026, Ingabire aracyari Minisitiri.\nYves Iradukunda ni Minisitiri wa Leta muri MINICT. Mbere yaho, yari Umunyamabanga Uhoraho w'iyi minisiteri kuva mu 2020 kugeza mu 2025."}
{"id": "23681", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23681", "title": "Aloys Ntiwiragabo", "text": "Aloys Ntiwiragabo ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari umusirikare mukuru. Mu 1994, yari umuyobozi w'ishami ry'iperereza rya gisirikare mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR).\nAkekwaho kugira uruhare mu gutegura Jenoside. Mu 2020, yabonetse aba mu Ubufaransa. Ubushinjacyaha bw'u Bufaransa bwatangiye iperereza ku byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Kugeza ubu, nta rukiko rwamuhamije icyaha.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, Ntiwiragabo yayoboraga ishami ry'iperereza rya gisirikare, ryitwa G2. Nyuma ya Jenoside, yahungiye hanze y'u Rwanda. Yayoboye ingabo za FAR zari mu buhungiro. Izo ngabo zaje kuvamo umutwe wa FDLR.\nIbyo ashinjwa.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuvuze nk'umwe mu bacuze umugambi wa Jenoside. Nyamara ntiyigeze aburanishwa n'urwo rukiko. Impapuro zo kumufata zari zarakuweho.\nMuri Nyakanga 2020, ikinyamakuru Mediapart cyamubonye atuye hafi y'umujyi wa Orl\u00e9ans, mu Bufaransa. Ubushinjacyaha bw'u Bufaransa bwahise butangira iperereza ry'ibanze ku byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Muri Kanama 2020, u Rwanda rwatanze impapuro mpuzamahanga zo kumufata.\nMu 2023, iryo perereza ntiryari ryarigeze rituma afatwa cyangwa akurikiranwa mu rukiko.\nIkirego cyo gutukwa.\nNtiwiragabo yareze umunyamakuru Maria Malagardis wo mu kinyamakuru \"Lib\u00e9ration\". Yamushinjaga kumutuka ku mbuga nkoranyambaga mu 2020. Mu rukiko rwa mbere, ikirego cye nticyakiriwe. Yahise ajurira."}
{"id": "23682", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23682", "title": "Tharcisse Renzaho", "text": "Tharcisse Renzaho (yavutse mu 1944) ni Umunyarwanda wari koloneli mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR). Mu 1994, yari perefe wa perefegitura y'Umujyi wa Kigali.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ubwicanyi nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nUbuzima.\nRenzaho yavukiye muri komini Kigarama, muri perefegitura ya Kibungo, mu 1944. Yari koloneli mu ngabo z'u Rwanda. Mu gihe cya Jenoside, yari perefe w'Umujyi wa Kigali. Guverinoma imaze guhungira mu majyepfo, yasigaye ari we muyobozi mukuru i Kigali.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nUrukiko rwemeje ko Renzaho yashyizeho bariyeri i Kigali. Abatutsi benshi biciwe kuri izo bariyeri. Yategetse ko intwaro zihabwa abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze. Izo ntwaro zakoreshejwe mu kwica Abatutsi.\nKu wa 22 Mata 1994, yagenzuye itoranywa ry'abantu bagera kuri 40 bari bahungiye ahitwa CELA. Abo bantu barajyanywe, baricwa.\nKu wa 17 Kamena 1994, yagize uruhare mu gitero cyagabwe kuri kiliziya ya Sainte-Famille. Abatutsi barenga 100 barahiciwe.\nUrubanza.\nRenzaho yafatiwe i Kinshasa, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ku wa 29 Nzeri 2002. Bukeye bwaho, yoherejwe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nKu wa 14 Nyakanga 2009, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside, ubwicanyi no gufata ku ngufu nk'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu, n'ibyaha by'intambara. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nKu wa 1 Mata 2011, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwakuyeho icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu. Rwemeje icyaha cya Jenoside n'icy'ubwicanyi. Igihano cya burundu cyagumyeho."}
{"id": "23683", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23683", "title": "Minisiteri y'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango", "text": "Minisiteri y'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango (\"Ministry of Gender and Family Promotion\", MIGEPROF) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe uburinganire, iterambere ry'umuryango no kurengera uburenganzira bw'abana.\nKuva muri Kamena 2024, Minisitiri w'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango ni Consol\u00e9e Uwimana.\nAmateka.\nMinisiteri yashinzwe mu 1992. Icyo gihe yitwaga MIFAPROFE. Yari ishinzwe iterambere ry'umuryango n'iry'abagore.\nMu 1997, Minisiteri yahinduye izina yitwa MIGEFASO. Yahawe kandi inshingano z'imibereho myiza y'abaturage. Mu 1999, yitwa MIGEPROF. Yibanze ku buringanire no guteza imbere abagore. Mu 2005, yashyizwe mu Ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe. Mu 2013, yongeye kwigenga.\nInshingano.\nMIGEPROF ni urwego rwa Leta ruhuza politiki z'igihugu ku buringanire no ku iterambere ry'umuryango. Ihuza kandi politiki zo guteza imbere abagore no kurengera uburenganzira bw'abana. Ikorana n'izindi nzego za Leta, abafatanyabikorwa, imiryango itari iya Leta n'abikorera.\nIntego za Minisiteri zirimo kurandura ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina. Zirimo kandi gukomeza ubumwe bw'umuryango n'uburere bwiza bw'abana.\nAbayobozi.\nKu wa 21 Ukwakira 2018, Esp\u00e9rance Nyirasafari yashyikirije Solina Nyirahabimana ubuyobozi bwa Minisiteri.\nMuri Gashyantare 2020, Jeannette Bayisenge yabaye Minisitiri. Yasimbuye Solina Nyirahabimana.\nMuri Kanama 2023, Bayisenge yimuriwe muri Minisiteri y'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo. Valentine Uwamariya yamusimbuye. Mbere yaho, Uwamariya yari Minisitiri w'Uburezi.\nKu wa 12 Kamena 2024, Consol\u00e9e Uwimana yagizwe Minisitiri. Uwamariya yimuriwe muri Minisiteri y'Ibidukikije. Muri 2026, Uwimana aracyari Minisitiri.\nMireille Batamuliza ni Umunyamabanga Uhoraho wa Minisiteri kuva mu Ugushyingo 2021."}
{"id": "23684", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23684", "title": "Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko n'Ubuhanzi", "text": "Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko n'Ubuhanzi (\"Ministry of Youth and Arts\", MoYA) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe guteza imbere urubyiruko n'ubuhanzi.\nIfasha urubyiruko kwiteza imbere mu bukungu no mu mibereho. Minisitiri w'Urubyiruko n'Ubuhanzi ni Jean Nepo Abdallah Utumatwishima.\nInshingano.\nIntego ya Minisiteri ni uguha urubyiruko uburyo bwo kwiteza imbere mu bukungu no mu mibereho. Ifite kandi intego yo guteza imbere ubuhanzi.\nInshingano zayo z'ingenzi ni izi:\nMinisiteri ifite amashami atatu: iterambere ry'ubukungu bw'urubyiruko, iteza imbere ry'ubuhanzi, no gukangurira urubyiruko. Ikurikirana Inama y'Igihugu y'Urubyiruko (NYC), gahunda ya AGUKA na YouthConnekt Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nMbere ya 2023, iyi Minisiteri yitwaga Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko n'Umuco. Rosemary Mbabazi yayiyoboye kuva mu 2017.\nMuri Werurwe 2023, Jean Nepo Abdallah Utumatwishima yagizwe Minisitiri w'Urubyiruko. Ku wa 31 Werurwe 2023, Mbabazi yamushyikirije ubuyobozi bwa Minisiteri. Uwo munsi, ibijyanye n'umuco byimuriwe muri MINUBUMWE.\nSandrine Umutoni ni Minisitiri wa Leta kuva ku wa 22 Kanama 2023. Mbere yaho, yari Umuyobozi Mukuru wa Imbuto Foundation. Ku wa 15 Nyakanga 2026, Parfait Ishungure yagizwe Umunyamabanga Uhoraho wa Minisiteri."}
{"id": "23685", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23685", "title": "Ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe", "text": "Ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe (\"Office of the Prime Minister\", mu Gifaransa \"Primature\") ni urwego rwa Guverinoma y'u Rwanda. Biyoborwa na Minisitiri w'Intebe. Bishinzwe guhuza ibikorwa bya Guverinoma.\nKuva muri Nyakanga 2025, Minisitiri w'Intebe ni Justin Nsengiyumva.\nInshingano.\nIbiro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe bishinzwe guhuza ibikorwa bya Guverinoma. Bikurikirana kandi ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya politiki na gahunda bya Guverinoma.\nMinisitiri w'Intebe ayobora imikorere ya Guverinoma. Akurikiza amabwiriza ya Perezida wa Repubulika. Ategura gahunda za Guverinoma afatanyije n'abandi bagize Inama y\u2019Abaminisitiri. Akora kandi indi mirimo ahabwa n'Itegeko Nshinga n'andi mategeko.\nKuva mu 2005 kugeza mu 2013, Minisiteri y'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango yari mu Biro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nAbayobozi.\nKu wa 25 Nyakanga 2025, Justin Nsengiyumva yarahiriye kuba Minisitiri w'Intebe. Yasimbuye \u00c9douard Ngirente.\nInes Mpambara ni Minisitiri mu Biro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe kuva ku wa 26 Gashyantare 2020. Ashinzwe imigendekere myiza y'Inama y'Abaminisitiri.\nMichelle Byusa ni Umunyamabanga Uhoraho mu Biro bya Minisitiri w'Intebe."}
{"id": "23686", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23686", "title": "Georges Rutaganda", "text": "Georges Rutaganda (27 Ugushyingo 1958 \u2013 11 Ukwakira 2010) yari Umunyarwanda wari visi-perezida wa kabiri wa komite y'igihugu y'Interahamwe.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Yapfiriye muri gereza muri Bene.\nUbuzima.\nRutaganda yari umwe mu bagize komite z'ishyaka MRND ku rwego rw'igihugu no ku rwego rwa perefegitura. Yari visi-perezida wa kabiri wa komite y'igihugu y'Interahamwe, umutwe w'urubyiruko wa MRND. Yari kandi umunyamigabane wa radiyo RTLM.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nUrukiko rwemeje ko Rutaganda yagize uruhare mu bwicanyi bw'Abatutsi ibihumbi. Ubwo bwicanyi bwabereye ku ishuri rya ETO i Kicukiro no i Nyanza, muri Kigali.\nUrubanza.\nRutaganda yafatiwe muri Zambiya ku wa 10 Ukwakira 1995. Ku wa 26 Gicurasi 1996, yoherejwe muri gereza ya ICTR i Arusha.\nKu wa 6 Ukuboza 1999, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside n'itsembatsemba nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Yanamuhamije kwica impunzi y'Umututsi akoresheje umuhoro. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Urukiko rwemeye ko yarokoye Abatutsi bamwe. Rwasanze ariko uburemere bw'ibyaha bye buruta ibyo.\nKu wa 26 Gicurasi 2003, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyaha cya Jenoside n'icy'itsembatsemba. Rwamuhamije kandi ibyaha by'intambara ku bwicanyi bwa ETO na Nyanza. Ni bwo bwa mbere ICTR yahamije umuntu ibyaha by'intambara. Igihano cya burundu cyagumyeho.\nUrupfu.\nKu wa 27 Kamena 2009, Rutaganda yoherejwe muri Bene kurangirizayo igihano cye. Yapfuye ku wa 11 Ukwakira 2010, afite imyaka 52. Yazize indwara yari amaranye igihe kirekire."}
{"id": "23689", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23689", "title": "Venant Rutunga", "text": "Venant Rutunga ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari umuyobozi w'akarere w'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi mu buhinzi ISAR, ishami rya Rubona, mu Akarere ka Huye.\nMu 2021, yoherejwe mu Rwanda avuye mu Ubuholandi. Mu 2024, urukiko rwamuhamije icyaha cy'ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside. Yakatiwe imyaka 20 y'igifungo.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, Rutunga yari umuyobozi w'akarere w'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi ISAR i Rubona, mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda. Icyo kigo cyari mu cyahoze ari perefegitura ya Butare, ubu ni mu Karere ka Huye.\nIbyo yashinjwaga.\nAbatutsi barenga igihumbi bari bahungiye ku kigo cya ISAR Rubona mu 1994. Ubushinjacyaha bwavugaga ko Rutunga yahamagaye abajandarume, abasirikare n'Interahamwe aho kurinda izo mpunzi. Izo mpunzi zaje kwicwa.\nRutunga n'abamwunganira bavugaga ko yahamagaye abajandarume kugira ngo barinde impunzi. Bavugaga ko abo bajandarume bakoze ibinyuranye n'ibyo yabasabye. Bamwe mu batangabuhamya bavuze ko yari inyangamugayo.\nUrubanza.\nRutunga yafatiwe mu Buholandi muri Werurwe 2019. Muri Nyakanga 2021, Ubuholandi bwamwohereje mu Rwanda.\nYaburanishijwe n'Urugereko rwihariye rw'Urukiko Rukuru ruburanisha ibyaha mpuzamahanga n'ibyambukiranya imipaka, i Nyanza. Muri Nzeri 2024, urwo rukiko rwamuhamije icyaha cy'ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside. Rwasanze yarahamagaye abajandarume bagize uruhare mu bwicanyi bwa ISAR Rubona. Ntirwamuhamije ibindi byaha bya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe imyaka 20 y'igifungo."}
{"id": "23691", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23691", "title": "Onesphore Rwabukombe", "text": "Onesphore Rwabukombe ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa komini Muvumba. Yari atuye mu Ubudage kuva mu 2002.\nMu 2015, urukiko rw'i Frankfurt mu Budage rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside. Rwasanze yaragize uruhare mu bwicanyi bwabereye kuri kiliziya ya Kiziguro. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nUbwicanyi bwa Kiziguro.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri kiliziya ya Kiziguro barishwe. Urukiko rwemeje ko hapfuye nibura abantu 450. Rwavuze ko umubare nyawo ushobora kuba urenze uwo.\nUrukiko rwemeje ko Rwabukombe n'abandi bayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze bateguye icyo gitero, bakagitegeka. Yazanye abandi bicanyi kuri kiliziya. Yagenzuye kandi ijyanwa ry'imirambo mu rwobo rwari hafi aho. Rwabukombe yahakanye ko yari aho ubwo bwicanyi bwabereye.\nUrubanza mu Budage.\nRwabukombe yageze mu Budage mu 2002, asaba ubuhungiro bwa politiki. Yafashwe mu 2011, hakurikijwe impapuro zo kumufata za Interpol.\nMuri Gashyantare 2014, urukiko rw'i Frankfurt rwamuhamije gufasha mu gukora Jenoside. Yakatiwe imyaka 14 y'igifungo. Impande zombi zarajuriye. Urukiko rukuru rw'igihugu rwategetse ko urubanza rwongera kuburanishwa.\nKu wa 29 Ukuboza 2015, urukiko rw'i Frankfurt rwamuhamije Jenoside nk'umwe mu bayobozi bateguye ubwicanyi. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu."}
{"id": "23692", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23692", "title": "Eugene Rwamucyo", "text": "Eug\u00e8ne Rwamucyo ni Umunyarwanda w'umuganga. Mu 1994, yari umwarimu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda i Butare.\nMu 2024, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside. Yakatiwe imyaka 27 y'igifungo. Mu 2026, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano.\nUbuzima.\nMu 1994, Rwamucyo yari umuganga n'umwarimu muri kaminuza i Butare. Nyuma ya Jenoside, yagiye gukora akazi k'ubuganga mu Ubufaransa no mu Ububiligi.\nIbyo yashinjwaga.\nKu wa 14 Gicurasi 1994, Jean Kambanda, Minisitiri w'Intebe wa guverinoma y'inzibacyuho, yasuye kaminuza ya Butare. Rwamucyo yavuze ijambo rishyigikira politiki y'iyo guverinoma. Ubushinjacyaha bwavuze ko iryo jambo ryashishikarizaga kwica Abatutsi.\nRwamucyo yagize uruhare mu gushyingura abishwe mu byobo rusange. Abatangabuhamya bavuze ko hari abakomeretse bashyinguwe ari bazima. Rwamucyo we yavuze ko yakoraga gusa ibijyanye n'isuku, kugira ngo imirambo itanduza indwara. Abamwunganira bavuze ko akurikiranwa kubera ko arwanya ubutegetsi buriho mu Rwanda.\nUrubanza.\nMu Rwanda, urukiko rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu adahari. U Bufaransa bwanze kumwohereza mu Rwanda. Mu 2010, yafatiwe hafi ya Paris, ubwo yari mu mihango yo gushyingura Jean-Bosco Barayagwiza.\nKu wa 30 Ukwakira 2024, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha mu byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu, n'ubugambanyi bwo gutegura ibyo byaha. Ntirwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside ubwacyo. Yakatiwe imyaka 27 y'igifungo.\nMu ijoro ryo ku wa 17 rishyira ku wa 18 Nyakanga 2026, urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwemeje ibyo byaha. Igihano cy'imyaka 27 cyagumyeho. Rwamucyo yahise ajuririra Urukiko rusesa imanza."}
{"id": "23693", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23693", "title": "Theodore Sindikubwabo", "text": "Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo (1928 \u2013 1998) yari umuganga n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwanda. Yabaye Perezida w'inzibacyuho w'u Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nKu wa 19 Mata 1994, yavugiye i Butare ijambo ryashishikarije abaturage gukora \u00abakazi\u00bb, ni ukuvuga kwica Abatutsi. Yapfiriye mu buhungiro mu 1998, atarigeze aburanishwa.\nUbuzima.\nSindikubwabo yavukiye i Butare. Yari yarize ubuganga. Yabaye Minisitiri w'Ubuzima ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda. Nyuma yaho, yabaye perezida w'Inama y'Igihugu Iharanira Amajyambere (CND), ari yo yari inteko ishinga amategeko. Yayiyoboye kugeza muri Mata 1994.\nPerezida w'inzibacyuho.\nPerezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana yishwe ku wa 6 Mata 1994. Nyuma y'urupfu rwe, Sindikubwabo yagizwe Perezida w'inzibacyuho. Yayoboye igihugu hafi amezi atatu. Jean Kambanda yari Minisitiri w'Intebe we.\nIjambo ryo ku wa 19 Mata 1994.\nKu wa 19 Mata 1994, i Butare habaye umuhango wo gushyiraho perefe mushya, Sylvain Nsabimana. Uwari perefe, Jean-Baptiste Habyalimana, yari yakuwe ku mwanya we muri icyo gitondo. Muri uwo muhango, Sindikubwabo yavuze ijambo ryanyujijwe kuri radiyo y'igihugu.\nYasabye abatarimo \u00abgukora\u00bb kuvamo, bakareka abandi \u00abbagakora\u00bb. Muri icyo gihe, ijambo \u00abgukora\u00bb ryasobanuraga kwica Abatutsi. Ubwicanyi bwari bwatangiye mbere y'iryo jambo. Ariko nyuma yaryo, bwakwiriye mu makomini menshi ya Butare. Nyuma y'iryo jambo, yagiye no mu makomini ya Ndora, Shyanda na Gisagara.\nUrupfu.\nIngabo za FPR zimaze gufata igihugu, Sindikubwabo yahungiye muri Zayire, ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yapfiriye muri icyo gihugu mu 1998. Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) ntirwigeze rumurega."}
{"id": "23694", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23694", "title": "Charles Twagira", "text": "Charles Twagira ni Umunyarwanda w'umuganga. Mu 1994, yari umuyobozi w'ibitaro bya Kibuye, mu Karongi y'ubu.\nAkekwaho uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi i Kibuye. Mu Rwanda, yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu adahari. Mu Ubufaransa, aregwa Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu, ariko ntaraburanishwa.\nIbyo ashinjwa.\nMu 1994, Twagira yayoboraga ibitaro bikuru bya Kibuye. Ashinjwa gukoresha ibyo bitaro mu guhiga Abatutsi no kubima ubuvuzi. Ashinjwa kandi gutegeka iyicwa ry'umushoferi w'Umututsi ku wa 16 Mata 1994. Bivugwa ko yari kuri sitade ya Gatwaro ubwo habaga ubwicanyi ku wa 18 na 19 Mata 1994.\nUrubanza.\nMu 2009, urukiko rw'i Kibuye rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu adahari. Muri uwo mwaka, Ihuriro ry'abarenganyijwe bo mu Rwanda (CPCR) ryamureze mu Bufaransa.\nTwagira yari umuganga mu bitaro by'i Vire, mu Bufaransa. Ku wa 20 Werurwe 2014, yashyikirijwe ubutabera bw'u Bufaransa, aregwa Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yahise afungwa by'agateganyo. Ku wa 22 Gicurasi 2015, urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwamurekuye. Ategekwa kutava mu Bufaransa nta ruhushya.\nMu 2024, iperereza ry'abacamanza ryari rigikomeje. Kugeza ubu, nta rukiko rwo mu Bufaransa rwari rwamuburanisha."}
{"id": "23695", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23695", "title": "Fulgence Niyonteze", "text": "Fulgence Niyonteze ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa komini Mushubati, muri perefegitura ya Gitarama.\nMu 1994, yagize uruhare mu bwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi mu gihe cya Jenoside. Yaburanishijwe n'inkiko za gisirikare zo mu Ubusuwisi. Mu 2001, igihano cy'imyaka 14 y'igifungo cyemejwe burundu.\nBurugumesitiri wa Mushubati.\nNiyonteze yatorewe kuba burugumesitiri wa komini Mushubati mu 1992. Yatangiye imirimo muri Mata 1993.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nMu mpera za Gicurasi 1994, Niyonteze yakoresheje inama ku musozi wa Mushubati. Yasabye abaturage \u00abgukora isuku\u00bb, ni ukuvuga kwica Abatutsi n'Abahutu batavugaga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Yashishikarije kwica Abatutsi bari barokotse. Nyuma y'iyo nama, abantu benshi barishwe.\nYagiye kandi i Kabgayi, aho impunzi zo muri komini ye zari zarahungiye. Yazisabye gusubira i Mushubati, kugira ngo zicwe. Yategetse abasirikare kwica abantu babiri. Umwe muri bo yararokotse.\nUrubanza mu Busuwisi.\nMu 1996, Niyonteze yari atuye mu Busuwisi nk'impunzi. Muri uwo mwaka, yarafashwe, iperereza riratangira.\nUrubanza rwe rwabereye mu rukiko rwa gisirikare rw'i Lausanne, kuva ku wa 12 kugeza ku wa 30 Mata 1999. Ni rwo rubanza rwa mbere rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi rwabereye mu rukiko rw'ikindi gihugu. Ku wa 30 Mata 1999, urwo rukiko rwamuhamije ubwicanyi, gushishikariza abandi kwica, n'ibyaha by'intambara. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nMuri Gicurasi 2000, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwa gisirikare rwamuhamije gusa ibyaha by'intambara. Igihano cyagabanyijwe kiba imyaka 14 y'igifungo. Ntiyahamijwe icyaha cya Jenoside. Icyo gihe, Ubusuwisi bwari butaremeza amasezerano mpuzamahanga yerekeye Jenoside.\nKu wa 27 Mata 2001, urukiko rusesa imanza rwa gisirikare rwemeje igihano cy'imyaka 14."}
{"id": "23696", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23696", "title": "Samuel Imanishimwe", "text": "Samuel Imanishimwe ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari liyetona mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR). Mu 1994, yayoboraga ikigo cya gisirikare i Cyangugu.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara. Mu bujurire, yakatiwe imyaka 12 y'igifungo. Yarekuwe mu 2009, amaze kurangiza igihano.\nIbyo yakoze muri Jenoside.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside, Imanishimwe yategetse abasirikare gufata abasivili. Abo basivili bafungiwe mu kigo cya gisirikare cya Karambo, i Cyangugu. Bakorewe iyicarubozo, bamwe baricwa.\nUrukiko rwa mbere rwanamuhamije ubwicanyi bwabereye ku kibuga cy'umupira cya Gashirabwoba. Rwavuze ko atabujije abasirikare be kubugiramo uruhare. Icyo cyaha cyakuweho mu bujurire.\nUrubanza.\nImanishimwe yafatiwe i Mombasa, muri Kenya, ku wa 11 Kanama 1997. Uwo munsi nyine, yoherejwe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nYaburanishijwe hamwe na Andr\u00e9 Ntagerura na Emmanuel Bagambiki. Abo bombi bagizwe abere.\nKu wa 25 Gashyantare 2004, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside, ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara. Yakatiwe imyaka 27 y'igifungo.\nKu wa 7 Nyakanga 2006, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwakuyeho icyaha cya Jenoside n'icy'itsembatsemba. Rwemeje ubwicanyi, ifungwa ritemewe n'iyicarubozo nk'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwemeje kandi ibyaha by'intambara byakorewe i Karambo. Igihano cyagabanyijwe kiba imyaka 12.\nMu 2007, ICTR yanze kumurekura mbere y'igihe. Yarangirije igihano cye muri Mali. Yarekuwe muri Kanama 2009. Ntiyashakaga gusubira mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "23697", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23697", "title": "Th\u00e9odore Munyangabe", "text": "Th\u00e9odore Munyangabe ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari superefe muri perefegitura ya Cyangugu mu 1994.\nMu 1997, urukiko rw'i Cyangugu rwamukatiye igihano cy'urupfu kubera uruhare muri Jenoside. Mu 1999, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwamugize umwere. Nyuma y'amezi abiri, yongeye gufungwa ku kindi kirego.\nUbuzima.\nMunyangabe yavukiye i Nyamavugo, mu murenge wa Bunyangurube, muri komini Gafunzo, muri perefegitura ya Cyangugu. Mu 1994, yari superefe muri perefegitura ya Cyangugu, ayoborwa na perefe Emmanuel Bagambiki. Yakomeje kuri uwo mwanya na nyuma y'uko FPR ifata ubutegetsi muri Nyakanga 1994.\nUrubanza.\nMunyangabe yafashwe ku wa 10 Werurwe 1995. Yaregwaga ibyaha umunani byabaye muri Mata 1994. Muri byo harimo gushishikariza Jenoside i Karambi, kuyobora ubwicanyi i Mibirizi, n'ubwicanyi bwabereye kuri sitade Kamarampaka n'i Shangi.\nKu wa 26 Gashyantare 1997, urugereko rwihariye rw'Urukiko rwa mbere rw'iremezo rwa Cyangugu rwamukatiye igihano cy'urupfu.\nKu wa 6 Nyakanga 1999, Urukiko rw'ubujurire rwa Cyangugu rwamugize umwere ku byaha byose. Rwasanze nta bimenyetso bihagije bihari. Rwavuze ko yagiye i Mibirizi gutabara, atari kugaba igitero. Rwavuze kandi ko yahungishije impunzi 40 zivuye i Shangi, zijyanwa kuri sitade Kamarampaka, aho zarokokeye. Yarekuwe ku wa 8 Nyakanga 1999.\nKu wa 17 Nzeri 1999, yongeye gufatwa. Yaregwaga kugira uruhare mu iyicwa ry'Abatutsi batatu mu 1992. Umuryango uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu LIPRODHOR wavuze ko ibyo binyuranyije n'ihame ribuza kuburanishwa kabiri ku cyaha kimwe. Mu 2003, yari agifunzwe mu Rwanda. Muri uwo mwaka, yatanze ubuhamya muri ICTR, ashinjura Emmanuel Bagambiki."}
{"id": "23698", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23698", "title": "Augustin Bizimungu", "text": "Augustin Bizimungu (yavutse ku wa 28 Kanama 1952) ni Umunyarwanda wari jenerali mu ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR). Yabaye umugaba mukuru w'ingabo kuva muri Mata 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUrukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside, ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara. Yakatiwe imyaka 30 y'igifungo.\nUmwuga.\nBizimungu akomoka muri perefegitura ya Byumba. Muri Mutarama 1994, yagizwe umuyobozi w'ibikorwa bya gisirikare mu gace ka Ruhengeri.\nKu wa 16 Mata 1994, yazamuwe mu ntera, ava ku ipeti rya koloneli ajya ku rya jenerali majoro. Yagizwe umugaba mukuru w'ingabo z'u Rwanda. Yatangiye uwo mwanya ku wa 19 Mata 1994.\nUrubanza.\nBizimungu yafatiwe muri Angola ku wa 2 Kanama 2002. Yaburanishijwe hamwe n'abandi basirikare bakuru, mu rubanza rwiswe \u00abMilitary II\u00bb. Muri bo harimo Augustin Ndindiliyimana, wari umuyobozi wa jandarumori.\nKu wa 17 Gicurasi 2011, ICTR yamuhamije Jenoside, itsembatsemba, ubwicanyi no gufata ku ngufu nk'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu, n'ibyaha by'intambara. Yakatiwe imyaka 30 y'igifungo. Urukiko rwasanze yaragenzuraga neza abasirikare yayoboraga, bagize uruhare mu bwicanyi.\nKu wa 30 Kamena 2014, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwakuyeho bimwe mu byaha. Muri byo harimo ubwicanyi bwabereye i Rwankeri, n'ibyaha byakorewe kuri perefegitura ya Butare. Rwemeje ibindi byaha, birimo ibyakorewe i Kabgayi, i Musambira no kuri sitade ya Cyangugu. Igihano cy'imyaka 30 cyagumyeho."}
{"id": "23699", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23699", "title": "Tito Barahira", "text": "Tito Barahira (wapfuye muri Nyakanga 2024) yari Umunyarwanda wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa komini Kabarondo, mu Akarere ka Kayonza y'ubu.\nMu 2016, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Yapfiriye muri gereza mu Ubufaransa.\nUbuzima.\nBarahira yabaye burugumesitiri wa komini Kabarondo kuva mu 1977 kugeza mu 1986. Yasimbuwe na Octavien Ngenzi. Mu 1994, yari perezida w'ishyaka MRND muri iyo komini.\nIbyo yahamijwe.\nKu wa 13 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahungiye muri kiliziya ya Kabarondo barishwe. Bivugwa ko hapfuye abantu barenga 2 000. Abatangabuhamya bavuze ko Barahira yari afite icumu. Bavuze ko yagize uruhare mu gutoranya impunzi zari zarokotse ubwicanyi bwo muri kiliziya.\nUmwunganizi we yavuze ko atari ari kuri kiliziya. Yavuze ko abarokotse icyenda bemeje ko batamubonye.\nUrubanza mu Bufaransa.\nBarahira yari yarahinduye izina, yiyita Barahirwa. Yafatiwe i Toulouse muri Mata 2013.\nMuri Nyakanga 2016, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Yaburanishijwe hamwe na Octavien Ngenzi.\nKu wa 6 Nyakanga 2018, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano. Ku wa 16 Ukwakira 2019, Urukiko rusesa imanza rwanze ubujurire bwe. Igihano cyabaye ndakuka.\nUrupfu.\nBarahira yapfiriye muri gereza mu Bufaransa, afite imyaka 72. Urupfu rwe rwatangajwe ku wa 29 Nyakanga 2024."}
{"id": "23700", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23700", "title": "Octavien Ngenzi", "text": "Octavien Ngenzi ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa komini Kabarondo, mu Akarere ka Kayonza y'ubu.\nMu 2016, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nNgenzi yakuriye mu muryango ukennye. Se yari umuhinzi. Ngenzi yize iby'ubuhinzi. Minisiteri y'Ubuhinzi yamwohereje gukorera i Kabarondo, komini yakomokagamo.\nUmwuga.\nKu wa 7 Gicurasi 1986, Ngenzi yabaye burugumesitiri wa komini Kabarondo. Yasimbuye Tito Barahira. Ngenzi yayoboye iyo komini kugeza muri Mata 1994.\nIbyo yahamijwe.\nKu wa 13 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahungiye muri kiliziya ya Kabarondo barishwe. Bivugwa ko hapfuye abantu barenga 2 000.\nUbushinjacyaha bwavuze ko Ngenzi yatangaga amabwiriza. Bwavuze ko yagenzuraga ubwicanyi, nubwo atishe abantu n'amaboko ye.\nAbunganizi be bavuze ko yarebaga ubwicanyi bwo muri kiliziya afite ubwoba. Bavuze kandi ko yarokoye bamwe mu baturage.\nUrubanza mu Bufaransa.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Ngenzi yahunze u Rwanda. Yanyuze muri Kenya no muri Komore. Ku wa 3 Kamena 2010, yafatiwe i Mayotte. Yari yarasabye ubuhungiro bwa politiki akoresheje izina ritari irye.\nMuri Nyakanga 2016, urukiko rwa rubanda rw'i Paris rwamuhamije Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Yaburanishijwe hamwe na Tito Barahira. Urubanza rwamaze ibyumweru umunani.\nKu wa 6 Nyakanga 2018, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano. Ku wa 16 Ukwakira 2019, Urukiko rusesa imanza rwanze ubujurire bwe. Igihano cyabaye ndakuka."}
{"id": "23701", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23701", "title": "Jean-Baptiste Gakwerere", "text": "Jean-Baptiste Gakwerere ni umusirikare w'Umunyarwanda. Yari umwe mu bayobozi bakuru b'umutwe wa FDLR.\nKu wa 1 Werurwe 2025, yashyikirijwe u Rwanda nyuma yo gufatirwa i Goma, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Akekwaho kugira uruhare mu iyicwa ry'Umwamikazi Rosalie Gicanda, ku wa 20 Mata 1994.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nGakwerere yavukiye muri komini Shyorongi, muri perefegitura ya Kigali-Ngali.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, Gakwerere yari liyetona mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya ESO i Butare. Uwo mwaka, ishuri ryayoborwaga na Kapiteni Ildephonse Nizeyimana.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Gakwerere yahungiye muri Kongo. Yinjiye mu mutwe wa FDLR. Yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru w'uwo mutwe. Yari afite ipeti rya burigadiye jenerali.\nIfatwa rye.\nKu wa 1 Werurwe 2025, umutwe wa M23 wamushyikirije ingabo z'u Rwanda. Byabereye ku mupaka wa Grande Barri\u00e8re, mu Akarere ka Rubavu. Gakwerere yari kumwe n'abandi barwanyi 13 ba FDLR.\nM23 yavuze ko yafatiwe i Goma. Gakwerere yari azwi no ku yandi mazina, nka Sibomana Stany.\nIbyo akekwaho.\nKu wa 20 Mata 1994, abasirikare bafashe Umwamikazi Rosalie Gicanda iwe i Butare. Bamwiciye inyuma y'inzu ndangamurage. Bivugwa ko Kapiteni Nizeyimana ari we watanze itegeko ryo kumwica.\nGakwerere akekwaho kuba mu itsinda ryashyize mu bikorwa iryo tegeko. Akekwaho kandi uruhare mu iyicwa rya Jean-Baptiste Habyarimana, wari perefe wa Butare."}
{"id": "23702", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23702", "title": "Icyemezo cya Akayesu", "text": "Icyemezo cya Akayesu ni urubanza rwaciwe ku wa 2 Nzeri 1998 n'Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR). Urwo rubanza rwerekeye Jean-Paul Akayesu, wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa komini Taba.\nNi ubwa mbere urukiko mpuzamahanga rwahamije umuntu icyaha cya jenoside. Ni ubwa mbere kandi urukiko mpuzamahanga rwemeje ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora kuba uburyo bwo gukora jenoside.\nAmateka.\nJean-Paul Akayesu yari burugumesitiri wa komini Taba kuva muri Mata 1993 kugeza muri Kamena 1994. Nyuma ya Jenoside, yahungiye muri Zayire, hanyuma ajya muri Zambiya. Yafatiwe muri Zambiya mu Ukwakira 1995. Yajyanywe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya, kugira ngo aburanishwe na ICTR.\nIcyemezo.\nKu wa 2 Nzeri 1998, urugereko rwa mbere rw'iburanisha rwahamije Akayesu ibyaha 9 kuri 15 yaregwaga. Muri ibyo byaha harimo jenoside no gushishikariza abantu mu ruhame gukora jenoside. Harimo kandi ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu: gutsemba, ubwicanyi, iyicarubozo no gufata ku ngufu.\nAbacamanza batatu bafashe icyo cyemezo bose bemeranya. Bari Laity Kama wo muri Senegali, Lennart Aspegren wo muri Suwede na Navanethem Pillay wo muri Afurika y'Epfo.\nAkayesu yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Ku wa 1 Kamena 2001, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano. Akayesu afungiwe muri gereza yo muri Mali.\nAkamaro k'icyemezo.\nNi ubwa mbere urukiko mpuzamahanga rwahamije umuntu icyaha cya jenoside. Ni ubwa mbere kandi urukiko mpuzamahanga rwasobanuye icyaha cya jenoside nk'uko kiri mu Masezerano yo mu 1948.\nIcyemezo cya Akayesu cyasobanuye gufata ku ngufu nk'icyaha mpuzamahanga. Cyemeje kandi ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora kuba uburyo bwo gukora jenoside."}
{"id": "23705", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23705", "title": "Akazu", "text": "Akazu ni izina ryahabwaga itsinda ry'abantu ba hafi ba Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana mbere ya 1994. Iryo tsinda ryari rigizwe ahanini n'umugore we, Agathe Habyarimana, n'abo mu muryango we.\nAbagize Akazu bakoreshaga ububasha bwa Leta mu nyungu zabo bwite. Bamwe muri bo baregwe uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nInkomoko y'izina.\nMu Ikinyarwanda, ijambo \"akazu\" risobanura inzu nto.\nMu rubanza rwa Protais Zigiranyirazo, umutangabuhamya Jean-Marie Vianney Nkezabera yavuze ko ishyaka MDR ari ryo ryahimbye iryo zina mu 1991. Yavuze ko ryari rigamije guca intege Habyarimana n'abamushyigikiye.\nAbagize Akazu.\nAkazu kari itsinda ryihariye mu bantu ba hafi ba Habyarimana. Abenshi bakomokaga mu karere Habyarimana yavukagamo. Agathe Habyarimana n'abo mu muryango we bari bafite uruhare runini.\nBamwe mu bari bakagize ni aba:\nAkazu kifashishaga kandi abasirikare. Muri bo harimo Koloneli Th\u00e9oneste Bagosora, Majoro L\u00e9onard Nkundiye na Kapiteni Pascal Simbikangwa.\nR\u00e9seau z\u00e9ro.\nChristophe Mfizi yari umuntu wa hafi wa Habyarimana. Yayoboraga ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe itangazamakuru.\nKu wa 15 Kanama 1992, Mfizi yanditse ibaruwa ifunguye. Muri iyo baruwa, yavuye mu ishyaka MRND. Yavuze ko abantu ba hafi ba Perezida bigaruriye Leta kugira ngo bayikuremo inyungu. Iryo tsinda yaryise \"R\u00e9seau z\u00e9ro\".\nKomisiyo mpuzamahanga y'iperereza yemeje ko iryo tsinda ryari rifitanye isano n'abategetsi bakuru i Kigali. Yemeje kandi ko ryagize uruhare mu bitero byinshi byo mu 1992 na 1993.\nNyuma ya Jenoside.\nUbushinjacyaha bwa ICTR bwavuze ko Akazu kagenzuraga ubutegetsi bwa politiki, ubukungu n'igisirikare mbere ya Jenoside no mu gihe cyayo.\nKu wa 16 Ugushyingo 2009, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwa ICTR rwagize Protais Zigiranyirazo umwere."}
{"id": "23706", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23706", "title": "Kangura", "text": "\"Ntukitiranye n'ikinyamakuru Kanguka.\"\nKangura ni ikinyamakuru cyasohokaga mu Rwanda kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1995. Nyiracyo yari Hassan Ngeze. Kangura yakwirakwizaga urwango ku Batutsi.\nMu 2003, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwemeje ko Kangura yateguye inzira ya Jenoside.\nAmateka.\nNimero ya mbere ya Kangura yasohotse muri Gicurasi 1990. Iya nyuma yasohotse mu 1995. Nta nimero yasohotse hagati ya Mata na Nyakanga 1994.\nKangura yari ifite inyandiko ebyiri: imwe mu Ikinyarwanda, indi mu Igifaransa. Hassan Ngeze ni we wagenzuraga ibyandikwagamo. Kangura yari izwi cyane mu Rwanda no mu mahanga.\nIbyo yandikaga.\nMuri Ukuboza 1990, Kangura nimero 6 yasohoye \u00abAmategeko icumi y'Abahutu\u00bb.\nKu gifuniko cya nimero 26, hari ishusho y'umupanga. Iruhande rwawo handitswe ikibazo: ni izihe ntwaro zizakoreshwa mu gutsinda Inyenzi burundu?\nNimero 40 yasohoye amazina y'abantu 123. Yaburiraga abasomyi ko bagomba kwitegura kwirwanaho.\nUrubanza rwa ICTR.\nKu wa 3 Ukuboza 2003, ICTR yemeje ko Kangura yakwirakwizaga agasuzuguro n'urwango ku Batutsi. Urukiko rwavuze ko Kangura yateguye inzira ya Jenoside mu Rwanda. Rwavuze kandi ko igifuniko cya nimero 26 cyahamagariraga kurimbura Abatutsi.\nHassan Ngeze yahamijwe jenoside, gushishikariza abantu mu ruhame gukora jenoside, n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Yaburanishijwe hamwe na Ferdinand Nahimana na Jean-Bosco Barayagwiza.\nKu wa 28 Ugushyingo 2007, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwagabanyije igihano cya Ngeze. Yakatiwe imyaka 35 y'igifungo."}
{"id": "23707", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23707", "title": "Parmehutu", "text": "Parmehutu (mu Gifaransa: \"Parti du mouvement de l'\u00e9mancipation hutu\") ryari ishyaka rya politiki ryo mu Rwanda. Ryashinzwe na Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda. Ryavugaga ko riharanira uburenganzira bw'Abahutu.\nParmehutu ryayoboye u Rwanda kuva ku bwigenge mu 1962 kugeza mu 1973. Mu gihe ryari ku butegetsi, Abatutsi benshi barahunze.\nAmateka.\nIshingwa.\nMuri Kamena 1957, Kayibanda yashinze umutwe witwaga \"Mouvement social hutu\" (MSM). Ku wa 9 Ukwakira 1959, uwo mutwe wabaye ishyaka Parmehutu. Parmehutu ryashakaga guca ubutegetsi bw'Abatutsi n'ubuhake. Ryasabaga kandi ko Abahutu benshi bajya mu mashuri.\nMu 1959, Parmehutu ryabaye umuyobozi w'impinduramatwara y'Abahutu. Iyo mpinduramatwara yari igamije guhirika ingoma ya cyami.\nKu butegetsi.\nMu matora y'amakomini yo mu 1960, amashyaka y'Abahutu yatsinze cyane. Ku wa 26 Ukwakira 1960, Kayibanda yagizwe umukuru wa guverinoma y'agateganyo.\nMuri Mutarama 1961, i Gitarama, hatangajwe Repubulika. Umwami Kigeli V yahatiwe kuguma mu buhungiro.\nKu wa 18 Nzeri 1961, Parmehutu ryatsinze amatora y'abadepite. Ryabonye imyanya 35 kuri 44. Muri ayo matora, abaturage bagera kuri 80 % banze ingoma ya cyami. Ku wa 26 Ukwakira 1961, Kayibanda yatorewe kuba Perezida wa Repubulika. U Rwanda rwabonye ubwigenge muri Nyakanga 1962.\nMu 1965, u Rwanda rwabaye igihugu cy'ishyaka rimwe. Muri icyo gihe, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye mu bihugu bituranye. Mu ntangiriro za 1964, abagera ku 150 000 bari impunzi.\nIherezo.\nMuri Nyakanga 1973, abasirikare bo mu majyaruguru bahiritse ubutegetsi bwa Kayibanda. Bashyize ku butegetsi Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana."}
{"id": "23708", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23708", "title": "Komisiyo y\u2019amateka y\u2019Abafaransa ku ruhare rw\u2019Ubufaransa mu Rwanda", "text": "Komisiyo y\u2019amateka y\u2019Abafaransa ku ruhare rw\u2019Ubufaransa mu Rwanda, izwi cyane nka Komisiyo Duclert, ni komisiyo y'abahanga mu mateka. Yashyizweho mu 2019 na Perezida w'Ubufaransa, Emmanuel Macron. Yayobowe n'umuhanga mu mateka Vincent Duclert.\nKomisiyo yasuzumye inyandiko z'ububiko bwa Leta y'Ubufaransa ku Rwanda kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1994. Ku wa 26 Werurwe 2021, yashyikirije Perezida Macron raporo yayo.\nIshyirwaho.\nKomisiyo yashyizweho mu 2019 na Perezida Emmanuel Macron. Yari igizwe n'abantu 15. Yayobowe na Vincent Duclert. Inshingano yayo yari ukwiga uruhare rw'Ubufaransa mu Rwanda kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1994.\nRaporo.\nKu wa 26 Werurwe 2021, komisiyo yashyikirije Perezida Macron raporo yayo. Raporo ivuga ko Ubufaransa bufite \u00abinshingano ziremereye kandi zikomeye\u00bb.\nRaporo ivuga ko Ubufaransa butabonye ko abahezanguni b'ubutegetsi bwa Habyarimana bateguraga jenoside. Ivuga kandi ko Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand yari afitanye umubano wa hafi na Guverinoma ya Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana.\nIcyakora, raporo ivuga ko nta kigaragaza ko Ubufaransa bwafatanyije n'abakoze jenoside.\nUko yakiriwe.\nGuverinoma y'u Rwanda yishimiye iyo raporo. Yatangaje ko na yo izasohora raporo yayo bwite."}
{"id": "23709", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23709", "title": "Garuka i Kigali, ikibazo cyigifaransa", "text": "Garuka i Kigali, ikibazo cyigifaransa (mu Gifaransa: \"Retour \u00e0 Kigali, une affaire fran\u00e7aise\") ni filime mbarankuru y'Abafaransa yo mu 2019. Yayobowe na Jean-Christophe Klotz.\nIyo filime ivuga ku ruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nIbiyikubiyemo.\nJean-Christophe Klotz yari umunyamakuru i Kigali mu gihe cya Jenoside. Nyuma y'imyaka 25, yagarutse gukora iperereza ku byabaye. Filime ikoresha ibiganiro n'inyandiko z'ubutegetsi.\nAbantu benshi bari bafite uruhare mu 1994 baganiriye na Klotz. Bamwe muri bo bavuze ku mugaragaro bwa mbere. Muri bo harimo:\nIsohoka n'ibihembo.\nFilime yanyuze kuri televiziyo France 3 ku wa 25 Mata 2019.\nYahawe ibihembo bitandukanye:"}
{"id": "23710", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23710", "title": "Retour \u00e0 Kigali, une affaire fran\u00e7aise", "text": "Retour \u00e0 Kigali, une affaire fran\u00e7aise (mu Kinyarwanda: \u00abKugaruka i Kigali, ikibazo cy'Abafaransa\u00bb) ni filime mbarankuru y'Abafaransa yo mu 2019. Yakozwe n'umunyamakuru Jean-Christophe Klotz. Ivuga ku ruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nFilime imara iminota 75. Yanyuze bwa mbere kuri televiziyo France 3 ku wa 25 Mata 2019. Yahawe ibihembo bitatu mu maserukiramuco.\nIbikubiyemo.\nMu 1994, Klotz yari umwe mu banyamakuru bake b'Abafaransa bari mu Rwanda. Nyuma y'imyaka 25, yagarutse kwiga ibyo yari yabonye icyo gihe. Filime ikoresha inyandiko za Leta y'Ubufaransa. Yerekana uruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri Jenoside. Yerekana kandi ko umuryango mpuzamahanga ntacyo wakoze ngo uhagarike ubwicanyi.\nFilime irimo ubuhamya bw'abantu 21. Abenshi bahoze ari abayobozi b'Abafaransa, Ababiligi n'Abanyamerika. Muri bo harimo:\nUmujyanama mu by'amateka wa filime ni umuhanga mu mateka H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Dumas.\nUko yakiriwe.\nIkinyamakuru \"L'Express\" cyashimye filime. Cyavuze ko ari filime y'ingirakamaro kandi ikozwe neza.\nFilime yahawe ibihembo bitatu:"}
{"id": "23711", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23711", "title": "Igikorwa cya Noro\u00eet", "text": "Igikorwa cya Noro\u00eet (mu Gifaransa: \"Op\u00e9ration Noro\u00eet\") cyari igikorwa cya gisirikare cy'Ubufaransa mu Rwanda. Cyatangiye ku wa 4 Ukwakira 1990 kirangira mu Ukuboza 1993.\nKu mugaragaro, cyari kigamije kurinda Abafaransa babaga mu Rwanda. Ariko cyafashije kandi ingabo za Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana mu ntambara na FPR Inkotanyi.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 1 Ukwakira 1990, FPR Inkotanyi yateye u Rwanda iturutse mu Ubugande. Perezida Habyarimana yasabye Ubufaransa ubufasha. Ku wa 4 Ukwakira 1990, Ubufaransa bwatangije Igikorwa cya Noro\u00eet.\nMuri Ukwakira 1990, mu Rwanda hari abasirikare b'Abafaransa bagera kuri 300. Hari kandi abasirikare 600 b'Ububiligi n'abasirikare 500 ba Zayire.\nIbyo cyakoze.\nAbasirikare b'Abafaransa bagiraga inama ubuyobozi bukuru bw'ingabo z'u Rwanda. Batozaga kandi abasirikare barinda Perezida. Hagati ya 1992 na 1993, Ubufaransa bwahaye u Rwanda intwaro n'amasasu.\nMu 1993, Ubufaransa bwohereje abandi basirikare 150. Umubare w'abasirikare b'Abafaransa wageze kuri 800. Raporo ya Human Rights Watch ivuga ko bigeze kuba 1 100.\nIherezo.\nKu wa 4 Kanama 1993, hasinywe amasezerano ya Arusha. Ayo masezerano yasabaga ko ingabo z'amahanga ziva mu Rwanda. Igikorwa cya Noro\u00eet cyarangiye mu Ukuboza 1993. Ingabo za MINUAR zahise zigera mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "23712", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23712", "title": "Igikorwa Amaryllis", "text": "Igikorwa Amaryllis (mu Gifaransa: \"Op\u00e9ration Amaryllis\") cyari igikorwa cya gisirikare cy'Ubufaransa mu Rwanda. Cyabaye kuva ku wa 8 kugeza ku wa 14 Mata 1994, mu ntangiriro za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nCyari kigamije gukura Abafaransa n'abandi banyamahanga mu Rwanda. Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri ambasade y'Ubufaransa ntibajyanywe.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 6 Mata 1994, indege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana yarahanuwe. Ubwicanyi bwahise butangira i Kigali.\nKu wa 8 Mata 1994, Ubufaransa bwatangije Igikorwa Amaryllis.\nAbakuwe mu Rwanda.\nIgikorwa cyakuye mu Rwanda Abafaransa n'abandi banyamahanga. Cyakuyemo kandi umuryango wa Perezida Habyarimana.\nKu wa 9 Mata 1994, Agathe Habyarimana yuriye indege ya mbere yerekeza i Bangui, muri Santarafurika. Yari kumwe n'abantu 12 bo mu muryango we n'Abafaransa 44. Raporo ya Komisiyo Duclert ivuga ko Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand ari we wabisabye ubwe.\nAbatutsi basizwe.\nIgikorwa cyashyize imbere abanyamahanga. Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri ambasade y'Ubufaransa ntibakiriwe.\nRaporo ya Komisiyo Duclert ivuga ko gukura mu Rwanda Abanyarwanda bari mu kaga bitari ibyihutirwa. Umuryango wa Habyarimana ni wo wonyine wavanywemo."}
{"id": "23713", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23713", "title": "Igikorwa Silver Back", "text": "Igikorwa Silver Back (mu Gifaransa: \"Op\u00e9ration Silver Back\") ni igikorwa cya gisirikare cy'Ububiligi mu Rwanda. Cyabaye muri Mata 1994, mu ntangiriro ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Intego yacyo yari gucyura Ababiligi n'abandi banyamahanga bari mu Rwanda.\nIgikorwa cyabereye rimwe n'Igikorwa Amaryllis cy'Ubufaransa. Cyacyuye Ababiligi barenga 1 000.\nAmateka.\nImvano.\nKu wa 6 Mata 1994, indege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana yarahanuwe. Bukeye bwaho, abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR bariciwe i Kigali. Bari baje kurinda Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Abasivili b'Ababiligi nabo barishwe.\nIgikorwa.\nKu wa 10 Mata 1994, abasirikare 250 b'Ababiligi bageze ku kibuga cy'indege cya Kigali. Bazanywe n'indege umunani zo mu bwoko bwa C-130. Izina \"Silver Back\" ryavuye ku ngagi zo mu misozi y'u Rwanda. Nyuma yaho, abasirikare barenga 400 boherejwe mu Rwanda. Ubuholandi bwatanze indege imwe yo gufasha.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, Ambasaderi Johan Swinnen yatangiye kuyobora igikorwa. Ababiligi barenga 1 000 bacyuwe. Ku wa 13 Mata, abantu bagera kuri 425 bageze i Buruseli. Ababiligi bagera kuri 20 bagumye mu Rwanda.\nIngaruka.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, abasirikare b'Ababiligi bavuye mu ishuri rya ETO i Kigali. Bahasize impunzi zigera ku 2 000. Interahamwe n'abasirikare ba Leta bahise bazica. Reba Ubwicanyi bw'Ishuri rya ETO.\nNyuma y'iki gikorwa, Ububiligi bwakuye abasirikare babwo muri MINUAR."}
{"id": "23714", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23714", "title": "Amategeko arwanya ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside", "text": "Amategeko arwanya ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside ni amategeko y'u Rwanda ahana ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside n'ibyaha bifitanye isano na yo. Itegeko rya mbere ryatowe mu 2008. Itegeko rikurikizwa ubu ni Itegeko n\u00ba 59/2018 ryo ku wa 22 Kanama 2018.\nAyo mategeko agamije gukumira indi jenoside nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu ivuga ko ashobora kubangamira ubwisanzure bwo kuvuga.\nAmateka.\nItegeko Nshinga ry'u Rwanda ryo mu 2003, ryavuguruwe mu 2015, rihana gukwirakwiza ivangura n'amacakubiri.\nMbere ya 2008, amategeko y'u Rwanda ntiyasobanuraga ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside. Mu 2008, Leta yashyizeho itegeko rihana ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside n'amacakubiri. Iryo tegeko ryasimbuwe n'Itegeko n\u00ba 84/2013 ryo ku wa 11 Nzeri 2013.\nItegeko n\u00ba 59/2018.\nItegeko n\u00ba 59/2018 ryo ku wa 22 Kanama 2018 ryasohotse mu Igazeti ya Leta ku wa 25 Nzeri 2018. Ryasimbuye Itegeko n\u00ba 84/2013.\nIngengabitekerezo ya jenoside ni igikorwa gikorewe mu ruhame kigaragaza ko umuntu ashyigikiye kurimbura itsinda ry'abantu. Iryo tsinda rishobora gushingira ku bwenegihugu, ubwoko, ibara ry'uruhu cyangwa idini. \"Mu ruhame\" bisobanura imbere y'abantu barenze babiri. Bisobanura kandi ku mbuga nkoranyambaga, mu itangazamakuru no mu butumwa bwohererezwa umuntu.\nItegeko rihana kandi ibi byaha:\nIbihano.\nIngengabitekerezo ya jenoside, guhakana, gupfobya no guha ishingiro jenoside bihanishwa igifungo cy'imyaka 5 kugeza kuri 7. Hiyongeraho ihazabu y'amafaranga y'u Rwanda 500 000 kugeza kuri 1 000 000.\nKwiba cyangwa kwangiza imibiri y'abazize jenoside bihanishwa igifungo cy'imyaka 10 kugeza kuri 15. Ni na ko bimeze ku kwangiza inzibutso.\nKunengwa.\nAmnesty International ivuga ko iryo tegeko ribangamira ubwisanzure bwo kuvuga. Abarinenga bavuga ko ridasobanutse neza. Bavuga ko rishobora gukoreshwa ku banyamakuru, abanyapolitiki batavuga rumwe na Leta n'abaharanira uburenganzira.\nUrugero ni urwa Victoire Ingabire. Yafashwe mu 2010 nyuma y'ijambo yavuze. Mu 2012, yakatiwe imyaka 8 y'igifungo kubera gupfobya jenoside."}
{"id": "23715", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23715", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rubirizi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rubirizi ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri i Rubirizi, i Kanombe, mu Akarere ka Kicukiro, mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nMu 1994, Abatutsi benshi biciwe i Rubirizi. Abagera kuri 80 bari bahungiye ku ishuri rya B.G.M. Rubirizi baricwa.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Rubirizi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside, Interahamwe zishe Abatutsi bo mu gace ka Rubirizi. Abatutsi bagera kuri 80 bari bahungiye ku ishuri rya B.G.M. Rubirizi. Bariciwe aho.\nAbandi Batutsi bari bahungiye mu rugo rwa Konseye Biziyaremye Fran\u00e7ois. Bamwe muri bo bakuwe aho. Bajyanywe kwicirwa i Rubirizi, ahantu bitaga \u00abCND\u00bb.\nUbutabera.\nMuri Nyakanga 2010, urukiko Gacaca rwakatiye Sophanie Rutayisire igifungo cya burundu. Yahoze ari umuyobozi mu mujyi wa Kigali. Yari atuye i Rubirizi. Urukiko rwemeje ko yahaye Interahamwe imbunda zo kwica Abatutsi. Rwemeje kandi ko ari we nyirabayazana w'urupfu rw'Abatutsi 80 bo ku ishuri rya B.G.M. Rubirizi. Urukiko rwakoreye imwe mu manza zarwo i Rubirizi.\nMuri Kamena 2021, Urukiko Rukuru rwaciye urubanza rwa Iyamuremye Jean Claude, wiswe Nzinga. Ubushinjacyaha bwamushinjaga kugira uruhare mu bwicanyi bwabereye i Rubirizi.\nKwibuka.\nUrwibutso rwa Rubirizi ni ahantu ho kunamira abazize Jenoside. Buri mwaka, imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" ihabera."}
{"id": "23716", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23716", "title": "Gushyira mu byiciro abakekwaho itsembabwoko mu Rwanda", "text": "Gushyira mu byiciro abakekwaho itsembabwoko mu Rwanda ni uburyo amategeko y'u Rwanda yashyize mu byiciro abakekwagaho uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Buri cyiciro cyagaragazaga uburemere bw'ibyaha n'urukiko ruzaburanisha ukekwa.\nAmategeko atatu yakurikiranye: itegeko ryo mu 1996, itegeko rya Gacaca ryo mu 2001, n'itegeko rya Gacaca ryo mu 2004.\nItegeko ryo mu 1996.\nItegeko ngenga ryo ku wa 30 Kanama 1996 ryashyize abakekwa mu byiciro bine:\nAbo mu cyiciro cya mbere bashoboraga guhanishwa igifungo cya burundu cyangwa igihano cy'urupfu. Abo mu byiciro bya kabiri, gatatu na kane bashoboraga kugabanyirizwa igihano iyo bemeye icyaha.\nIryo tegeko ryashyizeho ingereko zihariye mu nkiko za mbere. Izo ngereko zatangiye gukora mu mpera za 1996.\nItegeko rya Gacaca ryo mu 2001.\nItegeko ngenga ryo ku wa 26 Mutarama 2001 ryashyizeho inkiko Gacaca. Ryagumishijeho ibyiciro bine. Icyiciro cya mbere cyongewemo icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu.\nAbo mu cyiciro cya mbere baburanishwaga n'inkiko zisanzwe. Abandi bose baburanishwaga n'inkiko Gacaca. Inkiko Gacaca zari ku nzego enye: akagari, umurenge, akarere n'intara.\nItegeko rya Gacaca ryo mu 2004.\nItegeko ngenga n\u00ba 16/2004 ryo ku wa 19 Kamena 2004 ryagabanyije ibyiciro biva kuri bine bigera kuri bitatu. Icyiciro cya kane cyavanyweho. Ibyiciro bya mbere, kabiri na gatatu byaraguwe.\nAbo mu cyiciro cya mbere na bo bashoboraga kugabanyirizwa igihano iyo bemeye icyaha. Inkiko Gacaca zasigaye ku nzego ebyiri: akagari n'umurenge. Inkiko Gacaca zatangiye gukora mu gihugu hose mu 2006."}
{"id": "23717", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23717", "title": "Uruhare rw'itangazamakuru", "text": "Uruhare rw'itangazamakuru muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994 (mu Gifaransa: \"R\u00f4le des m\u00e9dias dans le g\u00e9nocide des Tutsi au Rwanda\") rwari runini. Ibinyamakuru na radiyo bimwe byakwirakwije urwango ku Batutsi. Byafashije gutegura no gukora jenoside. Ibizwi cyane ni ikinyamakuru Kangura na radiyo RTLM.\nMu 2003, Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwahamije abayobozi b'ibyo bitangazamakuru icyaha cya jenoside. Itangazamakuru mpuzamahanga naryo ryaranenzwe, kuko ritasobanuye neza ibyabaga mu Rwanda.\nMbere ya jenoside.\nKangura.\nIkinyamakuru Kangura cyayoborwaga na Hassan Ngeze. Mu Ukuboza 1990, Kangura nimero 6 yasohoye \u00abAmategeko icumi y'Abahutu\u00bb. Ayo mategeko yasabaga Abahutu kwanga Abatutsi. Kangura yasohoye kandi urutonde rw'amazina 123 y'abantu yitaga abanzi.\nRTLM.\nRadiyo RTLM (\"Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines\") yatangiye kumvikana muri Nyakanga 1993. Yashinzwe na Ferdinand Nahimana na Jean-Bosco Barayagwiza. Umucuruzi F\u00e9licien Kabuga nawe yari umwe mu bayishinze.\nRadio Rwanda yari radiyo ya Leta. RTLM yo yakwirakwizaga urwango ku mugaragaro. Yitaga Abatutsi \u00abinyenzi\u00bb.\nMu gihe cya jenoside.\nNyuma ya 6 Mata 1994, RTLM yasomaga amazina y'Abatutsi n'ay'abanyapolitiki batavugaga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Yavugaga n'aho bari bari. Urukiko rwemeje ko bamwe mu bavuzwe kuri radiyo bishwe nyuma yaho. RTLM yashishikarizaga abantu \u00abgutema ibiti birebire\u00bb.\nUrubanza rw'itangazamakuru.\nICTR yaburanishije Nahimana, Barayagwiza na Ngeze hamwe. Uru rubanza rwiswe \u00aburubanza rw'itangazamakuru\u00bb. Ku wa 3 Ukuboza 2003, urukiko rwabahamije icyaha cya jenoside. Rwabahamije kandi icyaha cyo gushishikariza abantu gukora jenoside. Nahimana na Ngeze bakatiwe gufungwa burundu. Barayagwiza yakatiwe gufungwa imyaka 35. Urukiko rwavuze ko ububasha bw'itangazamakuru buzana inshingano ikomeye.\nKu wa 28 Ugushyingo 2007, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwagabanyije ibihano. Nahimana yakatiwe imyaka 30. Barayagwiza yakatiwe imyaka 32. Ngeze yakatiwe imyaka 35.\nItangazamakuru mpuzamahanga.\nItangazamakuru mpuzamahanga naryo ryaranenzwe. Ntiryitaye bihagije ku byabaga mu Rwanda, cyangwa ntiryabisobanuye neza."}
{"id": "23718", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23718", "title": "Impamvu za jenoside", "text": "Impamvu za jenoside ni ibintu byatumye Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi iba mu 1994. Jenoside yamaze iminsi igera ku 100.\nImpamvu za jenoside ni nyinshi. Zimwe zikomoka ku mateka y'ubukoloni. Izindi zikomoka ku bayobozi b'u Rwanda bateguye ubwicanyi. Ibihugu by'amahanga na byo byananiwe kubuza jenoside.\nAmateka.\nUbukoloni.\nUbubiligi bwategetse u Rwanda kuva mu 1916. Mu 1932, Ububiligi bwatangije indangamuntu. Indangamuntu yanditsweho ubwoko bw'uyitwaye: Umuhutu, Umututsi cyangwa Umutwa. Ubwo bwoko bwanditse ku ndangamuntu bwakoreshejwe mu 1994 kugira ngo Abatutsi bamenyekane.\nUbwicanyi n'ubuhunzi.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya 1950, ubutegetsi bw'Abatutsi bwahiritswe. Abatutsi benshi barishwe. Ibihumbi byinshi byahungiye mu mahanga. Mu 1962, Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda yabaye perezida wa mbere watowe. Abatutsi bakomeje gukorerwa ivangura.\nIntambara yo mu 1990.\nMu 1990, FPR Inkotanyi yateye u Rwanda. Yaharaniraga ko impunzi zitahuka. Ubutegetsi bwa Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana bwafashe Abatutsi bose nk'abafatanyije n'umwanzi.\nItegurwa rya jenoside.\nItsinda rito ry'abayobozi ryahisemo jenoside kugira ngo rigumane ubutegetsi. Ryakoresheje inzego za Leta kugira ngo rishishikarize abaturage kwica Abatutsi. Mu minsi igera ku 100, abicanyi bishe abantu barenga ibihumbi 500.\nItangazamakuru.\nIbinyamakuru n'amaradiyo by'intagondwa byavugaga ko Abatutsi bose ari abafatanyacyaha b'umwanzi. Ikinyamakuru \"Kangura\" cyagaragazaga Abatutsi nk'abantu babi. Cyasabaga ko barimburwa. Radiyo RTLM yabibye urwango ku Batutsi. Nyuma ya 6 Mata 1994, yasabye abaturage kwica Abatutsi. Reba Uruhare rw'itangazamakuru.\nKudahana.\nAbakoze ubwicanyi bwabanje ntibahanwe. Ibyo byatumye intagondwa zizera ko nta n'umwe uzazihana.\nImbarutso.\nMuri Kanama 1993, Leta y'u Rwanda na FPR basinyiye amasezerano y'amahoro i Arusha. Intagondwa z'Abahutu ntizayemeye. Ku wa 6 Mata 1994, indege yari itwaye Perezida Habyarimana yarahanuwe. Ibyo byabaye imbarutso ya jenoside.\nUruhare rw'amahanga.\nIbihugu by'amahanga byirengagije imiburo. Ubufaransa, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, Ububiligi n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ntibabujije jenoside. Jenoside imaze gutangira, Akanama gashinzwe umutekano ku Isi kagabanyije ingabo za MINUAR. Mu 1999, raporo y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye yemeje ko uwo muryango utashoboye kubuza jenoside."}
{"id": "23719", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23719", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibilizi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibilizi ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri mu Murenge wa Kibilizi, mu Akarere ka Gisagara, mu Intara y\u2019Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nMu 1994, Kibilizi yari mu yahoze ari Komini Nyaruhengeri. Abatutsi benshi bo muri iyo komini biciwe i Kibilizi guhera ku wa 21 Mata 1994.\nAmateka.\nMuri Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi bo muri Komini Nyaruhengeri bahungiye ku biro bya komini. Babitegetswe na burugumesitiri Charles Kabeza. Bishwe guhera mu ijoro ryo ku wa 21 Mata 1994.\nAbicanyi bakoreye Abatutsi iyicarubozo. Abagore n'abakobwa bafashwe ku ngufu mbere yo kwicwa. Bamwe bajugunywe mu misarane ari bazima. Abakonseye batangaje ko umutekano wagarutse. Abatutsi bari bihishe barasohotse. Bahise bicwa. Abicanyi bakoresheje imbwa mu guhiga Abatutsi bari bihishe mu bihuru.\nAbatutsi bamwe bo mu mujyi wa Butare na bo bajyanywe i Nyange ya Kibilizi. Interahamwe zabiciye aho.\nKwibuka.\nUrwibutso rwa Kibilizi ni ahantu ho kunamira abazize Jenoside. Buri mwaka, imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" ihabera."}
{"id": "23721", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23721", "title": "Abarezwe na ICTR", "text": "Abarezwe na ICTR ni urutonde rw'abantu barezwe n'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR). Urwo rukiko rwashyizweho n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Rwakoreraga i Arusha muri Tanzaniya. Rwaburanishije abakekwaho uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nICTR yareze abantu 93. Urukiko rwafunze imiryango ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2015. Imanza zasigaye zakomejwe n'Urwego rwasigaranye imirimo y'inkiko mpanabyaha mpuzamahanga (IRMCT).\nUrutonde.\nICTR yareze abantu 93. Yafunze imiryango ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2015. Urutonde rukurikira rugaragaza itariki buri muntu yarezweho n'uko ikibazo cye cyarangiye. Rurimo kandi abarezwe gusuzugura urukiko."}
{"id": "23722", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23722", "title": "Iteka rya Minisitiri ryerekeranye no kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi", "text": "Iteka rya Minisitiri ryerekeranye no kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi (Iteka rya Minisitiri N\u00ba 16/MOJ/AG/19 ryo ku wa 9 Nzeri 2019) ni itegeko ryo mu Rwanda. Rigena uko kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi bitegurwa. Rigena kandi ibijyanye n'inzibutso za Jenoside n'uko zisurwa.\nIteka ryasohotse mu Igazeti ya Leta N\u00ba 35 ku wa 9 Nzeri 2019. Ryatangiye gukurikizwa uwo munsi.\nIbikubiye mu iteka.\nIteka ryasohotse mu Igazeti ya Leta N\u00ba 35 yo ku wa 9 Nzeri 2019. Risobanura igihe cya Jenoside: kuva ku wa 1 Ukwakira 1990 kugeza ku wa 31 Ukuboza 1994.\nIcyunamo n'iminsi 100.\nIcyunamo kimara iminsi irindwi, kuva ku wa 7 kugeza ku wa 13 Mata buri mwaka. Ku wa 13 Mata habaho umuhango wo gusoza icyunamo. Igihe cyo kwibuka kimara iminsi 100. Gitangirana n'icyunamo, kikarangira ku wa 3 Nyakanga.\nIbara n'ikirango.\nIbara ryo kwibuka ni ibara ry'ivu. Ikirango ni urumuri rw'ibara ry'ivu ku mbuga y'umweru. Urwo rumuri rugaragaza kuva mu mateka mabi ugana ku cyizere.\nInzibutso.\nUrwibutso rw'igihugu.\nUrwibutso rw'igihugu rugomba kugira amateka yihariye ku rwego rw'igihugu. Rugomba kuba rushyinguyemo nibura imibiri 5 000. Rwemezwa n'Inama y'Abaminisitiri, ibisabwe na Minisitiri.\nKwita ku nzibutso.\nInzibutso z'igihugu zitabwaho na Komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe kurwanya Jenoside. Inzibutso z'akarere zitabwaho n'uturere. Inzibutso zo mu mahanga zitabwaho na Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga, binyuze kuri ambasade.\nGusura inzibutso.\nUrwibutso rw'igihugu rufungurwa buri munsi, kuva saa moya za mu gitondo kugeza saa kumi n'imwe z'umugoroba. Amatsinda manini agomba kubanza kumenyesha ko azaza. Gufotora hagamijwe ubushakashatsi bisaba uruhushya rwa Komisiyo. Ufite urwo ruhushya ntiyemerewe gufotora mu gihe cy'urugendo ruyobowe. Imyidagaduro ntiyemewe ku nzibutso. Gukura cyangwa kwimura imibiri y'abazize Jenoside ntibyemewe."}
{"id": "23723", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23723", "title": "Ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida Habyarimana", "text": "Ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida Habyarimana (mu Gifaransa: \"Attentat du 6 avril 1994 au Rwanda\") riba ku wa 6 Mata 1994 i Kigali. Indege itwaye Perezida w'u Rwanda Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana na Perezida w'Uburundi Cyprien Ntaryamira iraswa igiye kugwa ku kibuga cy'indege. Abari mu ndege bose barapfa.\nIki gitero gifatwa nk'imbarutso ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Kugeza ubu ntiharamenyekana neza abakoze iki gitero.\nIgitero.\nKu mugoroba wo ku wa 6 Mata 1994, indege Falcon 50 itwaye Perezida Habyarimana na Perezida Ntaryamira. Igihe yegera ikibuga cy'indege cya Kigali, iraswa n'igisasu kimwe nibura cya misile. Abari mu ndege bose barapfa. Muri bo harimo abakozi b'indege b'Abafaransa.\nBukeye bwaho, abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR bicirwa i Kigali. Jenoside ihitana abantu barenga miliyoni, abenshi ari Abatutsi. Ibarura rya Leta y'u Rwanda ryo mu 2000 ribara abantu 1 074 017.\nIperereza.\nIperereza ry'Ubufaransa.\nIperereza ry'Ubufaransa ritangira muri Werurwe 1998. Ritangira nyuma y'ikirego cy'abo mu muryango w'umupilote w'Umufaransa. Umucamanza Jean-Louis Brugui\u00e8re yanzura ko abo muri FPR binjira aho hantu bagahanura indege. Mu Ugushyingo 2006, hatangwa impapuro icyenda zo gufata abantu ba hafi ya Paul Kagame. Nyuma bakeka abahezanguni b'Abahutu batemeraga ubwitonzi bwa Habyarimana.\nMu Mutarama 2012, abacamanza Marc Tr\u00e9vidic na Nathalie Poux batangaza raporo y'impuguke. Iyo raporo ivuga ko misile zishobora kuba zararasiwe mu kigo cya gisirikare cya Kanombe. Ivuga kandi ko bishoboka cyane ko izo misile ari izo mu bwoko bwa SA-16, zakozwe n'Abasoviyete. Raporo ntigaragaza abakoze igitero. Mu 1994, icyo kigo kigenzurwa n'abarinzi ba Perezida Habyarimana.\nKu wa 21 Ukuboza 2018, abacamanza bafata icyemezo cyo guhagarika iperereza ku bantu icyenda ba hafi ya Paul Kagame. Basanga nta bimenyetso bihagije bihari. Urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris rwemeza icyo cyemezo mu 2020. Ku wa 15 Gashyantare 2022, Urukiko rusesa imanza rwanga ubujurire. Urubanza rurafungwa.\nIperereza ry'u Rwanda.\nU Rwanda narwo rukora iperereza. Ibyavuyemo bisohoka mu 2009. Iryo perereza rishinja ingabo za Leta y'icyo gihe (FAR) kuba ari zo zahanuye indege.\nIbimenyetso bike.\nIbice byinshi by'indege biburirwa irengero. Kugeza ubu, agasanduku k'umukara k'indege ntikaraboneka. Abacamanza bavuga ko ubuhamya bwinshi buvuguruzanya."}
{"id": "23725", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23725", "title": "Ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina nk'intwaro ya jenoside", "text": "Ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina nk'intwaro ya jenoside rivuga ku gufata ku ngufu n'andi mahohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina yakorewe abagore n'abakobwa b'Abatutsi muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Iryo hohoterwa ryari uburyo bwo gusuzugura no kurimbura Abatutsi.\nAbagore n'abakobwa ibihumbi amagana bafashwe ku ngufu. Mu 1998, urubanza rwa Akayesu rwemeje ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora kuba uburyo bwo gukora jenoside.\nUmubare w'abahohotewe.\nUmubare nyawo w'abafashwe ku ngufu ntuzwi. Intumwa yihariye ya ONU, Ren\u00e9 Degni-S\u00e9gui, yanditse ko \u00abgufata ku ngufu byari itegeko, kudafata ku ngufu bikaba irengayobora\u00bb.\nRaporo ya Human Rights Watch yo mu 1996 ivuga ko abagore nibura 250 000 bafashwe ku ngufu. Umuryango w'Abibumbye uvuga ko abagore bari hagati ya 100 000 na 250 000 bafashwe ku ngufu.\nUko ryakozwe.\nAbagore bafatwaga ku ngufu n'umuntu umwe cyangwa n'abantu benshi. Bamwe bagizwe abacakara b'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Abandi bakorewe ibikorwa byo kubangiza imyanya ndangagitsina. Akenshi, abagore bafatwaga ku ngufu nyuma yo kubona bene wabo bicwa. Benshi bicwaga nyuma yaho.\nAbenshi mu bakoze iryo hohoterwa bari Interahamwe. Hari kandi abasivili n'abasirikare b'ingabo za Leta.\nPoropaganda.\nItangazamakuru ry'abahezanguni, nka Kangura na radiyo RTLM, ryagaragazaga abagore b'Abatutsi nk'intasi. \u00abAmategeko icumi y'Abahutu\u00bb yasohotse muri Kangura yabuzaga Abahutu kurongora abagore b'Abatutsi.\nIngaruka.\nAbagore benshi barwaye indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina, harimo SIDA. Abana bari hagati ya 2 000 na 5 000 bavutse ku bagore bafashwe ku ngufu. Abahohotewe benshi bahuye n'akato. Ibyo byatumaga badashaka kwivuza cyangwa kuvuga ibyababayeho.\nUbutabera.\nMu 1998, ICTR yaburanishije Jean-Paul Akayesu. Urukiko rwemeje ko gufata ku ngufu n'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina bishobora kuba jenoside."}
{"id": "23726", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23726", "title": "Guhakana jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi", "text": "Guhakana jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi ni ukuvuga ko Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 itabayeho. Ni no kuvuga ko itateguwe, kugabanya uburemere bwayo, cyangwa kugoreka amateka yayo.\nGuhakana byatangiye jenoside ikiba. Byakomejwe n'abayigizemo uruhare n'abandi bantu bake. Inkiko mpuzamahanga n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye byemeje ko jenoside yabayeho. Mu Rwanda no mu Bubiligi, guhakana jenoside ni icyaha.\nAmateka y'ihakana.\nIhakana ryatangiye jenoside ikiba. Mu 1994, bamwe bavugaga ko ubwicanyi ari intambara isanzwe. Abanyamahanga bamwe barabyemeye. Bibwiraga ko guhagarika intambara byari guhagarika ubwicanyi bw'Abatutsi.\nNyuma ya jenoside, abahakana bavuze ko habaye \u00abjenoside ebyiri\u00bb. Bavuga ko Abahutu na bo bakorewe jenoside. Iyi mvugo ifatwa nk'uburyo bwo guhakana jenoside.\nMu 2010, Edward S. Herman na David Peterson banditse igitabo \"The Politics of Genocide\". Bavuze ko Abahutu ari bo bishwe ari benshi. Bavuze kandi ko FPR ari yo yakoze ubwicanyi bwinshi. Abashakashatsi Gerald Caplan na Adam Jones banenze icyo gitabo.\nUburyo bwo guhakana.\nItegeko ryo mu Rwanda rigaragaza uburyo butatu.\nUkuri kwemejwe.\nKu wa 16 Kamena 2006, Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rw'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda rwafashe icyemezo. Rwemeje ko Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ari ukuri kuzwi na bose. Ntibikiri ngombwa kubitangira ibimenyetso mu manza.\nKu wa 26 Mutarama 2018, Inteko Rusange y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye yemeje izina \u00abJenoside yakorewe Abatutsi\u00bb. Ku wa 7 Mata wabaye Umunsi mpuzamahanga wo kuzirikana Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nAmategeko.\nMu Rwanda.\nItegeko N\u00ba 59/2018 ryo ku wa 22 Kanama 2018 rihana ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside. Rihana guhakana jenoside, kugabanya uburemere bwayo no kuyiha ishingiro. Buri cyaha gihanishwa igifungo cy'imyaka itanu kugeza kuri irindwi. Gihanishwa kandi ihazabu y'amafaranga y'u Rwanda kuva ku 500 000 kugeza kuri 1 000 000. Reba Amategeko arwanya ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside.\nMu 2010, Amnesty International yanenze amategeko yabanjirije iryo. Yavuze ko amagambo yayo adasobanutse neza. Yavuze kandi ko yakoreshejwe mu gucecekesha abanenga Leta.\nMu Bubiligi.\nKu wa 25 Mata 2019, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Ububiligi yemeje itegeko rishya. Iryo tegeko rihana no guhakana Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23727", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23727", "title": "Ubutabera mpuzamahanga (ICTR)", "text": "Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwari urukiko rwa Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Rwashyiriweho kuburanisha abakekwaho jenoside n'ibindi byaha bikomeye byakorewe mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nICTR yari ifite icyicaro i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. Yareze abantu 93. Yafunze imiryango ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2015.\nAmateka.\nICTR yashyizweho mu 1994 n'Akanama gashinzwe umutekano ka ONU, hakoreshejwe icyemezo n\u00ba 955. Yari ifite ububasha bwo kuburanisha ibyaha byakozwe mu Rwanda no mu bihugu bihana imbibi na rwo, hagati ya 1 Mutarama na 31 Ukuboza 1994.\nUrukiko rwari rufite icyicaro i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya, n'ibiro i Kigali. Urugereko rw'ubujurire rwari i La Haye, mu Buholandi.\nImiterere.\nICTR yari igizwe n'inzego eshatu:\nImanza.\nICTR yareze abantu 93. Abantu 14 bagizwe abere. Urutonde rw'abaregwe ruri mu ngingo Abarezwe na ICTR.\nICTR ni rwo rukiko mpuzamahanga rwa mbere rwaciye imanza za jenoside. Ni rwo rwa mbere rwasobanuye icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu mu mategeko mpuzamahanga. Rwemeje kandi ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora kuba uburyo bwo gukora jenoside. Urwo rubanza ni Icyemezo cya Akayesu.\nICTR ni rwo rukiko mpuzamahanga rwa mbere rwahamije abanyamakuru icyaha cyo gushishikariza abantu gukora jenoside. Muri bo harimo Ferdinand Nahimana na Hassan Ngeze.\nUrubanza rwa nyuma rwaciwe ku wa 20 Ukuboza 2012.\nIherezo.\nKu wa 1 Nyakanga 2012, Urwego Mpuzamahanga rushinzwe kurangiza imirimo y'Inkiko Mpanabyaha (IRMCT) rwatangiye gukora imirimo isigaye ya ICTR. ICTR yafunze imiryango ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2015."}
{"id": "23728", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23728", "title": "Uruhare rw'umuryango mpuzamahanga muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi", "text": "Uruhare rw'umuryango mpuzamahanga muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi (mu Gifaransa: \"R\u00f4le de la communaut\u00e9 internationale dans le g\u00e9nocide des Tutsi au Rwanda\") ni ingingo ivuga uko ibihugu by'amahanga n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye (ONU) bitwaye mbere no mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nONU yari ifite ingabo za MINUAR mu Rwanda. Nyamara ntiyahagaritse jenoside. Nyuma yaho, ONU, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika n'Ububiligi byemeye ko byatsinzwe.\nMbere ya jenoside.\nMu Ukwakira 1993, Akanama ka ONU gashinzwe umutekano kashyizeho MINUAR. Intego yayo yari gufasha gushyira mu bikorwa amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha. MINUAR yemerewe abantu 2 548.\nKu wa 11 Mutarama 1994, Jenerali Rom\u00e9o Dallaire, umuyobozi w'ingabo za MINUAR, yohereje ubutumwa bwihutirwa i New York. Yari yabwiwe n'umuntu wari uzi amabanga. Uwo muntu yavugaga ko Interahamwe zatozwaga kandi zihabwa intwaro. Yavugaga kandi ko Abatutsi b'i Kigali barimo kwandikwa, kugira ngo bicwe. Dallaire yasabye kwambura izo ntwaro. ONU yarabyanze.\nMu gihe cya jenoside.\nJenoside imaze gutangira, Ububiligi bwakuye abasirikare babwo muri MINUAR. Ku wa 21 Mata 1994, Akanama gashinzwe umutekano kagabanyije MINUAR. Abasirikare bayo bavuye ku 2 548 bagera kuri 270.\nKu wa 17 Gicurasi 1994, Akanama kemeje ko MINUAR yongererwa abasirikare bagera ku 5 500. Ku wa 22 Kamena 1994, Akanama kemeye igikorwa cy'ubutabazi cyiswe Turquoise. Icyo gikorwa cyayobowe n'Ubufaransa. MINUAR yavuye mu Rwanda muri Werurwe 1996.\nKwemera amakosa.\nLeta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika.\nKu wa 25 Werurwe 1998, Perezida Bill Clinton yavugiye ijambo ku kibuga cy'indege cya Kigali. Yemeye ko umuryango mpuzamahanga utatabaye vuba. Yemeye kandi ko ibyaha bitahise byitwa izina ryabyo nyakuri: jenoside.\nUmuryango w'Abibumbye.\nMu 1999, ONU yasabye iperereza ryigenga. Ryayobowe na Ingvar Carlsson wahoze ari Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Suwede. Raporo yasohotse ku wa 16 Ukuboza 1999. Yavuze ko ikosa rikuru ryari ukubura ubushobozi n'ubushake bwa politiki. Yanenze kandi uko ubutumwa bwa Dallaire bwo muri Mutarama 1994 bwakiriwe.\nUmunyamabanga Mukuru wa ONU, Kofi Annan, yemeye ko ONU yatsinzwe. Yagaragaje akababaro gakomeye."}
{"id": "23729", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23729", "title": "Inzego z\u2019amadini", "text": "Inzego z\u2019amadini zagize uruhare rukomeye muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Abatutsi benshi bahungiye mu nsengero. Benshi bahiciwe.\nBamwe mu bihayimana bagize uruhare muri jenoside. Bamwe bakatiwe n'inkiko. Nyuma ya jenoside, Kiliziya Gatolika yasabye imbabazi.\nInsengero zahindutse aho kwicira abantu.\nMu 1994, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye mu nsengero. Bizeraga ko bazahabona umutekano. Leta y'u Rwanda ivuga ko abantu benshi biciwe mu nsengero bari bahungiyemo. Zimwe muri izo nsengero ubu ni inzibutso za jenoside. Ingero ni Nyamata, Ntarama na Nyange.\nAbihayimana bagize uruhare muri jenoside.\nAbarokotse bavuga ko bamwe mu bapadiri n'ababikira bagize uruhare mu bwicanyi.\nAthanase Seromba yari padiri wa paruwasi ya Nyange. Mu 1994, Abatutsi bagera ku 1 500 bahungiye muri kiliziya ya Nyange. Bose barishwe. Kiliziya yasenywe na buldozeri. Seromba yagiriye inama umushoferi wayo. Ku wa 12 Werurwe 2008, Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu.\nElizaphan Ntakirutimana yari pasiteri mukuru w'Itorero ry'Abadiventisti b'Umunsi wa Karindwi. Yatwaraga abicanyi ahantu bicaga Abatutsi bari bahungiye. Ku wa 19 Gashyantare 2003, urwo rukiko rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka icumi.\nGusaba imbabazi.\nKu wa 20 Ugushyingo 2016, Inama y'Abepiskopi Gatolika mu Rwanda yasabye imbabazi. Yemeye ko bamwe mu bakristu bayo bateguye jenoside, bayifashije kandi bayikora. Yasabye imbabazi ku makosa yose Kiliziya yakoze.\nKu wa 20 Werurwe 2017, Papa Fransisko yakiriye Perezida Paul Kagame i Vatikani. Papa yasabye Imana imbabazi ku byaha n'amakosa bya Kiliziya n'abayoboke bayo."}
{"id": "23730", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23730", "title": "Ikibazo cy'impunzi mu Karere k'Ibiyaga Bigari", "text": "Ikibazo cy'impunzi mu Karere k'Ibiyaga Bigari (mu Cyongereza: \"Great Lakes refugee crisis\") ni ihunga ry'Abanyarwanda benshi mu 1994. Iryo hunga ryabaye nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Abantu bagera kuri miliyoni ebyiri bahungiye mu bihugu bituranye n'u Rwanda. Bahungiye cyane cyane muri Zayire, muri Tanzaniya no mu Burundi.\nInkambi zo muri Zayire zagenzurwaga n'abasirikare ba kera n'abarwanyi. Mu 1996, Ingabo z'u Rwanda zasenye izo nkambi. Impunzi nyinshi zatahutse mu Rwanda. Izindi mpunzi nyinshi zaburiwe irengero.\nIhunga ryo mu 1994.\nMu mpera za Jenoside, abantu bagera kuri miliyoni ebyiri bari bamaze guhungira mu bihugu bituranye n'u Rwanda. Mu mpera z'Ukwakira 1994, impunzi zigera kuri miliyoni 1,2 zari muri Zayire. Izirenga ibihumbi 500 zari muri Tanzaniya. Izigera ku bihumbi 270 zari mu Burundi.\nMu kwezi kwa Nyakanga 1994, impunzi ibihumbi amagana zageze i Goma, muri Zayire. Izindi zageze i Bukavu. Zabaga mu nkambi nka Kibumba, Katale na Mugunga. Bitatu bya kane by'impunzi byari abagore n'abana.\nMuri Tanzaniya, impunzi nyinshi zabaga mu nkambi zo mu karere ka Ngara. Inkambi nini yari Benaco. Yari ituwe n'abantu bagera ku bihumbi 160.\nIndwara n'impfu.\nMu nkambi za Goma, indwara ya kolera yishe abantu benshi. Mu kwezi kwa mbere, abantu bagera ku bihumbi 50 barapfuye. Bishwe na kolera, macinya n'indwara ya mugiga.\nInkambi zigenzurwa n'abasirikare ba kera.\nAbasirikare b'ingabo za kera z'u Rwanda n'abarwanyi b'imitwe yitwara gisirikare bagenzuye inkambi. Iyo mitwe yarimo Interahamwe. Bigaruriye imfashanyo yagenewe impunzi.\nItahuka ry'impunzi mu 1996.\nKu wa 26 Ukwakira 1996, Ingabo z'u Rwanda zateye inkambi za Kibumba na Katale. Ku wa 15 Ugushyingo 1996, zateye inkambi ya Mugunga. Impunzi ziri hagati y'ibihumbi 400 n'ibihumbi 700 zahungiye mu Rwanda.\nMu kwezi k'Ukuboza 1996, Leta ya Tanzaniya yasabye impunzi z'Abanyarwanda kuva mu gihugu. Mu mpera z'uwo mwaka, impunzi zigera ku bihumbi 470 zari zatahutse mu Rwanda.\nIzindi mpunzi zahungiye mu mashyamba ya Zayire. Mu 1997, impunzi nyinshi zaguye mu nzira. Muri Gicurasi 1997, MSF yatangaje ko impunzi ibihumbi 190 zaburiwe irengero muri Zayire."}
{"id": "23731", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23731", "title": "Uruhare rw'umuryango mpuzamahanga muri jenoside y'Abatutsi mu Rwanda", "text": "Uruhare rw'umuryango mpuzamahanga muri jenoside y'Abatutsi mu Rwanda ni ibyo ibihugu n'imiryango mpuzamahanga byakoze cyangwa bitakoze mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ibihugu byinshi n'imiryango mpuzamahanga byari bizi ibibera mu Rwanda. Ariko ntibyahagaritse jenoside.\nUmuryango w'Abibumbye (ONU) wari ufite ingabo za MINUAR mu Rwanda. Izo ngabo zagabanyijwe jenoside imaze gutangira. Ububiligi, Ubufaransa na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika na byo byaranenzwe. Nyuma ya jenoside, abayobozi benshi bemeye ko bananiwe. Bamwe basabye imbabazi.\nONU na MINUAR.\nONU yashyizeho MINUAR mu Ukwakira 1993. Byakozwe n'icyemezo 872 cy'Akanama gashinzwe umutekano. MINUAR yari ishinzwe gufasha gushyira mu bikorwa amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha. Yari ifite abasirikare 2 548.\nJenoside yatangiye ku ya 6 Mata 1994, nyuma y'igitero ku ndege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana. Ku ya 21 Mata 1994, Akanama gashinzwe umutekano kafashe icyemezo 912. Iki cyemezo cyagabanyije MINUAR. Yasigaranye abasirikare 270 gusa.\nKu ya 17 Gicurasi 1994, icyemezo 918 cyabujije kugurisha intwaro u Rwanda. Cyemeje kandi kongera MINUAR kugeza ku basirikare 5 500. Ku ya 22 Kamena 1994, icyemezo 929 cyemeye igikorwa cy'Ubufaransa cyiswe \"Turquoise\".\nMu Ukuboza 1999, itsinda ryigenga ryasohoye raporo kuri ONU. Iryo tsinda ryari riyobowe na Ingvar Carlsson. Raporo yavuze ko ONU yatereranye abaturage b'u Rwanda mu gihe cya jenoside. Umunyamabanga mukuru wa ONU, Kofi Annan, yemeye imyanzuro yayo. Yagaragaje agahinda gakomeye.\nUbubiligi.\nAbasirikare b'Ababiligi bari muri MINUAR. Ku ya 7 Mata 1994, abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi barishwe. Bari bashinzwe kurinda Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Na we yarishwe.\nKu ya 7 Mata 2000, Minisitiri w'Intebe w'Ububiligi Guy Verhofstadt yari i Kigali. Yemeye uruhare rwa politiki n'urwa gisirikare rw'Ububiligi. Yasabye imbabazi mu izina ry'igihugu cye. Yavuze kandi ko umuryango mpuzamahanga wose ufite uruhare runini.\nUbufaransa.\nMu Kamena 1994, Ubufaransa bwayoboye igikorwa \"Turquoise\". ONU yari yabyemeye.\nMu Werurwe 2021, komisiyo y'abahanga mu mateka yashyikirije raporo Perezida w'Ubufaransa. Iyo komisiyo yari iyobowe na Vincent Duclert. Ku ya 27 Gicurasi 2021, Perezida Emmanuel Macron yavugiye ku Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali. Yemeye ko Ubufaransa bufite uruhare rwa politiki. Ariko ntiyasabye imbabazi. Yavuze kandi ko Ubufaransa butafatanyije n'abakoze jenoside.\nLeta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika.\nKu ya 25 Werurwe 1998, Perezida Bill Clinton yavugiye ku kibuga cy'indege cya Kigali. Yavuze ko umuryango mpuzamahanga utihutiye gukora ubwicanyi bumaze gutangira. Yavuze kandi ko ibyo byaha bitahise byitwa izina ryabyo: jenoside.\nUmuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika.\nUmuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika (OUA) washyizeho itsinda ry'abantu b'inararibonye. Iryo tsinda ryakoze iperereza kuri jenoside. Raporo yaryo yasohotse muri Nyakanga 2000. Kofi Annan yakiriye neza iyo raporo."}
{"id": "23732", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23732", "title": "James Newton Howard", "text": "James Newton Howard (yavutse ku wa 9 Kamena 1951) ni umuhimbyi w'umuziki w'Umunyamerika. Ahimba cyane cyane umuziki wa filime. Yahimbye umuziki wa filime nyinshi zizwi.\nMbere yo guhimba umuziki wa filime, yacurangaga piyano mu itsinda rya Elton John. Yatoranyijwe inshuro icyenda mu bihembo bya Oscar.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nJames Newton Howard yavukiye i Los Angeles, muri Kaliforuniya. Yatangiye kwiga umuziki akiri umwana muto. Yize mu ishuri ry'umuziki ryitwa Music Academy of the West, i Santa Barbara. Nyuma yaho, yize piyano muri University of Southern California.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1975 kugeza mu 1981, James Newton Howard yacurangaga piyano mu itsinda rya Elton John. Yanakoranye n'itsinda Toto. Mu 1986, yayoboye orchestre ya Melbourne mu ngendo za Elton John muri Ositaraliya.\nHagati mu myaka ya 1980, yatangiye guhimba umuziki wa filime. Mu 1990, yahimbye umuziki wa filime \"Pretty Woman\". Mu 1991, umuziki wa \"The Prince of Tides\" watumye atoranywa bwa mbere mu bihembo bya Oscar. Yongeye gutoranywa kubera \"The Fugitive\" (1993), \"My Best Friend's Wedding\" (1997), \"The Village\" (2004), \"Michael Clayton\" (2007), \"Defiance\" (2008) na \"News of the World\" (2020). Yatoranyijwe kandi kubera indirimbo za filime \"Junior\" na \"One Fine Day\".\nMu 1995, yatoranyijwe mu bihembo bya Emmy. Byatewe n'indirimbo ibanza y'uruhererekane rwa televiziyo \"ER\".\nJames Newton Howard yakoranye kenshi n'umuyobozi wa filime M. Night Shyamalan. Yahimbye umuziki wa \"The Sixth Sense\", \"Unbreakable\" na \"Signs\". Yafatanyije na Hans Zimmer guhimba umuziki wa \"Batman Begins\" na \"The Dark Knight\". Umuziki wa \"King Kong\" (2005) watumye atoranywa bwa mbere mu bihembo bya Golden Globe. Yahimbye kandi umuziki wa filime zose za \"The Hunger Games\" n'uwa \"Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them\"."}
{"id": "23733", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23733", "title": "Hans Zimmer", "text": "Hans Florian Zimmer (yavutse ku wa 12 Nzeri 1957) ni umuhimbyi w'umuziki w'Umudage. Ahimba cyane cyane umuziki wa filime. Ni n'umutunganya w'umuziki.\nYahawe ibihembo bibiri bya Oscar. Yahawe kandi ibihembo bitanu bya Grammy n'ibihembo bitatu bya Golden Globe.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nHans Zimmer yavukiye i Frankfurt, mu Ubudage, ku wa 12 Nzeri 1957. Mu ntangiriro y'umwuga we, yakoranye n'itsinda The Buggles. Nyuma yaho, yatangiye guhimba umuziki wa filime.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1988, Hans Zimmer yahimbye umuziki wa filime \"Rain Man\". Uwo muziki watumye atoranywa mu bihembo bya Oscar. Nyuma yaho, yahimbye umuziki wa \"Driving Miss Daisy\" na \"Thelma and Louise\".\nMu 1995, yahawe igihembo cye cya mbere cya Oscar kubera umuziki wa \"The Lion King\". Iyo filime yamuhesheje kandi ibihembo bibiri bya Grammy.\nHans Zimmer yakoranye n'umuyobozi wa filime Ridley Scott kuri \"Gladiator\". Yahimbye kandi umuziki wa filime za \"Pirates of the Caribbean\". Yakoranye kenshi n'umuyobozi wa filime Christopher Nolan. Yafatanyije na James Newton Howard guhimba umuziki wa \"The Dark Knight\" (2008). Yahimbye kandi umuziki wa \"Inception\", \"Interstellar\" (2014) na \"Dunkirk\" (2017).\nMu 2022, yahawe igihembo cye cya kabiri cya Oscar kubera umuziki wa \"Dune\". Mu 2025, umuziki wa \"Dune: Part Two\" wamuhesheje igihembo cye cya gatanu cya Grammy."}
{"id": "23734", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23734", "title": "Elton John", "text": "Elton John (yavutse ku wa 25 Werurwe 1947) ni umuririmbyi w'Umwongereza. Ni n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo n'umucuranzi wa piyano. Izina rye ry'amavuko ni Reginald Kenneth Dwight.\nElton John ari mu bahanzi bagurishije disiki nyinshi ku isi. Yahawe ibihembo byinshi, birimo Oscar, Grammy, Tony na Emmy.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nElton John yavukiye i Pinner, mu Ubwongereza, ku wa 25 Werurwe 1947. Afite imyaka itatu, yatangiye gucuranga piyano. Afite imyaka 11, yabonye buruse yo kwiga muri Royal Academy of Music i Londres. Yahize ku wa gatandatu mu gihe cy'imyaka ine.\nUmwuga.\nElton John akorana igihe kirekire n'umwanditsi w'amagambo Bernie Taupin. Mu 1970, yasohoye alubumu yitwa \"Elton John\". Muri uwo mwaka, yakoze ingendo ze za mbere z'ibitaramo. Indirimbo ze zizwi cyane ni \"Your Song\", \"Crocodile Rock\", \"Rocket Man\" na \"Candle in the Wind\". Hagati ya 1972 na 1975, alubumu ze ndwi zabaye iza mbere muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika.\nKuva mu 1975 kugeza mu 1981, James Newton Howard yacurangaga piyano mu itsinda rya Elton John.\nMu 1995, Elton John yahawe igihembo cya Oscar. Mu 1998, yahimbye indirimbo z'ikinamico \"The Lion King\" afatanyije na Tim Rice. Mu 1997, indirimbo \"Candle in the Wind 1997\" yagurishijwe kopi zirenga miliyoni 33. Ni yo disiki imwe yagurishijwe cyane kurusha izindi mu mateka.\nMu 1994, yinjijwe muri Rock and Roll Hall of Fame. Muri Mutarama 2024, yahawe igihembo cya Emmy. Icyo gihembo cyatumye aba umwe mu bahanzi bafite ibihembo bine bikomeye: Emmy, Grammy, Oscar na Tony."}
{"id": "23735", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23735", "title": "Miriam Makeba", "text": "Miriam Makeba (4 Werurwe 1932 \u2013 10 Ugushyingo 2008) yari umuririmbyi wo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo. Yari azwi ku izina rya \u00ab\u00a0Mama Afrika\u00a0\u00bb.\nYabaye mu buhungiro imyaka igera kuri mirongo itatu. Indirimbo ye \"Pata Pata\" yamenyekanye ku isi yose. Yagarutse muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo mu 1990.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nMiriam Makeba yavukiye i Prospect Township, hafi ya Johannesburg, ku wa 4 Werurwe 1932. Mu 1952, yatangiye kuririmba mu itsinda Manhattan Brothers. Mu 1959, yagaragaye muri filime mbarankuru \"Come Back, Africa\". Iyo filime yatumye umuhanzi w'Umunyamerika Harry Belafonte amumenya.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1959, Miriam Makeba yagiye gutura muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Harry Belafonte yaramufashije. Mu 1960, Afurika y\u2019Epfo yanze ko agaruka mu gihugu. Yabaye mu buhungiro imyaka igera kuri mirongo itatu.\nMu 1963, yavuze imbere y'Umuryango w\u2019Abibumye. Yamaganye apartheid. Mu 1965, we na Harry Belafonte bahawe igihembo cya Grammy. Mu 1967, indirimbo ye \"Pata Pata\" yamenyekanye ku isi yose. Mu 1968, yashakanye na Stokely Carmichael. Batandukanye mu 1979. Bimukiye muri Afurika, batura muri Gineya.\nMu 1990, Nelson Mandela yamushishikarije kugaruka muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo. Mu 1991, yakoreye igitaramo muri icyo gihugu.\nMiriam Makeba yapfuye ku wa 10 Ugushyingo 2008, i Castel Volturno, hafi ya Naples, mu Ubutaliyani. Yari afite imyaka 76."}
{"id": "23736", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23736", "title": "Papa Wemba", "text": "Papa Wemba (14 Kamena 1949 \u2013 24 Mata 2016) yari umuririmbyi wo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yari azwi nk'\u00ab\u00a0umwami wa rumba y'Abanyekongo\u00a0\u00bb.\nIjwi rye n'uburyo yitwaraga ku rubyiniro byafashije umuziki wa Afurika kumenyekana ku isi. Yapfuye mu 2016, nyuma yo kugwa ku rubyiniro i Abidjan.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nPapa Wemba yavukiye i Lubefu, mu karere ka Kasai, ku wa 14 Kamena 1949. Icyo gihe, icyo gihugu cyakolonizwaga n'Ububiligi. Izina rye ry'amavuko ni Jules Shungu Wembadio Pene Kikumba. Mu 1969, yinjiye mu itsinda Za\u00efko Langa Langa. Iryo tsinda ryacurangaga soukous.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1977, Papa Wemba yashinze itsinda rye bwite ryitwa Viva la Musica. Abafana be bitwaga \u00ab\u00a0sapeurs\u00a0\u00bb. Bari mu muryango witwa \u00ab\u00a0La Sape\u00a0\u00bb. Uwo muryango wakundaga imyenda ihenze yo mu Burayi, nk'uko Papa Wemba yayikundaga.\nMu 1986, Papa Wemba yagiye gutura mu Ubufaransa. Yakoranye na Peter Gabriel. Mu 1995, yasohoye alubumu \"Emotion\" kuri Real World, inzu y'umuziki ya Peter Gabriel. Yakoranye kandi na Stevie Wonder.\nMu 2004, urukiko rw'i Paris rwamuhamije icyaha cyo kwinjiza abimukira mu Bufaransa mu buryo butemewe. Bari bihishe mu bagize itsinda rye.\nKu wa 24 Mata 2016, Papa Wemba yaguye ku rubyiniro i Abidjan, muri Kote Divuwari. Yaririmbaga mu iserukiramuco ry'umuziki. Yapfuye afite imyaka 66."}
{"id": "23737", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23737", "title": "Koffi Olomid\u00e9", "text": "Koffi Olomid\u00e9 (yavutse ku wa 13 Nyakanga 1956) ni umuririmbyi wo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo. Ayobora itsinda Quartier Latin International.\nAri mu bahanzi bakomeye ba rumba y'Abanyekongo. Yakoranye na Papa Wemba mu ntangiriro y'umwuga we.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nKoffi Olomid\u00e9 yavukiye i Kisangani, ku wa 13 Nyakanga 1956. Izina rye ry'amavuko ni Antoine Christophe Agbepa Mumba. Akiri ingimbi, yakurikiraga itsinda Za\u00efko Langa Langa. Icyo gihe, yabaye inshuti ya Papa Wemba. Nyuma yaho, Papa Wemba yayoboye itsinda Viva la Musica. Koffi Olomid\u00e9 yaririmbye muri bimwe mu ndirimbo z'iryo tsinda.\nUmwuga.\nKoffi Olomid\u00e9 yatangiye umwuga we mu 1977. Nyuma ya 1978, yabaga i Kinshasa, ariko akajya kwiga kaminuza mu Ubufaransa.\nMu 1986, yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Dieu Voit Tout\". Muri uwo mwaka, yashinze itsinda Quartier Latin. Mu 1987, alubumu \"Tcha Tcho\" yatumye amenyekana cyane muri rumba.\nIzindi alubumu ze zizwi ni \"Noblesse Oblige\" (1994), \"Ultimatum\" (1997), \"Effrakata\" (2001) na \"Danger de Mort\" (2006). Kimwe na Papa Wemba, azwi mu muryango wa \u00ab\u00a0La Sape\u00a0\u00bb, ukunda imyenda ihenze."}
{"id": "23738", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23738", "title": "Fela Kuti", "text": "Fela Kuti (15 Ukwakira 1938 \u2013 2 Kanama 1997) yari umuririmbyi n'umucuranzi wo muri Nijeriya. Ni we wahanze injyana ya Afrobeat. Yari azwi kandi ku izina rya Fela Anikulapo-Kuti.\nIndirimbo ze nyinshi zanengaga ubutegetsi bwa Nijeriya. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yafunzwe inshuro nyinshi.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nFela Kuti yavukiye i Abeokuta, muri Nijeriya, ku wa 15 Ukwakira 1938. Nyina yari Funmilayo Ransome-Kuti. Yaharaniraga uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakozi. Mu 1959, Fela Kuti yagiye kwiga umuziki i Londres, muri Trinity College. Icyo gihe, yacurangaga piyano mu matsinda ya jazz na rock.\nUmwuga.\nHagati mu myaka ya 1960, Fela Kuti yagarutse muri Nijeriya. Yongeye gushinga itsinda Koola Lobitos. Muri iryo tsinda ni ho injyana ya Afrobeat yavukiye. Afrobeat ivanga blues, jazz na funk byo muri Amerika n'umuziki gakondo w'Abayoruba. Itsinda rye ryitwaga Nigeria 70, Africa 70, nyuma riza kwitwa Egypt 80.\nFela Kuti yashinze urugo rusangiwe hafi y'akabari ke i Lagos. Yarwise \u00ab\u00a0Repubulika ya Kalakuta\u00a0\u00bb. Mu 1977, abategetsi ba Nijeriya bateye urwo rugo. Fela Kuti yafunzwe igihe gito. Indirimbo ye \"Zombie\" ni imwe mu ndirimbo ze za politiki zizwi.\nMu 1979, yashinze ishyaka Movement of the People. Yiyamamarije kuba perezida wa Nijeriya, ariko ntiyatsinda. Mu 1984, yongeye gufungwa.\nFela Kuti yapfuye ku wa 2 Kanama 1997, i Lagos. Yazize indwara zatewe na SIDA. Umuhungu we Femi Kuti yakomeje umuziki wa Afrobeat."}
{"id": "23739", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23739", "title": "Ang\u00e9lique Kidjo", "text": "Ang\u00e9lique Kidjo (yavutse ku wa 14 Nyakanga 1960) ni umuririmbyi wo muri Bene. Ni n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo. Avanga injyana nyinshi z'umuziki.\nYahawe ibihembo bitanu bya Grammy. Ni ambasaderi wa UNICEF kuva mu 2002.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nAng\u00e9lique Kidjo yavukiye i Ouidah, muri Bene, ku wa 14 Nyakanga 1960. Icyo gihe, icyo gihugu cyitwaga Dahomey. Yakuriye i Cotonou. Akiri muto, yumvaga umuziki gakondo w'aho yakuriye. Yumvaga kandi abahanzi nka Aretha Franklin, James Brown na Stevie Wonder.\nUmwuga.\nAng\u00e9lique Kidjo azwi kubera gukorana n'abahanzi bakomeye bo ku isi. Mu 1991, yasohoye alubumu \"Logozo\". Nyuma yaho, yasohoye \"Fifa\" (1995) na \"Eve\" (2014).\nMu 2008, alubumu ye \"Djin Djin\" yamuhesheje igihembo cya mbere cya Grammy. Yahawe ibindi bihembo bya Grammy kubera \"Eve\", \"Sings\", \"Celia\" na \"Mother Nature\". Muri rusange, afite ibihembo bitanu bya Grammy. Mu 2023, yahawe igihembo cya Polar Music Prize.\nKu wa 25 Nyakanga 2002, Ang\u00e9lique Kidjo yagizwe ambasaderi wa UNICEF. Aharanira cyane ko abakobwa biga. Yashinze umuryango Batonga Foundation. Uwo muryango ufasha abakobwa bo muri Afurika kwiga."}
{"id": "23740", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23740", "title": "Youssou N'Dour", "text": "Youssou N'Dour (yavutse ku wa 1 Ukwakira 1959) ni umuririmbyi wo muri Senegali. Ni n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo. Yamenyekanishije ku isi injyana ya mbalax.\nMu 2012, yabaye minisitiri w'umuco n'ubukerarugendo muri Senegali. Afite kandi ibitangazamakuru i Dakar.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nYoussou N'Dour yavukiye i Dakar, muri Senegali, ku wa 1 Ukwakira 1959. Yavukiye mu muryango w'abagriyo. Abagriyo ni abaririmbyi n'abacuranzi babika amateka mu mvugo. Afite imyaka 12, yatangiye kuririmba mu itsinda Star Band. Se ntiyabishakaga.\nUmwuga.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya 1970, Youssou N'Dour yashinze itsinda \u00c9toile de Dakar. Mu 1981, iryo tsinda ryabaye Super \u00c9toile de Dakar. Mu ntangiriro y'imyaka ya 1980, yateje imbere injyana ya mbalax. Mbalax ivanga umuziki gakondo w'Abawolofu n'injyana zo muri Amerika y'Epfo. Yakoranye kandi na Peter Gabriel, Paul Simon na Sting.\nMu 1991, yabaye ambasaderi wa UNICEF. Mu 1994, indirimbo \"7 Seconds\" yaririmbanye na Neneh Cherry yamenyekanye cyane ku isi. Mu Bufaransa, iyo ndirimbo yamaze ibyumweru 16 ari iya mbere. Mu 1998, yaririmbye indirimbo y'Igikombe cy'Isi cy'umupira w'amaguru mu Bufaransa.\nAlubumu ye \"Egypt\" yamuhesheje igihembo cya Grammy. Mu 2013, yahawe igihembo cya Polar Music Prize. Mu 2017, yahawe igihembo cya Praemium Imperiale.\nMu 2012, Youssou N'Dour yashatse kwiyamamariza kuba perezida wa Senegali. Kuva muri Mata kugeza mu Ukwakira 2012, yabaye minisitiri w'umuco n'ubukerarugendo. Nyuma yaho, kugeza muri Nzeri 2013, yabaye minisitiri w'ubukerarugendo n'imyidagaduro. Mu 2003, yashinze Groupe Futurs M\u00e9dias. Iyo sosiyete ifite ikinyamakuru, radiyo na televiziyo."}
{"id": "23741", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23741", "title": "Diamond Platnumz", "text": "Diamond Platnumz (yavutse ku wa 2 Ukwakira 1989) ni umuririmbyi wo muri Tanzaniya. Aririmba injyana ya Bongo Flava. Ni n'umucuruzi.\nYashinze inzu y'umuziki WCB Wasafi. Afite kandi radiyo na televiziyo byitwa Wasafi.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nIzina rye ry'amavuko ni Nasibu Abdul Juma Issack. Yavutse ku wa 2 Ukwakira 1989. Yakuriye i Tandale, mu mujyi wa Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya.\nUmwuga.\nDiamond Platnumz ni umuririmbyi, umukinnyi wa filime n'umubyinnyi. Aririmba injyana ya Bongo Flava. Mu 2010, yasohoye alubumu \"Kamwambie\". Mu 2012, yasohoye \"Lala Salama\". Ku wa 14 Werurwe 2018, yasohoye alubumu \"A Boy From Tandale\".\nDiamond Platnumz yashinze inzu y'umuziki WCB Wasafi, kandi ni we uyiyobora. Yashinze kandi sosiyete ya filime Zoom Extra. Afite televiziyo Wasafi TV na radiyo Wasafi FM.\nYahawe ibihembo byinshi, birimo MTV Awards, Channel O, Headies, AFRIMA na Kora. Yatoranyijwe kandi mu bihembo bya BET."}
{"id": "23742", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23742", "title": "Bob Marley", "text": "Bob Marley (6 Gashyantare 1945 \u2013 11 Gicurasi 1981) yari umuririmbyi wo muri Jamayika. Yari n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo. Ni we muhanzi uzwi cyane w'injyana ya reggae.\nIndirimbo ze zahamagariraga amahoro n'urukundo. Yatumye umuziki wa Jamayika umenyekana ku isi yose.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nBob Marley yavukiye i Nine Mile, mu ntara ya Saint Ann, muri Jamayika, ku wa 6 Gashyantare 1945. Izina rye ry'amavuko ni Robert Nesta Marley. Yakuriye mu gace k'abakene.\nMu 1963, yashinze itsinda The Wailers. Abandi bari barigize ni Peter Tosh na Bunny Wailer. Indirimbo yabo ya mbere ni \"Simmer Down\". Muri Mutarama 1964, yabaye iya mbere muri Jamayika.\nUmwuga.\nMu myaka ya 1970, Bob Marley yavanze ska, rock steady na reggae n'umuziki wa rock. Mu 1973, The Wailers basohoye alubumu \"Catch a Fire\" kuri Island Records. Mu 1974, Peter Tosh na Bunny Wailer bavuye mu itsinda. Alubumu \"Exodus\" na \"Kaya\" zagurishijwe cyane ku isi.\nKu wa 22 Mata 1978, Bob Marley yaririmbye mu gitaramo One Love Peace Concert i Kingston. Mu 1980, yakoreye igitaramo gikomeye muri Zimbabwe, imbere y'abantu bagera ku 40 000. Icyo gihugu cyari kimaze kubona ubwigenge.\nMu 1977, abaganga basanze afite kanseri ku ino. Mu 1980, kanseri yakwiriye mu mubiri. Bob Marley yapfuye ku wa 11 Gicurasi 1981, i Miami. Yari afite imyaka 36. Mu 1994, yinjijwe muri Rock and Roll Hall of Fame."}
{"id": "23743", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23743", "title": "Piyano", "text": "Piyano ni igikoresho cy'umuziki gifite utubuto twitwa \u00ab\u00a0clavier\u00a0\u00bb. Iyo ukanze akabuto, inyundo ntoya ikubita urudodo rw'icyuma. Urwo rudodo rugatanga ijwi.\nPiyano yahimbwe mu Butaliyani ahagana mu 1700. Ubu ni kimwe mu bikoresho by'umuziki bikoreshwa cyane ku isi.\nAmateka.\nPiyano yahimbwe na Bartolomeo Cristofori ahagana mu 1700. Yakoreraga umuryango wa Medici i Florence, mu Ubutaliyani. Mu 1711, umwanditsi Scipione Maffei yayise \u00ab\u00a0gravicembalo col piano, e forte\u00a0\u00bb. Ni ho izina \u00ab\u00a0pianoforte\u00a0\u00bb ryavuye. Mu Gitaliyani, \"piano\" bisobanura \u00ab\u00a0buhoro\u00a0\u00bb, naho \"forte\" bisobanura \u00ab\u00a0cyane\u00a0\u00bb. Iryo zina ryerekana ko piyano ishobora gucurangwa buhoro cyangwa cyane.\nPiyano ya kera kurusha izindi zisigaye ni iya Cristofori yo mu 1720. Ibitswe mu nzu ndangamurage ya Metropolitan Museum of Art i New York. Ifite utubuto 54.\nImiterere.\nPiyano y'ubu ifite utubuto 88. Iyo ukanze akabuto, inyundo ipfutse ubwoya ikubita urudodo rw'icyuma. Hari ubwoko bubiri bw'ingenzi: piyano nini (\"grand piano\") na piyano ihagaze (\"upright piano\"). Mu kinyejana cya 19, piyano ihagaze yabaye iya mbere mu ngo.\nAbahimbyi b'umuziki bazwi cyane bandikiye piyano ni nka Mozart, Haydn, Beethoven, Brahms na George Gershwin."}
{"id": "23744", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23744", "title": "Filime", "text": "Filime ni urukurikirane rw'amafoto yerekanwa vuba vuba ku rukuta cyangwa kuri ekarani. Ijisho ribona ayo mafoto nk'ibintu bigenda.\nFilime ya mbere yerekanywe ku mugaragaro i Paris mu 1895. Filime za mbere ntizagiraga ijwi.\nUko ikora.\nFilime igizwe n'amafoto menshi atagenda. Ayo mafoto yerekanwa vuba vuba hakoreshejwe urumuri. Kubera uko ijisho rikora, umuntu abona ibintu bigenda nta guhagarara.\nAmateka.\nMu 1891, Thomas Edison yari amaze gukora igikoresho cyitwa kinetoscope. Cyatumaga umuntu umwe areba amafoto agenda.\nKu wa 28 Ukuboza 1895, abavandimwe Lumi\u00e8re berekanye filime ku mugaragaro bwa mbere. Byabereye i Paris, muri Grand Caf\u00e9. Berekanye filime ngufi icumi. Bakoreshaga igikoresho cyitwa cin\u00e9matographe.\nFilime za mbere ntizagiraga ijwi. Mu 1927, sosiyete Warner Brothers yasohoye filime \"The Jazz Singer\". Ifatwa nka filime ndende ya mbere ifite amagambo yumvikana. Yatumye igihe cya filime zitavuga kirangira."}
{"id": "23745", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23745", "title": "Igihembo cya Grammy", "text": "Igihembo cya Grammy (mu Cyongereza: \"Grammy Award\") ni igihembo gitangwa buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Gihemba abakoze neza mu muziki.\nIgihembo cya mbere cyatanzwe mu 1959. Icyo gihembo gisa na gramofone, igikoresho cya kera cyacurangaga disiki.\nAmateka.\nIbihembo bya Grammy bitangwa na National Academy of Recording Arts &amp; Sciences, izwi kandi nka Recording Academy. Ibihembo bya Latin Grammy bitangwa na Latin Academy of Recording Arts &amp; Sciences.\nKu wa 4 Gicurasi 1959, ibihembo bya mbere bya Grammy byatanzwe i Los Angeles n'i New York. Icyo gihe hatanzwe ibihembo 28 gusa. Mu myaka ya vuba, hatangwa ibihembo birenga 90. Igihembo ubwacyo ni igishushanyo gito gisa na gramofone.\nAbahanzi bamwe bahawe Grammy.\nBamwe mu bahanzi bahawe igihembo cya Grammy ni Michael Jackson, Elton John, Hans Zimmer, Miriam Makeba, Ang\u00e9lique Kidjo na Youssou N'Dour."}
{"id": "23746", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23746", "title": "Igihembo cya Oscar", "text": "Igihembo cya Oscar (mu Cyongereza: \"Academy Award\") ni igihembo gitangwa buri mwaka. Gihemba abakoze neza mu bijyanye na filime.\nGitangwa na Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Abatsinze bahabwa agashushanyo gasizwe zahabu kitwa \u00ab\u00a0Oscar\u00a0\u00bb.\nAmateka.\nIbihembo bya Oscar byatanzwe bwa mbere mu 1929. Ku wa 16 Gicurasi 1929, umuhango wa mbere wabereye muri Hollywood Roosevelt Hotel. Abantu 270 ni bo bawitabiriye. Gutanga ibihembo byamaze iminota 15 gusa. Hatanzwe udushushanyo 15. Filime \"Wings\" ni yo yahawe igihembo cya filime nziza kurusha izindi.\nInkomoko y'izina \u00ab\u00a0Oscar\u00a0\u00bb ntizwi neza. Iryo zina ryatangiye gukoreshwa ahagana mu 1934.\nAbahawe Oscar.\nBamwe mu bahawe igihembo cya Oscar ni Hans Zimmer na Elton John. James Newton Howard yatoranyijwe inshuro icyenda."}
{"id": "23747", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23747", "title": "Quincy Jones", "text": "Quincy Jones (14 Werurwe 1933 \u2013 3 Ugushyingo 2024) yari umutunganya w'umuziki w'Umunyamerika. Yari n'umuhimbyi w'umuziki n'umucuranzi.\nYatunganyije alubumu \"Thriller\" ya Michael Jackson. Yahawe ibihembo 28 bya Grammy.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nQuincy Jones yavukiye i Chicago, muri Leta ya Illinois, ku wa 14 Werurwe 1933. Mu mashuri yisumbuye i Seattle, yacurangaga trompette. Nyuma yaho, yize muri Berklee College of Music.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1953, Quincy Jones yakoze ingendo z'ibitaramo mu Burayi hamwe na Lionel Hampton. Mu 1954, yagarutse i New York. Yibanze ku kwandika umuziki. Mu 1961, yabaye visi perezida wa Mercury Records. Ni we Munyamerika w'umwirabura wa mbere wabonye uwo mwanya.\nQuincy Jones yahimbye umuziki wa filime nyinshi. Muri zo harimo \"In the Heat of the Night\" (1967), \"The Italian Job\" (1969) na \"The Color Purple\" (1985).\nYatunganyije alubumu eshatu za Michael Jackson: \"Off the Wall\" (1979), \"Thriller\" (1982) na \"Bad\" (1987). \"Thriller\" ni yo alubumu yagurishijwe cyane kurusha izindi mu mateka. Mu 1985, yatunganyije indirimbo \"We Are the World\". Yashinze kandi ikinyamakuru \"Vibe\".\nQuincy Jones yahawe ibihembo 28 bya Grammy. Yapfuye ku wa 3 Ugushyingo 2024, iwe i Bel Air, muri Kaliforuniya. Yari afite imyaka 91."}
{"id": "23748", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23748", "title": "The Jackson 5", "text": "The Jackson 5 ni itsinda ry'umuziki ryo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Ryari rigizwe n'abavandimwe batanu bo mu muryango wa Jackson. Muri bo harimo Michael Jackson.\nIryo tsinda ryamenyekanye cyane mu ntangiriro y'imyaka ya 1970. Ni ryo ryatangije umwuga wa Michael Jackson.\nAmateka.\nThe Jackson 5 ryashinzwe na Joseph Jackson, se w'abo bana. Abarigize ni Jackie, Tito, Jermaine, Marlon na Michael Jackson. Michael Jackson yabaye umuririmbyi mukuru waryo afite imyaka icyenda.\nMu ntangiriro ya 1969, Berry Gordy, washinze Motown, yasinyishije iryo tsinda. Muri Ukuboza 1969, ryasohoye alubumu ya mbere, \"Diana Ross Presents the Jackson 5\". Indirimbo \"I Want You Back\" yabaye iya mbere ku rutonde rwa Billboard Hot 100. Indirimbo zabo zindi zizwi ni \"ABC\".\nMu 1976, itsinda ryavuye muri Motown. Michael Jackson yagumye muri iryo tsinda kugeza mu 1984. Mu 1997, The Jackson 5 ryinjijwe muri Rock and Roll Hall of Fame."}
{"id": "23749", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23749", "title": "Thriller", "text": "Thriller ni alubumu y'umuririmbyi w'Umunyamerika Michael Jackson. Yasohotse mu Ugushyingo 1982. Yatunganyijwe na Quincy Jones.\n\"Thriller\" ni yo alubumu yagurishijwe cyane kurusha izindi mu mateka. Yamuhesheje ibihembo umunani bya Grammy mu ijoro rimwe.\nAmateka.\nMichael Jackson yasohoye \"Thriller\" mu Ugushyingo 1982. Iyo alubumu yatunganyijwe na Quincy Jones. Ni yo alubumu ya kabiri bakoranye, nyuma ya \"Off the Wall\" (1979).\nMu 1983, indirimbo \"Billie Jean\" na \"Beat It\" zo kuri iyo alubumu zagaragaje uburyo bwa Michael Jackson bwo kubyina. Ku wa 2 Ukuboza 1983, hasohotse amashusho y'indirimbo \"Thriller\".\nIntsinzi.\n\"Thriller\" yamaze ibyumweru 37 ari iya mbere ku rutonde rwa Billboard 200. Mu mpera za 1983, yari imaze kugurishwa kopi zigera kuri miliyoni 32. Ubu imaze kugurishwa kopi zigera kuri miliyoni 67 ku isi.\nKu wa 28 Gashyantare 1984, Michael Jackson yahawe ibihembo umunani bya Grammy. Ni we muhanzi wa mbere wahawe ibihembo umunani mu ijoro rimwe."}
{"id": "23750", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23750", "title": "Bernie Taupin", "text": "Bernie Taupin (yavutse ku wa 22 Gicurasi 1950) ni umwanditsi w'amagambo y'indirimbo w'Umwongereza. Azwi cyane kubera gukorana na Elton John.\nYanditse amagambo y'indirimbo nyinshi zizwi za Elton John. Ni n'umunyabugeni.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nBernie Taupin yavukiye i Lincolnshire, mu Ubwongereza, ku wa 22 Gicurasi 1950. Izina rye ry'amavuko ni Bernard John Taupin.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1967, Bernie Taupin yasubije itangazo rya sosiyete yashakaga abanditsi b'indirimbo. Uwari uyoboye iyo sosiyete yahaye Elton John amagambo ya Taupin. Yamusabye kuyahimbira injyana. Ni uko batangiye gukorana.\nBernie Taupin yanditse amagambo y'indirimbo nyinshi za Elton John. Muri zo harimo \"Your Song\", \"Tiny Dancer\", \"Crocodile Rock\", \"Goodbye Yellow Brick Road\", \"Daniel\" na \"Candle in the Wind\". Mu 1985, yanditse kandi indirimbo \"We Built This City\" y'itsinda Starship.\nIndirimbo \"(I'm Gonna) Love Me Again\", yanditswe kubera filime \"Rocketman\", yahawe Igihembo cya Oscar cy'indirimbo nziza. Bernie Taupin yabaye kandi umunyabugeni."}
{"id": "23755", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23755", "title": "Umurenge wa Gatsata", "text": "Umurenge wa Gatsata ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gatsata wari utuwe n'abaturage 46 262. Ugizwe n'utugari 3. Muri uyu murenge hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Gatsata ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 6,02. Ugizwe n'utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gatsata wari utuwe n'abaturage 37 110. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 46 262. Abagabo bari 24 146. Abagore bari 22 116. Abaturage bose batuye mu mujyi.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMu Murenge wa Gatsata hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ku rwibutso rwa Gatsata habarurwa abazize Jenoside 513.\nIbidukikije.\nAmagaraje yo mu Murenge wa Gatsata asohora imyanda ihumanya. Iyo myanda ijya mu gishanga no mu mugezi wa Nyabugogo."}
{"id": "23756", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23756", "title": "Umurenge wa Gikomero", "text": "Umurenge wa Gikomero ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 5.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gikomero wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 630.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Gikomero ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ugizwe n'utugari 5:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gikomero wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 625. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 630."}
{"id": "23758", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23758", "title": "Umurenge wa Jabana", "text": "Umurenge wa Jabana ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 5.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Jabana wari utuwe n'abaturage 63 862. Muri uyu murenge hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Jabana.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Jabana ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 36,38. Ugizwe n'utugari 5:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Jabana wari utuwe n'abaturage 33 577. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 63 862.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMu Murenge wa Jabana hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Jabana. Ku rwibutso rwa Jabana habarurwa abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi 332."}
