{"id": "23760", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23760", "title": "Umurenge wa Kinyinya", "text": "Umurenge wa Kinyinya ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 4.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kinyinya wari utuwe n'abaturage 125 400. Muri uyu murenge hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kinyinya.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Kinyinya ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 24,20. Ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kinyinya wari utuwe n'abaturage 57 846. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 125 400.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMu Murenge wa Kinyinya hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kinyinya. Ruri i Murama. Muri uru rwibutso hashyinguwe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi 441."}
{"id": "23764", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23764", "title": "Rwanda Movie Awards", "text": "Rwanda Movie Awards ni ibihembo bya buri mwaka bihabwa abakora filime mu Rwanda. Byatangiye mu 2012. Bitegurwa na Ishusho Arts.\nKuva mu 2020, ibi bihembo byitwa Rwanda International Movie Awards (RIMA). Kuva icyo gihe, bihemba kandi filime n'abakinnyi bo mu mahanga.\nAmateka.\nRwanda Movie Awards.\nRwanda Movie Awards byatangiye mu 2012. Bitegurwa na Ishusho Arts. Jackson Mucyo ni we uyobora Ishusho Arts.\nMu Ukuboza 2014, Ishusho Arts yatangiye kwakira filime zo guhatanira ibihembo bya 2015. Byari ku nshuro ya kane. Filime zagombaga kuba zarakozwe n'Abanyarwanda mu 2014. Ibyiciro byari bine: filime ngufi, filime ndende, filime mbarankuru na filime z'uruhererekane. Icyiciro cya filime z'uruhererekane cyari gishya.\nIbihembo bibanzirizwa na Rwanda Movie Week. Muri iki cyumweru, abakinnyi ba filime bazenguruka igihugu. Bahura n'abakunzi babo. Mu 2015, Rwanda Movie Week yateganyijwe mu mijyi myinshi, nka Rubavu, Musanze, Huye na Rusizi.\nHari kandi igihembo cy'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane. Abaturage ni bo batora uwo mukinnyi. Mu 2017, Aline Munezero yari umwe mu bakinnyi b'abagore bahataniraga iki gihembo.\nRwanda International Movie Awards.\nMu 2020, ibihembo byabaye ku nshuro ya karindwi. Byahinduye izina biba Rwanda International Movie Awards. Jackson Mucyo yavuze ko ibihembo byabaye mpuzamahanga. Filime n'abakinnyi bo mu mahanga na bo bashobora guhembwa. Rwanda Movie Week ya 2020 yatangiriye i Nyamata ku ya 21 Gashyantare 2020. RIMA ya mbere yabaye muri Werurwe 2020.\nMu 2023, ibihembo byabaye ku nshuro ya munani. Byari ibihembo 30, mu byiciro bine: filime ndende, filime ngufi, filime z'uruhererekane na filime mbarankuru. Umuhango wabaye ku ya 1 Mata 2023, muri Crown Conference. Jeannette Bahavu yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane. Yahawe imodoka. Emmanuel Mugisha yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza. Roger Niyoyita yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuyobozi wa filime mwiza. Mu cyiciro mpuzamahanga, Ini Edo na IK Ogbonna bo muri Nijeriya baratsinze."}
{"id": "23765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23765", "title": "Jackson Mucyo", "text": "Jackson Mucyo (cyangwa Mucyo Jackson) ni Umunyarwanda ukora mu ruganda rwa sinema. Ni umuyobozi wa Ishusho Arts.\nIshusho Arts itegura ibihembo bya Rwanda Movie Awards. Kuva mu 2020, ibi bihembo byitwa Rwanda International Movie Awards (RIMA).\nUmwuga.\nJackson Mucyo ayobora Ishusho Arts. Ishusho Arts ni ikigo cya sinema cyo mu Rwanda. Cyashinzwe muri Kanama 2011. Gitegura ibihembo bya Rwanda Movie Awards. Ibi bihembo byatangiye mu 2012. Ikinyamakuru \"The New Times\" cyo mu 2025 kivuga ko Mucyo ari we washinze RIMA.\nMu 2016, Rwanda Movie Awards zatanzwe ku nshuro ya gatanu. Mucyo yavuze ko abahatana bagomba no guturuka hanze y'u Rwanda. Yavuze ko ibihembo byahabwaga abantu bamwe buri gihe. Yasabye abakora filime kwita ku bwiza bw'ibikorwa byabo. Yasabye kandi abafana, abikorera na Leta gushyigikira sinema nyarwanda.\nMu 2020, ibi bihembo byabaye mpuzamahanga. Byiswe Rwanda International Movie Awards (RIMA). Mucyo yari umuhuzabikorwa wa RIMA. Yavuze ko abakora filime bo mu Rwanda batangiye guhatana mu maserukiramuco mpuzamahanga. Yavuze kandi ko hazabaho umunota wo guceceka bibuka umukinnyi Denis Nsanzamahoro.\nMu Gushyingo 2021, Mucyo yitabiriye itangizwa ry'urubuga Vugafrica.rw. Uru rubuga rugenewe abanditsi ba filime. Mucyo yavuze ko igihe kigeze ngo abanditsi ba filime bungukire mu byo bakora. Mu Kuboza 2021, yatangaje ko umukinnyi ukunzwe n'abantu (\"People's Choice\") azahembwa imodoka.\nMuri Mutarama 2023, Mucyo yasobanuye ko ibihembo bya 2022 byasubitswe. Impamvu zirimo icyorezo cya COVID-19 n'amabwiriza yagongaga abashyitsi baturutse hanze.\nMu Kuboza 2025, Mucyo yitabiriye iKON Activate i Kigali. Iki gikorwa gitegurwa n'ibihembo bya iKON Awards byo muri Ubugande."}
{"id": "23766", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23766", "title": "The Bride (filime)", "text": "The Bride ni filime yo mu Rwanda yasohotse mu 2023. Yayobowe kandi yandikwa na Myriam Uwiragiye Birara. Ni yo filime ndende ya mbere yakoze. Ivuga ku muco wa \u00abguterura\u00bb, aho umukobwa ashimutwa agashyingirwa ku gahato.\nIyi filime yerekanywe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya Berlinale mu 2023. Yahawe ibihembo mu maserukiramuco menshi, harimo FESPACO mu 2025.\nInkuru.\nInkuru ibera mu cyaro cy'u Rwanda mu 1997, hashize imyaka itatu habaye Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Eva ni umukobwa ukiri muto. Yifuza kwiga ubuvuzi. Umugabo witwa Silas aramushimuta, akamufata ku ngufu. Hanyuma Eva ashyingirwa ku gahato. Eva aba mu rugo rumwe n'umugabo we na mubyara w'umugabo we. Eva n'uwo mubyara baba inshuti. Eva amenya uko Jenoside yagize ingaruka ku muryango w'umugabo we.\nIkorwa rya filime.\nMyriam Uwiragiye Birara yashingiye inkuru ku byabaye ku bagore bo mu muryango we, bashyingiwe ku gahato. Mbere yaho, yari yarakoze filime ngufi \"HOME\" (2021).\nSandra Umulisa, murumuna w'umuyobozi wa filime, ni we ukina Eva. Aline Amike yatoranyijwe binyuze ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Amashusho yafashwe na Bora Shingiro."}
{"id": "23769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23769", "title": "Ini Edo", "text": "Ini Edo (amazina yose: Iniobong Edo) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Nijeriya. Akina muri filime za Nollywood, uruganda rwa filime rwo muri Nijeriya.\nMu 2023, Ini Edo yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza mu cyiciro mpuzamahanga muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUmwuga.\nIni Edo yatangiye gukina filime mu 2000. Filime ye ya mbere ni \"Thick Madam\". Yamenyekanye cyane mu 2004, muri filime \"World Apart\". Mu 2019, ikinyamakuru \"The Guardian\" cyo muri Nijeriya cyamwise umwe mu bakinnyi ba Nollywood bakunzwe cyane.\nMu 2023, Ini Edo yari umwe mu batunganyije filime y'uruhererekane \"Shanty Town\". Iyi filime yacaga kuri Netflix. Ini Edo yakinnyemo uruhare rwa Inem.\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, Ini Edo yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza mu cyiciro mpuzamahanga (\"Best Actress International\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards. Umukinnyi w'umugabo watsinze muri icyo cyiciro ni IK Ogbonna, na we wo muri Nijeriya.\nMu 2024, Ini Edo yatangaje itariki filime y'uruhererekane \"Fairytale Wedding\" izasohokeraho."}
{"id": "23770", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23770", "title": "IK Ogbonna", "text": "IK Ogbonna (amazina yose: Ikechukwu Mitchel Ogbonna; yavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1984) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Nijeriya. Akina muri filime za Nollywood. Ni n'umunyamideli.\nMu 2023, IK Ogbonna yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza mu cyiciro mpuzamahanga muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nIK Ogbonna yavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1984. Akomoka muri Leta ya Abia, mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba bwa Nijeriya. Yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye muri Leta ya Lagos. Yize sosiyoloji muri Kaminuza ya Jos.\nUmwuga.\nIK Ogbonna yatangiye gukina filime mu 2013. Filime ye ya mbere ni \"Love Lorn\".\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, IK Ogbonna yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza mu cyiciro mpuzamahanga (\"Best Actor International\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards. Umukinnyi w'umugore watsinze muri icyo cyiciro ni Ini Edo, na we wo muri Nijeriya.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 2015, IK Ogbonna yashakanye na Sonia Morales. Babyaranye umuhungu. Batandukanye mu 2019."}
{"id": "23808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23808", "title": "Roger Niyoyita", "text": "Roger Niyoyita ni umuyobozi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Ayobora filime z'uruhererekane, nka \"The Bishop's Family\" na \"Shuwa Dilu\".\nMu 2023, Niyoyita yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuyobozi wa filime mwiza muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nNiyoyita yakuriye i Ruhengeri, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru. Se yari afite inzu yerekanirwamo filime. Niyoyita yakundiye filime muri iyo nzu akiri muto. Mu 2015, yari amaze gukora ku mishinga myinshi ya filime yo mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nNiyoyita yayoboye filime y'uruhererekane \"The Bishop's Family\". Iyi filime yakozwe na Zacu Entertainment. Yatambutse kuri Zacu TV no kuri YouTube. Niyoyita yakoze kandi filime ndende \"Igeno ryanjye\".\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, Niyoyita yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuyobozi wa filime mwiza wo mu Rwanda (\"Best Local Director\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards, kubera \"The Bishop's Family\". \"Igeno ryanjye\" yatsindiye igihembo cy'inkuru nziza (\"Best Screenplay\").\nMu 2024, Niyoyita yayoboye filime y'uruhererekane isetsa \"Shuwa Dilu\". Iyi filime yakozwe na Zacu TV. Abakinnyi bayo barimo Niyitegeka Gratien."}
{"id": "23836", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23836", "title": "The Bishop's Family", "text": "The Bishop's Family ni filime y'uruhererekane yo mu Rwanda. Yakozwe na Zacu Entertainment. Yayobowe na Roger Niyoyita. Itambuka kuri Zacu TV no kuri YouTube.\nMu 2023, \"The Bishop's Family\" yatsindiye igihembo cya filime y'uruhererekane nziza muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Iki gihembo cyatanzwe muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nInkuru.\n\"The Bishop's Family\" ivuga ku mupasiteri witwa Bishop Dan. Umugore we yitwa Jane. Abakirisitu b'itorero babona Jane nk'umupagani, kubera amateka ye. Amateka ya Jane akomeza kumukurikirana. Jane na Bishop Dan bagomba gukemura ibibazo byabo, kugira ngo umuryango wabo udasenyuka. Bafite abana batatu: umuhungu w'imfura n'abakobwa babiri.\nIyi filime yerekana uko imiryango ishobora kubana neza. Ivuga kandi ku kubabarirana hagati y'abashakanye.\nAmateka.\nGufata amashusho no kuyatunganya byatangiye muri Nzeri 2022. \"The Bishop's Family\" yatangiranye na Zacu TV, kuri Canal+ (shene ya 38). Buri sezo ifite ibice 13. Buri gice kimara iminota itarenga 30.\nKu ya 2 Gashyantare 2023, Zacu Entertainment yatangiye kuyitambutsa kuri YouTube. Byari ku bantu bari hanze ya Afurika, badashobora kureba Zacu TV. Misago Nelly Wilson uyobora Zacu Entertainment yavuze ko ari filime nziza Abanyarwanda bakwitega kureba.\nIbihembo.\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023 habaye Rwanda International Movie Awards. \"The Bishop's Family\" yatsindiye igihembo cya filime y'uruhererekane nziza muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (\"Best Series East Africa\"). Roger Niyoyita yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuyobozi wa filime mwiza (\"Best Director\"). Iradukunda Abouba Ibra yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza wungirije (\"Best Supporting Actor\")."}
{"id": "23837", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23837", "title": "Abouba Iradukunda", "text": "Abouba Iradukunda ni umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Yakinnye muri filime z'uruhererekane nka \"Bamenya\", \"City Maid\" na \"The Bishop's Family\". Yanditse kandi ayobora filime ye ya mbere, \"Indushyi\".\nMu 2023, Abouba Iradukunda yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza wungirije muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nInshuti ya Abouba Iradukunda yashyize ifoto ye ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Umuyobozi wa filime w'umugore yabonye iyo foto. Yabonye ko Abouba Iradukunda asa n'umukinnyi yashakaga muri filime ye. Nyuma, undi muyobozi wa filime yamuhaye uruhare. Abouba Iradukunda yasinye amasezerano ya filime ye ya mbere.\nAbabyeyi be babanje kubyanga. Batinyaga ko gukina filime byamuteza ibibazo. Batinyaga kandi ko kwamamara byamuhindura. Nyuma babonye ko atahindutse, baramushyigikira.\nUmwuga.\nAbouba Iradukunda yakinnye muri filime \"Bamenya\", \"City Maid\", \"The Bishop's Family\", \"Agahinda ka Liza\", \"Maya\" na \"Isi Dutuye\". Ni umwe mu bakinnyi bakuru ba \"The Bishop's Family\". Yanditse kandi ayobora filime ye ya mbere, \"Indushyi\".\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, Abouba Iradukunda yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza wungirije (\"Best Supporting Actor\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards. Mu 2024, yavuze ko ashaka gukorera no ku isoko mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "23838", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23838", "title": "Umurenge wa Gashari", "text": "Umurenge wa Gashari ni umwe mu mirenge 13 igize Akarere ka Karongi, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gashari wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 263. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nUmurenge wa Gashari ni umwe mu mirenge 13 y'Akarere ka Karongi. Ku rubuga City Population, uyu murenge witwa Gishari.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gashari wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 904. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 263. Abagabo bari 10 156. Abagore bari 11 107. Abana bari munsi y'imyaka 18 bari 9 436.\nUmurenge wa Gashari utuwe na 5,7 % by'abaturage b'Akarere ka Karongi. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "23848", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23848", "title": "Umurenge wa Kibeho", "text": "Umurenge wa Kibeho ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kibeho wari utuwe n'abaturage 25 885. Ni wo murenge wonyine w'Akarere ka Nyaruguru ufite abaturage batuye mu mujyi. Kibeho izwi kubera amabonekerwa ya Bikira Mariya.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Kibeho ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyaruguru.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kibeho wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 456. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 25 885. Abagabo bari 12 326. Abagore bari 13 559.\nMu 2022, abaturage 7 641 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 18 244 batuye mu cyaro. Kibeho ni wo murenge wonyine w'Akarere ka Nyaruguru ufite abaturage batuye mu mujyi.\nIngoro ya Bikira Mariya.\nKibeho izwi kubera amabonekerwa ya Bikira Mariya. Amabonekerwa yatangiye ku wa 28 Ugushyingo 1981, ku ishuri ryo i Kibeho.\nKu wa 29 Kamena 2001, Musenyeri Augustin Misago wa Diyosezi Gatolika ya Gikongoro yemeje ko amabonekerwa y'abakobwa batatu ari ay'ukuri. Abo bakobwa ni Alphonsine Mumureke, Nathalie Mukamazimpaka na Marie-Claire Mukangango."}
{"id": "23849", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23849", "title": "Umurenge wa Kimihurura", "text": "Umurenge wa Kimihurura ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kimihurura wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 425. Ugizwe n'utugari 3. Muri uyu murenge hari inyubako ya Kigali Convention Centre.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Kimihurura ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 5,07. Ugizwe n'utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kimihurura wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 672. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 425. Abagabo bari 8 599. Abagore bari 7 826. Abaturage bose batuye mu mujyi. Umubare w'abaturage wagabanutse hagati ya 2012 na 2022.\nAhantu nyaburanga.\nMu Murenge wa Kimihurura hari inyubako ya Kigali Convention Centre. Iyi nyubako yatangiye kubakwa mu 2009. Yafunguwe muri Nyakanga 2016. Yatwaye amadolari y'Amerika arenga miliyoni 300.\nMu Kuboza 2019, kuri Kigali Convention Centre hashyizwe urwibutso rwo kurwanya ruswa. Ni igishusho cy'icyuma gifite ishusho y'ikiganza. Cyakozwe n'umuhanzi Ahmed Al-Bahrani.\nMu Murenge wa Kimihurura hari kandi inyubako y'Umutwe w\u2019Abadepite. Hari na Ingoro ndangamurage y'amateka y'urugamba rwo guhagarika Jenoside."}
{"id": "23850", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23850", "title": "Umurenge wa Rwezamenyo", "text": "Umurenge wa Rwezamenyo ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rwezamenyo wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 14 754. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 4. Mu 2018, wabaye uwa mbere mu Mujyi wa Kigali mu isuku n\u2019umutekano.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Rwezamenyo ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rwezamenyo wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 16 763. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 14 754. Abagabo bari 7 556. Abagore bari 7 198. Abaturage bose bari batuye mu mujyi.\nMu 2022, abaturage 3 552 bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15. Abaturage 10 813 bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64. Abaturage 389 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga.\nIsuku n\u2019umutekano.\nKu wa 1 Kamena 2018, Umurenge wa Rwezamenyo wabaye uwa mbere mu Mujyi wa Kigali mu bukangurambaga bw\u2019isuku n\u2019umutekano. Wahembwe imodoka yo mu bwoko bwa Mahindra."}
{"id": "23851", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23851", "title": "Umurenge wa Kigali", "text": "Umurenge wa Kigali ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kigali wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 61 499. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 5. Abaturage bawo benshi batuye mu mujyi. Abandi batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Kigali ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 5:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kigali wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 30 023. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 61 499. Abagabo bari 32 124. Abagore bari 29 375. Abaturage 44 185 bari batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 17 314 bari batuye mu cyaro.\nMu 2022, abaturage 22 404 bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15. Abaturage 38 004 bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64. Abaturage 1 091 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga.\nUbwikorezi.\nMu Kagari ka Nyabugogo no mu nkengero zako hari ibikorwa by\u2019ubwikorezi. Bihuza ibice bitandukanye by\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali n\u2019izindi ntara z\u2019u Rwanda."}
{"id": "23852", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23852", "title": "Byumba", "text": "Byumba ni umujyi uri mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Uri mu Akarere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru. Uyu mujyi witwa kandi umujyi wa Gicumbi.\nByumba iri nko muri kilometero 60 mu majyaruguru ya Kigali. Ni umujyi wa kabiri mu bunini mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru. Igice kinini cyawo kiri mu Murenge wa Byumba.\nAmateka.\nKugeza mu 2006, Byumba yari umurwa mukuru wa Perefegitura ya Byumba. Mu 2002, perefegitura zahindutse intara. Ku wa 1 Mutarama 2006, u Rwanda rwavuye ku ntara 12 rujya ku ntara 5. Intara ya Byumba yavuyeho. Igice kinini cyayo cyashyizwe mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru.\nImiterere.\nByumba iri mu karere k'imisozi miremire. Ubutumburuke bwaho buri hagati ya metero 1 800 na 2 500. Ikirere cyaho kirakonja.\nByumba iri nko muri kilometero 60 mu majyaruguru ya Kigali. Iri nko muri kilometero 30 z'umuhanda uvuye i Gatuna, ku mupaka n'Ubugande.\nUmujyi wa Gicumbi ni wo mujyi wa kabiri mu bunini mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, nyuma ya Musanze. Igice kinini cyawo kiri mu Murenge wa Byumba. Ikindi gice kiri mu Murenge wa Kaniga.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, abaturage 19 270 bo mu Murenge wa Byumba babaga mu mujyi.\nUbukungu.\nAbaturage benshi batunzwe n'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi. Ubucuruzi bwo mu mujyi ni bwo bubinjiriza amafaranga cyane. Mu mujyi hubakwa inyubako nshya. Hubakwa kandi imihanda ya kaburimbo.\nIbigo by'ingenzi.\nByumba ni icyicaro cya Diyosezi Gatolika ya Byumba. Iyi diyosezi yashinzwe ku wa 5 Ugushyingo 1981.\nKaminuza y'Ikoranabuhanga n'Ubugeni ya Byumba (UTAB) iri i Byumba. Ibitaro bya Byumba na byo biri muri uyu mujyi.\nUmuryango \"SOS Children's Villages\" wita ku bana b'imfubyi. Watangiye gukorera i Byumba mu 1997."}
{"id": "23857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23857", "title": "Mireille Igihozo", "text": "Mireille Igihozo ni umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Azwi muri filime z'uruhererekane \"Indoto\" na \"Ishusho ya Papa\". Muri \"Indoto\", akina yitwa Phionah.\nMu 2023, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza wungirije muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUmwuga.\nMbere ya 2019, Mireille Igihozo yari umutetsi. Yakundaga sinema. Yabonye kuri Facebook ko ishuri Kigali Film and Television School (KFTV) rishaka abakinnyi bashya. Yitabiriye icyo gikorwa. Yinjiye muri sinema mu mpera za 2019.\nYakinnye muri filime nka \"Matayo High School\", \"Seven Friends\" na \"My Aunt\". Muri \"Ishusho ya Papa\", akina yitwa Gihozo. Muri \"Indoto\", akina yitwa Phionah. Yakinnye kandi muri \"Good Book, Bad Cover\" ya Alliah Cool.\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza wungirije (\"Best Supporting Actress\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards, kubera \"Indoto\".\nMu 2024, yavuze ko akomeje akazi ko gukora imigati na keke muri hoteli. Agafatanya na sinema."}
{"id": "23859", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23859", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyamata", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyamata ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Bugesera, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 5. Muri uyu murenge harimo umujyi wa Nyamata.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyamata wari utuwe n'abaturage 81 480.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Nyamata ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Bugesera. Ugizwe n'utugari 5:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyamata wari utuwe n'abaturage 34 922. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 81 480. Abagabo bari 40 096. Abagore bari 41 384. Abaturage 65 107 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 16 373 batuye mu cyaro. Ubuso bw'umurenge ni kilometero kare 94,9. Umurenge wa Nyamata ni wo ufite abaturage benshi mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Bugesera.\nUmujyi wa Nyamata.\nUmujyi wa Nyamata uri muri uyu murenge. Ni umwe mu mijyi itatu yunganira Kigali. Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamata ruri muri uyu mujyi."}
{"id": "23907", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23907", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Birira", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Birira ni ikiyaga cyo mu Rwanda. Giherereye mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba.\nIkiyaga cya Birira kiri mu biyaga byo mu kibaya cy'Akagera yo haruguru.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Birira kiri mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, hafi y'Umurenge wa Rukumberi. Kiri ku butumburuke bwa m 1 330. Kizwi kandi ku mazina ya Bilira na Birara.\nIkiyaga cya Birira kiri mu itsinda ry'ibiyaga byo mu kibaya cy'Akagera yo haruguru. Iryo tsinda ririmo kandi Ikiyaga cya Mugesera, Ikiyaga cya Muhazi n'Ikiyaga cya Sake."}
{"id": "23908", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23908", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Hago", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Hago ni ikiyaga cyo mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Kiri muri Pariki y'Akagera, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba.\nIkiyaga cya Hago gifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 16,1. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo ntiburenga metero 5,8. Kiri mu biyaga byo mu kibaya cy'Akagera yo hepfo. Muri iki kiyaga hakorerwa uburobyi.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Hago kiri mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Kiri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 285. Kiri ku ntera ya kilometero 32 mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'umujyi wa Gahini.\nIkiyaga cya Hago kiri muri Pariki y'Akagera. Gifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 16,1. Uburebure bwacyo ni kilometero 6. Ubugari bwacyo ni kilometero 5,8. Inkombe zacyo zifite uburebure bwa kilometero 33,5. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugera kuri metero 5,8. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugereranyije ni metero 4,5. Kirimo metero kibe miliyoni 45 z'amazi.\nIkiyaga cya Hago kiri mu itsinda ry'ibiyaga byo mu kibaya cy'Akagera yo hepfo. Ibyo biyaga biri hepfo y'Isumo rya Rusumo. Iryo tsinda ririmo kandi Ikiyaga cy'Ihema, Ikiyaga cya Kivumba n'Ikiyaga cya Nasho. Ibiyaga byose by'iryo tsinda bifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 178,4.\nUburobyi.\nMu kiyaga cya Hago hakorerwa uburobyi. Mu 1975\u20131976, abarobyi bari 6. Muri icyo gihe, umusaruro w'amafi wari toni 90 ku mwaka."}
{"id": "23909", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23909", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Karago", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Karago ni ikiyaga gito cyo mu Rwanda. Giherereye mu Akarere ka Nyabihu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba.\nIkiyaga cya Karago kiri ku butumburuke burenga m 2 300. Mu mwaka wa 2022, bashyizemo amagi y'amafi kugira ngo umusaruro wiyongere.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Karago giherereye mu Karere ka Nyabihu. Kiri ku butumburuke burenga m 2 300. Gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 0,3. Uburebure bwacyo ntarengwa ni km 1. Ubugari bwacyo ntarengwa ni m 500. Cyakira amazi y'umugezi wa Nyamukongoro. Nta mugezi ugisohokamo.\nUburobyi.\nIkiyaga cya Karago kiri hejuru cyane. Ni yo mpamvu kibamo amafi make.\nMu Gushyingo 2022, bashyizemo amagi 3 000 y'amafi yo mu bwoko bwa \"carpe\". Byari byitezwe ko azongera umusaruro."}
{"id": "23910", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23910", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Kivumba", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Kivumba ni ikiyaga cyo mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Kiri muri Pariki y'Akagera.\nIkiyaga cya Kivumba kiri mu biyaga byo mu kibaya cyo hasi cy'umugezi w'Akagera. Ntikigira ubujyakuzimu bunini.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Kivumba kiri muri Pariki y'Akagera. Kiri mu biyaga byo mu kibaya cyo hasi cy'Akagera. Ibyo biyaga bifite amazi ashyushye, adashinga kandi akungahaye ku ntungamubiri.\nIkiyaga gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 8,7. Gifite uburebure bwa km 5,2 n'ubugari bwa km 3,5. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugera kuri m 5,6. Ubujyakuzimu buringaniye ni m 4,2. Kibika amazi angana na m\u00b3 miliyoni 30,3. Inkombe zacyo zifite uburebure bwa km 18,2.\nUburobyi.\nMu 1975, ku Kiyaga cya Kivumba hari abarobyi 5."}
{"id": "23911", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23911", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Mpanga", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Mpanga ni ikiyaga cyo mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Umurenge wa Mpanga, mu Akarere ka Kirehe, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba.\nIkiyaga cya Mpanga kiri mu biyaga byo mu kibaya cyo hasi cy'umugezi w'Akagera. Kitwa kandi Rwampanga.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Mpanga kiri mu biyaga byo mu kibaya cyo hasi cy'Akagera. Ibyo biyaga bifite amazi ashyushye, adashinga kandi akungahaye ku ntungamubiri.\nIkiyaga gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 9,5. Gifite uburebure bwa km 7 n'ubugari bwa km 2,2. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugera kuri m 7. Ubujyakuzimu buringaniye ni m 5,2.\nUburobyi.\nMu 1975\u20131976, ku Kiyaga cya Mpanga hari abarobyi 30. Mu 1975, barobye toni 30 z'amafi."}
{"id": "23916", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23916", "title": "C\u00e9cile Kyenge", "text": "C\u00e9cile Kyenge (amazina yose: C\u00e9cile Kashetu Kyenge; yavutse ku wa 28 Kanama 1964) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umutaliyani. Ni umuganga w'amaso. Yavukiye i Kambove muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nKuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2014, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yari Minisitiri ushinzwe kwinjiza abimukira mu muryango. Ni we mwirabura wa mbere wabaye minisitiri mu Butaliyani. Kuva mu 2014 kugeza mu 2019, yari umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Ubumwe bw'Ibihugu by'i Burayi.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nC\u00e9cile Kyenge yavutse ku wa 28 Kanama 1964. Yavukiye i Kambove, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu 1983, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yagiye mu Butaliyani kwiga ubuvuzi. Yize muri Kaminuza Gatolika y'Umutima Mutagatifu (Universit\u00e0 Cattolica del Sacro Cuore) i Roma. Nyuma yaho, yize ubuvuzi bw'amaso i Modena. Yabaye umuganga w'amaso.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2002, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yashinze umuryango witwa DAWA. Uyu muryango uteza imbere imibanire y'imico itandukanye. C\u00e9cile Kyenge yinjiye muri politiki mu 2004, mu karere ka Emilia-Romagna. Mu 2009, yatorewe kuba umujyanama w'Intara ya Modena. Yari mu ishyaka Partito Democratico (Ishyaka rya Demokarasi).\nMuri Gashyantare 2013, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yatorewe kuba umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Ubutaliyani. Ku wa 28 Mata 2013, Minisitiri w'Intebe Enrico Letta yamugize Minisitiri ushinzwe kwinjiza abimukira mu muryango. C\u00e9cile Kyenge yabaye umwirabura wa mbere wabaye minisitiri mu Butaliyani. Yavuye kuri uwo mwanya mu 2014.\nIgihe yari minisitiri, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yibasiwe n'amagambo y'ivanguramoko. Bamwe bamuteye imineke mu nama za politiki. Mu 2013, umusenateri Roberto Calderoli yamugereranyije n'inguge yitwa orang-outan. Mu 2019, urukiko rw'i Bergamo rwakatiye Roberto Calderoli igifungo cy'amezi 18. Icyaha cye cyari ugusebanya gushingiye ku ivanguramoko.\nKuva ku wa 1 Nyakanga 2014 kugeza ku wa 1 Nyakanga 2019, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yari umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Ubumwe bw'Ibihugu by'i Burayi. Yari mu itsinda ry'Abasosiyalisiti n'Abademokarate (S&amp;D). Mu 2019, C\u00e9cile Kyenge yongeye kwiyamamaza. Ntiyatowe. Nyuma yaho, yasubiye mu buvuzi. Mu 2021, yabaye umuganga rusange hafi y'umujyi wa Padova.\nC\u00e9cile Kyenge yashakanye n'injeniyeri w'Umutaliyani. Bafitanye abakobwa babiri."}
{"id": "23917", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23917", "title": "Amsterdam", "text": "Amsterdam ni umurwa mukuru w'Ubuholandi. Ni na wo mujyi utuwe cyane mu gihugu. Icyicaro cya guverinoma ntikiri i Amsterdam. Kiri mu mujyi wa Den Haag (La Haye).\nAmsterdam iri mu Ntara ya Holland y'Amajyaruguru. Ituwe n'abaturage barenga 940,000. Uyu mujyi uzwiho imiyoboro y'amazi myinshi. Agace k'imiyoboro yo mu kinyejana cya 17 kari ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nAmsterdam yatangiye ari umudugudu muto w'abarobyi mu kinyejana cya 13. Kugira ngo birinde imyuzure, abaturage bubatse urugomero ku uruzi rwa Amstel. Byabaye ahagana mu 1270. Izina Amsterdam rikomoka kuri urwo rugomero rwo ku ruzi rwa Amstel. Amsterdam yahawe uburenganzira bwo kuba umujyi mu 1306.\nMu kinyejana cya 17, Amsterdam yabaye ihuriro rikomeye ry'ubucuruzi mu Burayi. Mu gihe cy'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, Ubudage bwigaruriye Amsterdam. Abayahudi 107,000 bajyanywe mu nkambi bavuye mu Buholandi. Nibura 102,000 muri bo bishwe. Anne Frank n'umuryango we bihishe mu nzu iri ku muyoboro wa Prinsengracht. Iyo nzu ubu yitwa Anne Frank Huis. Isurwa n'abantu barenga miliyoni buri mwaka.\nImiterere n'abaturage.\nImiyoboro y'amazi igabanya Amsterdam mu birwa bigera kuri 90. Ibiraro birenga 1,300 bihuza ibyo birwa. Agace k'imiyoboro kitwa Grachtengordel kubatswe mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 16 no mu kinyejana cya 17. Kashyizwe ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO mu 2010.\nKu itariki ya 1 Mutarama 2026, Amsterdam yari ituwe n'abaturage 942,504.\nUbuyobozi.\nMeya wa Amsterdam ni Femke Halsema. Yatangiye uwo murimo mu 2018. Ni we mugore wa mbere wabaye meya w'uyu mujyi. Inama njyanama y'umujyi yasabye ko yongera gushyirwaho kugeza nibura mu 2030.\nUmuco.\nAmsterdam ifite inzu ndangamurage nyinshi. Rijksmuseum, Van Gogh Museum na Stedelijk Museum ziri ku kibuga cyitwa Museumplein.\nAmsterdam izwi nk'umujyi w'amagare. Muri uyu mujyi hari amagare menshi kurusha abaturage."}
