{"id": "23923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23923", "title": "Moi, le dernier Tutsi", "text": "Moi, le dernier Tutsi (mu Kinyarwanda: \"Jyewe, Umututsi wa nyuma\") ni igitabo cy'ubuhamya. Cyanditswe na Charles Habonimana afatanyije na Daniel Le Scornet. Cyasohotse mu 2019 mu Bufaransa, gisohowe na Plon.\nIgitabo kivuga ku buzima bw'umwanditsi mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Icyo gihe, Charles Habonimana yari afite imyaka 12.\nIbikubiye mu gitabo.\nCharles Habonimana yavutse mu 1982. Yavukiye i Mayunzwe, mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda. Mu 1994, Charles yari afite imyaka 12.\nKu wa 19 Mata 1994, Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo yavugiye ijambo i Butare. Igitabo kivuga kuri iryo jambo. Nyuma yaryo, abaturanyi b'Abahutu batangiye kwica Abatutsi.\nKu wa 24 Mata 1994, abicanyi bishe se, C\u00e9lestin, imbere ye. Bishe kandi Fidel, wo mu muryango we. Nyina, Odette, n'abavandimwe be barindwi na bo barishwe.\nSebuhuku yari umuyobozi w'abicanyi ku musozi wabo. Sebuhuku yategetse ko Charles aticwa ako kanya. Yashakaga ko Charles aba \u00abUmututsi wa nyuma\u00bb. Charles yagombaga kwicwa nyuma y'Abatutsi bose bo mu gace.\nSebuhuku yishe umuryango wa Charles. Ariko Sebuhuku yabaye kandi umurinzi wa Charles. Francine, umugore wa Sebuhuku, yarinze Charles uko ashoboye. Charles yarokotse Jenoside.\nKwandika igitabo.\nCharles yatanze ubuhamya bwe mu magambo imyaka myinshi, mu nama zo ku isi hose. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2000, yatangiye kwandika ubuhamya bwe mu Kinyarwanda. Mu mpera za 2016, yahuye na Daniel Le Scornet mu Bufaransa. Bombi biyemeje kwandika igitabo mu Gifaransa.\nIsohoka.\nPlon yasohoye igitabo ku wa 21 Werurwe 2019. Ku wa 23 Mata 2019, Charles Habonimana yamuritse igitabo i Kigali. Muri Mata 2019 kandi, ikinyamakuru \"Jeune Afrique\" cyagiranye ikiganiro na Charles Habonimana ku gitabo cye.\nKu wa 22 Ukwakira 2020, Pocket yongeye gusohora igitabo. Mu 2024, ikinyamakuru \"Le Grand Continent\" cyashyize iki gitabo ku rutonde rw'ibitabo byo gusoma kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23924", "revid": "5728", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23924", "title": "Karbamazepini", "text": "Karbamazepini, igurishwa ku izina ry'ubucuruzi rya Tegretol n'andi, ni umuti ugabanya ububabare bw'imitsi ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura igicuri n'ububabare bw'imitsi. Ikoreshwa mu ndwara ya schizophrenia hamwe n'indi miti ndetse n'umuti wa kabiri mu ndwara ya bipolar. Carbamazepine isa nkaho ikora neza nka phenytoin na valproate mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe n\u2019izisanzwe. Ntabwo bigira ingaruka nziza ku ndwara yo kubura cyangwa indwara yo mu mutwe.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi no gusinzira. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo uduheri ku ruhu, kugabanuka k'umusemburo w'amagufwa, gutekereza kwiyahura, cyangwa urujijo. Ntibikwiye gukoreshwa ku bantu bafite amateka yo kugira ibibazo by'umusemburo w'amagufwa. Gukoresha imiti mu gihe utwite bishobora kwangiza umwana; icyakora, guhagarika imiti ku bagore batwite bafite igicuri ntibyemewe. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo konsa. Abafite ibibazo by'impyiko cyangwa umwijima bagomba kwitonda.\nKarbamazepini yavumbuwe mu 1953 n'umuhanga mu bya shimi w'Umusuwisi witwa Walter Schindler. Yatangiye kugurishwa mu 1962. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe, kandi nta na kimwe muri byo gihembeye. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Igiciro cy\u2019igurishwa ry\u2019ibicuruzwa mu bihugu biri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere kiri hagati y\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika 0.07 na 0.24 ku munsi guhera mu 2015. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 176 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni eshatu."}
{"id": "23925", "revid": "5728", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23925", "title": "Kolera", "text": "Kolera ni indwara iterwa n'udukoko tumwe na tumwe twa bagiteri ya \"Vibrio cholerae\". Ibimenyetso bishobora kuva kuri nta na kimwe, kugeza ku byoroheje cyangwa bikomeye. Ikimenyetso gisanzwe ni impiswi nyinshi y'amazi imara iminsi mike. Kuruka no kuribwa mu mitsi nabyo bishobora kubaho. Impiswi ishobora kuba mbi cyane ku buryo mu masaha make ishobora gutuma umuntu abura amazi menshi kandi akagira ikibazo cy\u2019amashanyarazi adahagije. Ibi bishobora gutuma amaso agwa, uruhu rukonje, uruhu rugabanuka, ndetse n'amaboko n'ibirenge bikagira iminkanyari. Kubura amazi mu mubiri bishobora gutuma uruhu ruhinduka ibara ry'umukara. Ibimenyetso bitangira nyuma y'amasaha abiri kugeza ku minsi itanu nyuma yo guhura n'iki cyorezo.\nKolera iterwa n'ubwoko butandukanye bwa \"Vibrio cholerae\", hamwe n'ubwoko bumwe butera indwara zikomeye kurusha ubundi. Ikwirakwizwa ahanini n'amazi mabi n'ibiribwa bibi byandujwe n'imyanda y'abantu irimo bagiteri. Ibiryo byo mu nyanja bidatetse neza ni isoko ikunze kuboneka. Abantu ni bo nyamaswa bonyine bahura n\u2019iki kibazo. Ibintu bishobora gutera iyi ndwara birimo isuku nke, amazi meza yo kunywa adahagije, n'ubukene. Hari impungenge ko kwiyongera k'amazi yo mu nyanja bizatuma indwara ziyongera. Kolera ishobora gupimwa hakoreshejwe ikizamini cy'umwanda. Ikizamini cyihuse cyo gupima amaraso kirahari ariko ntabwo ari cyo cy\u2019ukuri.\nUburyo bwo kwirinda kolera burimo kunoza isuku no kubona amazi meza. Urukingo rwa kolera bitangwa mu kanwa bitanga uburinzi bukwiye mu gihe cy'amezi atandatu. Bafite inyungu yo kurinda ubundi bwoko bw'impiswi buterwa na \"E.\u00a0coli\". Uburyo bw'ibanze bwo kuvura ni ukuvura amazi mu kanwa \u2014gusimbuza ibinyobwa n'ibinyabutabire biryoshye kandi biryoshye gato. Ibisubizo bishingiye ku muceri ni byo byiza cyane. Inyongeramusaruro ya zinc ingirakamaro ku bana. Mu bihe bikomeye, hashobora kuba ngombwa ko umuntu ahabwa amazi yo mu mitsi, nka Ringer's lactate, kandi imiti yica udukoko nka doxycycline ishobora kuba ingirakamaro. Gusuzuma kugira ngo harebwe antibiyotike Kolera ishobora kwibasirwa n\u2019indwara ishobora gufasha mu guhitamo.\nKolera yibasira abantu bagera kuri 1.3 kugeza kuri 4\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu ku isi yose kandi bigatuma abantu 21.000\u2013143.000\u00a0impfu ku mwaka. Nubwo byashyizwe mu cyiciro cy'icyorezo, ni gake cyane mu bihugu byateye imbere. Abana ni bo bibasirwa cyane. Kolera igaragara haba mu bice bimwe na bimwe by\u2019umubiri ndetse no mu bice bimwe na bimwe by\u2019umubiri. Uduce dufite ibyago bikomeje kurwara harimo Afurika n'Amajyepfo y'Uburasirazuba bwa Aziya. Ingaruka z'urupfu mu bahuye n'iki kibazo akenshi ziba ziri munsi ya 1% ariko zishobora kugera kuri 5%. Kutabona uburyo bwo kuvurwa bitera impfu nyinshi. Ibisobanuro bya kolera biboneka mu kinyejana cya 5 mbere ya Yesu mu rurimi rw'Abasanskriti. Inyigo ya kolera mu Bwongereza yakozwe na John Snow hagati ya 1849 na 1854 yatumye habaho iterambere rikomeye mu bijyanye n'ibyorezo. Icyorezo kinini cy'indwara zirindwi byabayeho mu myaka 200 ishize, abantu babarirwa muri za miriyoni bapfuye."}
{"id": "23926", "revid": "5728", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23926", "title": "Ubushobozi bwo kwifata mu mutwe (autism)", "text": "Autism is a developmental disorder characterized by difficulties with social interaction and communication, and by restricted and repetitive behavior. Parents often notice signs during the first three years of their child's life. These signs often develop gradually, though some children with autism experience worsening in their communication and social skills after reaching developmental milestones at a normal pace.\nIndwara ya Autism ifitanye isano n'uruvange rw'ibintu bigize imiterere y'umubiri n'ibidukikije. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago mu gihe cyo gutwita birimo indwara zimwe na zimwe, nka rubela, uburozi burimo aside valproic, inzoga, kokayine, imiti yica udukoko, lisansi, n'ihumana ry'ikirere, kugabanya imikurire y'umwana uri mu nda, hamwe n'indwara ziterwa n'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri. Impaka zishingiye ku zindi mpamvu zishingiye ku bidukikije zivugwa; urugero, igitekerezo cy\u2019urukingo, cyamaze kwemezwa. Indwara ya Autism igira ingaruka ku itunganywa ry'amakuru mu bwonko n'uburyo uturemangingo tw'imitsi n'imiyoboro ya synapse bihurira kandi bigatunganywa; uburyo ibi bibaho ntabwo bwumvikana neza. Igitabo cy\u2019Isuzuma n\u2019Ibarurishamibare ku ndwara zo mu mutwe (DSM-5), gihuza autisme n\u2019ubwoko budakomeye bw\u2019iyi ndwara, harimo Asperger syndrome n\u2019indwara y\u2019iterambere ikwirakwira idasobanuwe ukundi (PDD-NOS) mu gusuzuma indwara ya autism spectrum disorder (ASD).\nUburyo bwo kuvura imyitwarire hakiri kare cyangwa uburyo bwo kuvuga bushobora gufasha abana bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe kwiyitaho, kubana neza n'abandi, no kuvugana n'abandi. Nubwo nta muti uzwi uhari, habayeho abana bakize. Bamwe mu bantu bakuru bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe ntibashobora kubaho bigenga. Umuco w\u2019indwara ya autisme warateye imbere, aho bamwe bashaka ubuvuzi abandi bakemera ko autisme ikwiye kwemerwa nk'itandukaniro rigomba kwitabwaho aho gukira.\nKu isi yose, autisme ivugwa ko yibasira abantu miliyoni 24.8. Mu myaka ya 2000, umubare w\u2019abantu banduye wabarirwaga kuri 1-2 ku bantu 1.000 ku isi yose. Mu bihugu byateye imbere, abana bagera kuri 1.5% basanzwe barwaye ASD, uvuye kuri 0.7% mu 2000 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ikunze kugaragara inshuro enye kugeza kuri eshanu ku bagabo kurusha abagore. Umubare w'abantu banduye wariyongereye cyane kuva mu myaka ya 1960, ibi bikaba bishobora kuba byaratewe n'impinduka mu mikorere yo gusuzuma indwara. Ikibazo cyo kumenya niba ibiciro nyabyo byiyongereye ntikirakemuka."}
{"id": "23927", "revid": "5728", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23927", "title": "Indwara y'ibihaha", "text": "Indwara y'ibihaha yari indwara yandura iterwa n'imwe muri virusi ebyiri, imwe nkuru yitwa variyola na nindi yitwa variyola ntoya. Umurwayi wa nyuma usanzwe yagaragaye mu Ukwakira 1977, maze Umuryango Mpuzamahanga wita ku Buzima (OMS) wemeza ko iyi ndwara yaciwe burundu ku isi mu 1980. Ingaruka z'urupfu nyuma yo kwandura iyi ndwara zari hafi 30%, aho umubare w'abana bato wari uri hejuru. Akenshi abarokotse iyi ndwara wasangaga bafite inkovu nyinshi ku ruhu rwabo, ikindi bamwe muri bo basigaranye ubuhumyi.\nIbimenyetso bya mbere by\u2019iyi ndwara byari birimo umuriro no kuruka. Ibi bigakurwa no kugaragara kw'ibisebe mu kanwa no kuzana uduheri ku ruhu. Mu minsi myinshi, ibibyimba byo ku ruhu byahindutse utubyimba twuzuye amazi hamwe n'aho hagati hapfutse. Hanyuma ibibyimba byaracitse biragwa, bisiga inkovu. Iyi ndwara yakwirakwijwe hagati y'abantu cyangwa binyuze mu bintu byanduye. Kwirinda byakorwaga ahanini n'urukingo rwa smallpox. Iyo indwara imaze kugaragara, imiti imwe n'imwe igabanya ubukana bw'imiti ishobora kuba yarafashije.\nInkomoko y'indwara y'ingutu ntabwo izwi. Ibimenyetso bya mbere by'iyi ndwara ni ibyo mu kinyejana cya 3 mbere ya Yesu mu maremare yo mu Misiri. Iyi ndwara yakunze kubaho mu bihe by\u2019icyorezo. Mu Burayi bwo mu kinyejana cya 18, bivugwa ko abantu 400.000 bapfaga buri mwaka bazize iyi ndwara, kandi kimwe cya gatatu cy'abarwayi barwaye indwara yavuyemo ubuhumyi. Aba bapfuye barimo abami batandatu. Indwara y'ibicurane iravugwa ko yahitanye abantu bagera kuri 300\u00a0abantu miliyoni mu kinyejana cya 20 n'abagera kuri 500\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu mu myaka 100 ishize imaze ibayeho. Vuba aha mu 1967, 15\u00a0abantu miliyoni banduye buri mwaka.\nGutera indwara y'inkorora bisa nkaho byatangiye mu Bushinwa ahagana mu myaka ya 1500. Uburayi bwafashe uyu muco ukomoka muri Aziya mu gice cya mbere cy'ikinyejana cya 18. Mu 1796, Edward Jenner yatangije urukingo rugezweho rwa smallpox. Mu 1967, OMS yongereye imbaraga mu kurandura iyi ndwara. Indwara y'inkorora ni imwe mu ndwara ebyiri zandura zaranduwe burundu, indi ikaba ari indwara y'inkorora mu 2011. Ijambo \"inkongoro\" ryakoreshejwe bwa mbere mu Bwongereza mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 16 kugira ngo ritandukanye indwara na syphilis, icyo gihe izwi nka \"inkongoro nini\". Andi mazina y\u2019amateka y\u2019iyi ndwara arimo pox, smallled monster, na red plague."}
{"id": "23928", "revid": "5728", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23928", "title": "Kwiyahura", "text": "Kwiyahura ni igikorwa cyo kwiyahura ukiyambura ubuzima nkana. Indwara zo mu mutwe harimo kwiheba, indwara ya bipolar, autism, schizophrenia, indwara zo mu mutwe, indwara zo guhangayika, no gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge - harimo n'inzoga n'ikoreshwa rya benzodiazepine - ni ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago. Kwiyahura bimwe na bimwe ni ibikorwa bitunguranye bitewe n'imihangayiko, urugero nk'ibibazo by'amafaranga, ibibazo by'imibanire nko gutandukana, cyangwa gutotezwa. Abagerageje kwiyahura mbere bari mu kaga gakomeye ko kugerageza kwiyahura mu gihe kizaza. Ibikorwa byiza byo gukumira kwiyahura birimo kugabanya uburyo bwo kwiyahura\u2014 nk'imbunda, ibiyobyabwenge n'uburozi; kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe n'ikoreshwa nabi ry'ibiyobyabwenge; gutangaza amakuru yitonze ku bijyanye no kwiyahura; no kunoza ubukungu. Nubwo imirongo yo gusaba ubufasha ku bibazo by\u2019ihungabana ikunze kugaragara, ntabwo yigwa neza.\nUburyo bukunze gukoreshwa mu kwiyahura buratandukanye bitewe n'ibihugu, kandi bufitanye isano n'uko hari uburyo bufatika bwo kubikora. Uburyo busanzwe bwo kwiyahura burimo kumanika, uburozi bw'imiti yica udukoko, n'imbunda. Kwiyahura byagize ingaruka ku rupfu rw\u2019abantu 828.000 ku isi mu 2015, ubwiyongere buvuye ku rupfu rw\u2019abantu 712.000 mu 1990. Ibi bituma kwiyahura ari byo bituma habaho impfu za 10 ku isi.\nAbantu bagera kuri 1.5% bapfa biyahuye. Mu mwaka runaka, ibi biba hafi 12 kuri buri bantu 100.000. Igipimo cy\u2019ubwiyahuzi bumaze kurangira muri rusange kiri hejuru mu bagabo kurusha mu bagore, kuva ku nshuro 1.5 kurusha mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere kugeza ku nshuro 3.5 mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere. Kwiyahura muri rusange bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bantu barengeje imyaka 70; icyakora, mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe, abafite hagati y'imyaka 15 na 30 ni bo bafite ibyago byinshi byo kwiyahura. Uburayi bwagize igipimo cyo hejuru cy\u2019ubwiyahuzi ukurikije akarere mu 2015. Hari abantu babarirwa muri 10 kugeza kuri 20\u00a0miliyoni z\u2019abantu bagerageza kwiyahura badapfa buri mwaka. Kugerageza kwiyahura bidahitana umuntu bishobora gutera imvune n'ubumuga bw'igihe kirekire. Mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba bw'Isi, kugerageza ni ibintu bikunze kugaragara mu rubyiruko no mu bagore.\nIbitekerezo byo kwiyahura byagizweho ingaruka n'ingingo zagutse z'ubuzima nko idini, icyubahiro, n'icyo ubuzima buvuze. Amadini ya Aburahamu asanzwe abona kwiyahura nk'icyaha ku Mana, bitewe n'uko yemera ko ubuzima ari ubwera. Mu gihe cy'ubutegetsi bwa samurai mu Buyapani, ubwoko bw'ubwiyahuzi buzwi nka seppuku (\"harakiri\") bwubahwaga nk'uburyo bwo guhomba cyangwa nk'uburyo bwo kwigaragambya. Sati, imigenzo yabujijwe n'Umwongereza Raj, yiteze ko umupfakazi w'Umuhinde yiyahura mu gihe umugabo we yari ashyinguwe n'umuriro, yaba abishaka cyangwa ashyizweho igitutu n'umuryango we ndetse n'umuryango we. Kwiyahura no kugerageza kwiyahura, nubwo mbere byari bitemewe n'amategeko, ntibikibaho mu bihugu byinshi by'Iburengerazuba bw'Isi. Biracyari icyaha gihanwa n'amategeko mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe. Mu kinyejana cya 20 n'icya 21, kwiyahura byakoreshejwe mu bihe bidasanzwe nk'uburyo bwo kwigaragambya, naho ibisasu bya kamikaze n'ibisasu by'abiyahuzi byakoreshejwe nk'amayeri ya gisirikare cyangwa iterabwoba."}
